45d4cd\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8102582\nCommit-Queue: David Baron \u003cdbaron@chromium.org\u003e\nReviewed-by: Joey Arhar \u003cjarhar@chromium.org\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1662965}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: c59d3cb5deeba1899c0c7f87f02d980192714cdb\nwpt-pr: 61332\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/html/semantics/menu/tentative/idlharness.https.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/interfaces/html-menu-elements.tentative.idl"], "git_node": "6d41b92f03eb20a361678ff3e25ed4bffd27f69a", "git_parents": ["3b338aba840a013684ca4bbfa31e53cb76abade4"], "node": "33a323a5dc168f1f78079b84b0f79de8a09150a5", "parents": ["432c51aff68a9c63aea727a0d7c2543e1649e87e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055433 [wpt PR 61332] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 61332\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/html/semantics/menu/tentative/idlharness.https.html.ini"], "git_node": "518311f9615ab21cb62e5b5d3ab9072af09e2576", "git_parents": ["6d41b92f03eb20a361678ff3e25ed4bffd27f69a"], "node": "9cc2488b7b1863cff657aefe4a6c68c973b8c0ba", "parents": ["33a323a5dc168f1f78079b84b0f79de8a09150a5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nate Chapin \u003cjaphet@chromium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055437 [wpt PR 61328] - Revert \"Use committed origin when deciding whether to dispatch navigate event\", a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nRevert \"Use committed origin when deciding whether to dispatch navigate event\"\n\nThis reverts commit e9affc6ab26af5cf394eb35668f84369301a43e9.\n\nReason for revert: Newly added test failing on linux-chromeos-chrome\n\nFailure Link: https://ci.chromium.org/ui/p/chrome/builders/ci/linux-chromeos-chrome/59302/overview\n\nOriginal change's description:\n\u003e Use committed origin when deciding whether to dispatch navigate event\n\u003e\n\u003e The committed origin can be opaque in sandboxed iframes, and is also\n\u003e pre-redirect.\n\u003e\n\u003e\n\u003e Bug: 511774376\n\u003e Change-Id: Ia5f4257a907274f24abb32186ae0e074eb488716\n\u003e Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8041464\n\u003e Reviewed-by: Charlie Reis \u003ccreis@chromium.org\u003e\n\u003e Commit-Queue: Noam Rosenthal \u003cnrosenthal@google.com\u003e\n\u003e Reviewed-by: Nate Chapin \u003cjaphet@chromium.org\u003e\n\u003e Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1662779}\n\nBug: 511774376\nChange-Id: I132d1e08b3b2c85b1ce1af09fed571215954e93b\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8104082\nOwners-Override: Nate Chapin \u003cjaphet@chromium.org\u003e\nAuto-Submit: Nate Chapin \u003cjaphet@chromium.org\u003e\nCommit-Queue: rubber-stamper@appspot.gserviceaccount.com \u003crubber-stamper@appspot.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\nBot-Commit: rubber-stamper@appspot.gserviceaccount.com \u003crubber-stamper@appspot.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1662971}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: c14c1594e0da0666f0b0fee8008fd7eb9ed0f722\nwpt-pr: 61328\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/navigation-api/navigate-event/cross-window/cross-document-history-traversal-from-sandboxed-opaque-origin.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/navigation-api/navigate-event/cross-window/resources/sandboxed-opaque-origin-step2.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/navigation-api/navigate-event/cross-window/resources/sandboxed-opaque-origin.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/navigation-api/navigate-event/cross-window/resources/sandboxed-opaque-origin.html.headers"], "git_node": "253e3b99a1afd6c3f123936e6f14bba12e7a7f93", "git_parents": ["518311f9615ab21cb62e5b5d3ab9072af09e2576"], "node": "b79048c4116269ce8abecf0423e24d6858c07a17", "parents": ["9cc2488b7b1863cff657aefe4a6c68c973b8c0ba"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ahmad Saleem \u003c52317531+Ahmad-S792@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055340 [wpt PR 61318] - WebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=250279, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nWebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=250279 (#61318)\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 671e7f0714ef486a73dd54fcbf13e04d6d9e6efe\nwpt-pr: 61318\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/webaudio/the-audio-api/the-pannernode-interface/panner-hrtf-negative-elevation.html"], "git_node": "3923910e90d1a8ea42b7e6f693021eedf1632861", "git_parents": ["253e3b99a1afd6c3f123936e6f14bba12e7a7f93"], "node": "3f8614b62f0122a6ab126faab877da87b8d928d3", "parents": ["b79048c4116269ce8abecf0423e24d6858c07a17"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Cameron McCormack \u003cheycam@apple.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2052089 [wpt PR 61032] - WebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=318306, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nWebKit export: View transition transform test fails due to float vs double blending precision (#61032)\n\nhttps://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=318306\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 43d18fead8867d8d372a1974252eb31ea9a6dfb7\nwpt-pr: 61032\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/dynamic-stylesheet-animations-timing-function.html"], "git_node": "9587bb34ac4343d93ebaba1de5a1c42a6d00aaf5", "git_parents": ["3923910e90d1a8ea42b7e6f693021eedf1632861"], "node": "49c6c766ccd0717bfd80024d4b080d9ebb73429c", "parents": ["3f8614b62f0122a6ab126faab877da87b8d928d3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2052089 [wpt PR 61032] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 61032\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-view-transitions/finished-promise-defers-cleanup.html.ini"], "git_node": "00f042927f10a28ec94275f34e06a296a3a972ba", "git_parents": ["9587bb34ac4343d93ebaba1de5a1c42a6d00aaf5"], "node": "7b5494e81071ee645a9d3d057bd94c5dfe8aa45e", "parents": ["49c6c766ccd0717bfd80024d4b080d9ebb73429c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Cameron McCormack \u003cheycam@apple.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2052413 [wpt PR 61057] - WebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=318401, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nWebKit export: Navigating away from a render-blocked document before it is revealed incorrectly reveals it and starts a cross-document view transition (#61057)\n\nhttps://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=318401\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 66efecaa645e2580e8f907c33a6ef390c4b399c0\nwpt-pr: 61057\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/navigation/resources/abort-before-render.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/navigation/reveal-after-aborted-navigation.html"], "git_node": "b26c52fa1f7169479e36555f4cf527883fcc17a9", "git_parents": ["00f042927f10a28ec94275f34e06a296a3a972ba"], "node": "ced1f61760630ee251ff42ecdd1c6890af9d20b3", "parents": ["7b5494e81071ee645a9d3d057bd94c5dfe8aa45e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2052413 [wpt PR 61057] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 61057\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-view-transitions/navigation/reveal-after-aborted-navigation.html.ini"], "git_node": "ae4c6198cfc04384ad127ea507e565643a084037", "git_parents": ["b26c52fa1f7169479e36555f4cf527883fcc17a9"], "node": "6617ff10ffc0997fc157566e7bd1ccd5b69d0f42", "parents": ["ced1f61760630ee251ff42ecdd1c6890af9d20b3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Oriol Brufau \u003cobrufau@igalia.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055022 [wpt PR 61288] - layout: Adjust the static position of abspos inside float in inline layout, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nlayout: Adjust the static position of abspos inside float in inline layout\n\nWhen we decide the position of a float within an inline formatting\ncontext, we need to adjust the static position of absolutely positioned\nelements inside the float.\n\nCo-authored-by: Martin Robinson \u003cmrobinson@igalia.com\u003e\nSigned-off-by: Oriol Brufau \u003cobrufau@igalia.com\u003e\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 86fe927eb76f55733c4846f63fe02c8adc2a6e14\nwpt-pr: 61288\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/CSS2/abspos/static-inside-float-inside-inline.html"], "git_node": "2f82f09d7ae74274058392f485eb621f1a86d543", "git_parents": ["ae4c6198cfc04384ad127ea507e565643a084037"], "node": "90cda7453df2ae7a4f757e9b9c9a4a4502977253", "parents": ["6617ff10ffc0997fc157566e7bd1ccd5b69d0f42"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Boris Chiou \u003cboris.chiou@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2050682 [wpt PR 60907] - [scroll-animations] Update the test of insets for the default ViewTimeline, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\n[scroll-animations] Update the test of insets for the default ViewTimeline. (#60907)\n\nTweak the test to check both 0% and 100%.\n\nNote that this fixed: https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/11644.\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 5509e63b23f1909bbeb7beef2e9778b4a00cf216\nwpt-pr: 60907\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/scroll-animations/view-timelines/view-timeline-snapport.html"], "git_node": "201cf0fe1170484c302e1809aba46382c6af533e", "git_parents": ["2f82f09d7ae74274058392f485eb621f1a86d543"], "node": "a1ec26fea50f3ebf13d6c21dec5630a0aff299c3", "parents": ["90cda7453df2ae7a4f757e9b9c9a4a4502977253"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2050682 [wpt PR 60907] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 60907\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/scroll-animations/view-timelines/view-timeline-snapport.html.ini"], "git_node": "b196eaad95bdf674fbef4e1730b045d540347f8a", "git_parents": ["201cf0fe1170484c302e1809aba46382c6af533e"], "node": "cca54c798cc47b69a795c4d3f06bd19850521b93", "parents": ["a1ec26fea50f3ebf13d6c21dec5630a0aff299c3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ahmad Saleem \u003c52317531+Ahmad-S792@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055504 [wpt PR 61337] - WebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=319189, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nWebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=319189 (#61337)\n--\n\nwpt-commits: d0f91d8c789f48783d203d386bba3ccf50294644\nwpt-pr: 61337\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/streams/readable-byte-streams/tee.any.js"], "git_node": "6410c8448097cf1a3d8562598fe129423c348b88", "git_parents": ["b196eaad95bdf674fbef4e1730b045d540347f8a"], "node": "f0a86779957f98c8db79e50c6b87e60a5ee5208d", "parents": ["cca54c798cc47b69a795c4d3f06bd19850521b93"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Fr\u00e9d\u00e9ric Wang N\u00e9lar \u003cfwang@igalia.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2053987 [wpt PR 61193] - Verify that \u003clink rel=\"compression-dictionary\u003e\" is body-ok, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nVerify that \u003clink rel=\"compression-dictionary\u003e\" is body-ok\n\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/#body-ok\nhttps://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/11620\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 9bc8141e0406b3018ee91490fa23be224f1ecab0\nwpt-pr: 61193\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/fetch/compression-dictionary/dictionary-fetch-with-link-element-in-body.tentative.https.html"], "git_node": "094bd8a57f24db889b3bfaa0f64059f93622ca00", "git_parents": ["6410c8448097cf1a3d8562598fe129423c348b88"], "node": "ded4a16e33d38c3564a6872c07e25188e3259128", "parents": ["f0a86779957f98c8db79e50c6b87e60a5ee5208d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Simon W\u00fclker \u003csimon.wuelker@arcor.de\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055414 [wpt PR 61324] - script: Initialize descriptor fields of css-connected FontFace objects, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nAdd web platform test\n\nSigned-off-by: Simon W\u00fclker \u003csimon.wuelker@arcor.de\u003e\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 3b3ef50c022a32131362a8254a60a8b8bc707d80\nwpt-pr: 61324\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-font-loading/fontface-css-connected-descriptors.html"], "git_node": "90a0f9bce17a81c3f5b49c1e6ac3853211efde87", "git_parents": ["094bd8a57f24db889b3bfaa0f64059f93622ca00"], "node": "381b9800e59c57f058cef893016f33e15094069a", "parents": ["ded4a16e33d38c3564a6872c07e25188e3259128"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Noam Rosenthal \u003cnrosenthal@chromium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055553 [wpt PR 61339] - TrustedParserOptions: return a new sanitizer in each call, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nTrustedParserOptions: return a new sanitizer in each call\n\nThis is instead of retaining a frozen copy.\nSee https://github.com/w3c/trusted-types/pull/606\n\nBug: 491743369\nChange-Id: Ida4d1a661edb8475cbc4a1b2ce0d0e3d38913024\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8097523\nReviewed-by: Daniel Vogelheim \u003cvogelheim@chromium.org\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Noam Rosenthal \u003cnrosenthal@google.com\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1663095}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: c1e067e2346c22c0fc98bafed6618c3d92b06af0\nwpt-pr: 61339\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/domparsing/tentative/stream-html-with-trusted-types-pass-trusted.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/sanitizer-api/sethtml-with-trustedtypes-immutable.tentative.html"], "git_node": "030a6cac49ac91508f6258f484c703e94b0051a1", "git_parents": ["90a0f9bce17a81c3f5b49c1e6ac3853211efde87"], "node": "fb333d32edcd0cc45de0c39ba056bf5a3f04b40f", "parents": ["381b9800e59c57f058cef893016f33e15094069a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jon Surrell \u003csirreal@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2054526 [wpt PR 61253] - Add integration point CDATA tests, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nAdd integration point CDATA tests\n\nSee https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/4016\n--\n\nwpt-commits: a58eb9886b49d95f64b240c1c75c1bac788998a5\nwpt-pr: 61253\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/html/syntax/parsing/resources/html5test-com.dat"], "git_node": "338c6c2ea683c6da979ffaca3000ac0aaf8d979d", "git_parents": ["030a6cac49ac91508f6258f484c703e94b0051a1"], "node": "d196a960444127553523b906433b1eb61b112059", "parents": ["fb333d32edcd0cc45de0c39ba056bf5a3f04b40f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Kevin Babbitt \u003ckbabbitt@microsoft.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055561 [wpt PR 61340] - Fix crash converting unresolved angle to CalculationExpressionNode, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nFix crash converting unresolved angle to CalculationExpressionNode\n\nWhen a trigonometric function's angle argument cannot be simplified at\nparse time (for example because it contains sibling-index()/\nsibling-count()), the trigonometric function node is preserved as a\nCSSMathExpressionOperation and only converted to a\nCalculationExpressionNode later, during style resolution.\n\nAngles are represented using the Pixels value of a PixelsAndPercent node\nbut we were missing a case for converting them. This CL adds that case.\n\nFixed: 534823412\nChange-Id: I1702aeba70c13cf46772495ee2913bd966444a0a\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8103142\nCommit-Queue: Kevin Babbitt \u003ckbabbitt@microsoft.com\u003e\nReviewed-by: Daniil Sakhapov \u003csakhapov@chromium.org\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1663120}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: a0f6b702a0eaaa00ea1e414fdfbcc6d09f958454\nwpt-pr: 61340\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-values/tree-counting/trig-functions-in-gradient-position.html"], "git_node": "482c6831f0e4dcbefd3aebc703f7c9723f5213d4", "git_parents": ["338c6c2ea683c6da979ffaca3000ac0aaf8d979d"], "node": "3bba1f42d3dee52db90acf4d1f0ca1e1c9488d6a", "parents": ["d196a960444127553523b906433b1eb61b112059"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Justin Lulejian \u003cjustinlulejian@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055351 [wpt PR 61321] - [Extensions] Move test event listener registration to after install, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\n[Extensions] Move test event listener registration to after install (#61321)\n\nPR #60541[1] changed listener registration to occur before test\nextension install to accommodate Chrome's implementation. However, this\nunwittingly broke Safari. Safari requires that the test extension be\ninstalled before the test event listeners can be registered. When they\nare registered before they do not fire at all. This didn't affect\nFirefox which continued to run extension WPT successfully.\n\nAfter this commit we revert back to the listener registration before\nthe above change. Safari should now fire test events successfully. I\nalso did some associated cleanup and added a couple clarifying\ncomments.\n\nThis will intentionally break Chrome for extension WPT temporarily\nuntil Chrome's test event queuing impl is implemented in\nhttps://crrev.com/c/8087101.\n\n[1]: https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/commit/08558510b11e31f06558e2d1ba4cac02442a3392\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 4edc28ed6ed8872270ed084738f8da6a0fef728c\nwpt-pr: 61321\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/resources/web-extensions-helper.js"], "git_node": "a77572c3c40b88c28d20fa1dcd747669434e1e03", "git_parents": ["482c6831f0e4dcbefd3aebc703f7c9723f5213d4"], "node": "2cd53c788dd413202c7dcc3bdb0831a213a999ef", "parents": ["3bba1f42d3dee52db90acf4d1f0ca1e1c9488d6a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "francovs \u003c34865963+francovs@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055582 [wpt PR 61342] - WebKit export of bug: https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=304475, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nWebKit export (with linter fixes) from bug: Text highlighting range is wrong for truncated RTL text (#61342)\n\nCo-authored-by: Alan Baradlay \u003czalan@apple.com\u003e\n--\n\nwpt-commits: a295e829a8c346faafc9f7cdd6c126108cf29be7\nwpt-pr: 61342\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-ui/text-overflow-with-selection-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-ui/text-overflow-with-selection.html"], "git_node": "e197ff6960dce58bddc0cd8f0ac5c81d606f9fd7", "git_parents": ["a77572c3c40b88c28d20fa1dcd747669434e1e03"], "node": "ff2a9dd91ff3fb658263d753370cd699edead3ec", "parents": ["2cd53c788dd413202c7dcc3bdb0831a213a999ef"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055582 [wpt PR 61342] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 61342\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-ui/text-overflow-with-selection.html.ini"], "git_node": "ecc2462a073dc09084724d3a287a93282d0896c0", "git_parents": ["e197ff6960dce58bddc0cd8f0ac5c81d606f9fd7"], "node": "0ae80b48b19af68bb48699364283d5a0633c1d7f", "parents": ["ff2a9dd91ff3fb658263d753370cd699edead3ec"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Blink WPT Bot \u003cblink-w3c-test-autoroller@chromium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2050331 [wpt PR 60880] - [css-view-transitions] Reland: Fix race in mismatched-snapshot test, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\n[css-view-transitions] Reland: Fix race in mismatched-snapshot test (#60880)\n\nThis is a reland of commit 7f5ace573c37876289ee3cd1fd81797edd71beae with\na modified fix to resolve the race condition on Mac.\n\nThe original fix waited for compositor ready in the popup before\nnotifying the opener. This was still flaking on Mac13 bots.\n\nThe new fix changes the navigation coordination: instead of the harness\ninitiating the navigation on the popup from the outside, the old popup\nwaits until it is compositor-ready and then navigates itself. This\navoids racing the navigation request with the browser observing the old\npopup's view-transition opt-in status.\n\nOriginal change's description:\n\u003e [css-view-transitions] Fix race in mismatched-snapshot skips test\n\u003e\n\u003e Wait for 2 requestAnimationFrames in the popup before navigating.\n\u003e This ensures the page is revealed (first paint) and its transition\n\u003e opt-in is registered in the browser before the navigation starts,\n\u003e preventing a null viewTransition on the new page.\n\nBug: 524290990\nChange-Id: If9d91b783598bab0d61f22ac976b3b3955883908\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/7985128\nCommit-Queue: Free Debreuil \u003cfreedebreuil@google.com\u003e\nReviewed-by: Vladimir Levin \u003cvmpstr@chromium.org\u003e\nAuto-Submit: Free Debreuil \u003cfreedebreuil@google.com\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1651968}\n\nCo-authored-by: Free Debreuil \u003cfreedebreuil@google.com\u003e\n--\n\nwpt-commits: d9a788528c7101cd80ab3c70ea975a2e460f06e8\nwpt-pr: 60880\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/navigation/mismatched-snapshot-containing-block-size-skips.html"], "git_node": "1c9bfea70ab1ff7584c105abe4680b2b2419a78f", "git_parents": ["ecc2462a073dc09084724d3a287a93282d0896c0"], "node": "914ce9646c1e43bd8ed11f388105fcdc16474012", "parents": ["0ae80b48b19af68bb48699364283d5a0633c1d7f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Adam Pace \u003capace@outlook.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2050710 [wpt PR 60917] - WebRTC: Fix broken setRemoteDescription(invalidOffer) rollback test, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\n[webrtc] Fix broken setRemoteDescription(invalidOffer) rollback test (#60917)\n\nCo-authored-by: Adam Pace \u003cAjp121@users.noreply.github.com\u003e\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 0510bcc94f8f984b8bcf63d4c4f8b831b306dc3a\nwpt-pr: 60917\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/webrtc/RTCPeerConnection-setRemoteDescription-offer.html"], "git_node": "29ea64cf37a873a6112fd6f8b0d679f457ce42eb", "git_parents": ["1c9bfea70ab1ff7584c105abe4680b2b2419a78f"], "node": "833b855042192d2026895f94d78da8aeb2ecfeb6", "parents": ["914ce9646c1e43bd8ed11f388105fcdc16474012"], "tags": []}, {"au