 ["f523450c70c981a6809447f3ab25177cadce44bc"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Blink WPT Bot \u003cblink-w3c-test-autoroller@chromium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055218 [wpt PR 61310] - Update the event-timing WPT to make failures more useful., a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nUpdate the event-timing WPT to make failures more useful. (#61310)\n\nAlso delay the frame resize until the corresponding event handler is\nadded.\n\nBug: 397737222\nChange-Id: I2db5cea6e4c1b29c8a307e83ca08b5d4f597116d\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8093862\nReviewed-by: Kevin Ellis \u003ckevers@chromium.org\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Mustaq Ahmed \u003cmustaq@chromium.org\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1662575}\n\nCo-authored-by: Mustaq Ahmed \u003cmustaq@google.com\u003e\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 5a8d13dc2c8066a07668d0e3f8499010e45b77f0\nwpt-pr: 61310\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/html/webappapis/scripting/event-loops/new-scroll-event-dispatched-at-next-updating-rendering-time.html"], "git_node": "777ba53e8984b7fc6db8289bdcf7a62c48d09fd0", "git_parents": ["6c131b38fff672f837a09cb5d99b99e2e6679d2a"], "node": "db67a9b5efc0488932bd006412802cb3073f94f0", "parents": ["ee135d2017e7ccc4182bad9c3706f2ba8d2d7789"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Blink WPT Bot \u003cblink-w3c-test-autoroller@chromium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055294 [wpt PR 61315] - Update fuzzy matching on clip-path-shape-011.html, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nUpdate fuzzy matching on clip-path-shape-011.html (#61315)\n\nThis test needs a tiny bit more fuzziness.\n\nFixed: 526503299, 484322474\nChange-Id: I923f7d35380acbd1b2dbd788d34a19b21c3bf077\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8096103\nCommit-Queue: Noam Rosenthal \u003cnrosenthal@google.com\u003e\nAuto-Submit: Philip Rogers \u003cpdr@chromium.org\u003e\nReviewed-by: Noam Rosenthal \u003cnrosenthal@google.com\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Philip Rogers \u003cpdr@chromium.org\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1662754}\n\nCo-authored-by: Philip Rogers \u003cpdr@chromium.org\u003e\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 459ebd4af0552317f8d96c094b1509ae4f47313b\nwpt-pr: 61315\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-masking/clip-path/clip-path-shape-011.html"], "git_node": "b166ccf85a7a47d44916edf39513f06454f382fd", "git_parents": ["777ba53e8984b7fc6db8289bdcf7a62c48d09fd0"], "node": "07727169604838ba61786a5bd0625fe74fbfbd0d", "parents": ["db67a9b5efc0488932bd006412802cb3073f94f0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "alice \u003c89223922+tangalice@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055024 [wpt PR 61289] - WebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=316882, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nWebKit export: CSS object-view-box: implement rendering and natural sizes (#61289)\n\nhttps://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=316882\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 7def19f43977805285a50516db4404e8fbc28138\nwpt-pr: 61289\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-images/object-view-box-auto-size-relayout-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-images/object-view-box-auto-size-relayout.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-images/object-view-box-zoom-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-images/object-view-box-zoom.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/object-view-box-new-image.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/object-view-box-old-image.html"], "git_node": "e27d639db1733e2fc3b25ea67542ad8feffdd265", "git_parents": ["b166ccf85a7a47d44916edf39513f06454f382fd"], "node": "15427461ce38d270de2749bd14ad9014546f01e6", "parents": ["07727169604838ba61786a5bd0625fe74fbfbd0d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055024 [wpt PR 61289] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 61289\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-images/object-view-box-auto-size-relayout.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-images/object-view-box-zoom.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-view-transitions/window-resize-aborts-transition-before-ready.html.ini"], "git_node": "c50df18510300bf096f7335bc1e8ff3a761464d6", "git_parents": ["e27d639db1733e2fc3b25ea67542ad8feffdd265"], "node": "27143e4dea429d9e6386b698d6ee1b64f1b96410", "parents": ["15427461ce38d270de2749bd14ad9014546f01e6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Alison Maher \u003calmaher@microsoft.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055438 [wpt PR 61329] - [Masonry] Container fragmentation support, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\n[Masonry] Container fragmentation support\n\nThis CL adds support for grid-lanes container fragmentation.\n\nFragmentation of grid-lanes items will be handled in follow-up CLs.\n\nSimilar to CL:8020862, but for grid-lanes.\n\nBug: 343257585\nChange-Id: I1da1c260928f12bcf12407723023227075b64784\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8102962\nCommit-Queue: Alison Maher \u003calmaher@microsoft.com\u003e\nReviewed-by: Ian Kilpatrick \u003cikilpatrick@chromium.org\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1663150}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 3ee1a16bc9c52ff5a27473d45f611dd8514c2a7a\nwpt-pr: 61329\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-break/grid/grid-lanes/grid-lanes-container-fragmentation-001.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-break/grid/grid-lanes/grid-lanes-container-fragmentation-002.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-break/grid/grid-lanes/grid-lanes-container-fragmentation-003.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-break/grid/grid-lanes/grid-lanes-container-fragmentation-004.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-break/grid/grid-lanes/grid-lanes-container-fragmentation-005.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-break/grid/grid-lanes/grid-lanes-container-fragmentation-006.html"], "git_node": "a44c89041680e218b85da1537fcc1b8346b4b13c", "git_parents": ["c50df18510300bf096f7335bc1e8ff3a761464d6"], "node": "5d6b3f0bdc20d4076014effeebc4f17d57ea7c24", "parents": ["27143e4dea429d9e6386b698d6ee1b64f1b96410"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055438 [wpt PR 61329] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 61329\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-break/grid/grid-lanes/grid-lanes-container-fragmentation-003.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-break/grid/grid-lanes/grid-lanes-container-fragmentation-004.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-break/grid/grid-lanes/grid-lanes-container-fragmentation-005.html.ini"], "git_node": "b8c57fb14e493271272ff56de56c2b4bdbb26ee9", "git_parents": ["a44c89041680e218b85da1537fcc1b8346b4b13c"], "node": "f44045181a243f8ba95753f1ce9608c34213c6d7", "parents": ["5d6b3f0bdc20d4076014effeebc4f17d57ea7c24"], "tags": []}, {"author": "carlosjeurissen \u003c1038267+carlosjeurissen@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2008614 [wpt PR 56993] - Add webExtension `runtime.getVersion()` test, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nAdd webExtension runtime.getVersion() (#56993)\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 09d8679592c080dd4d4794e45847a2f73df3a94c\nwpt-pr: 56993\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/web-extensions/resources/runtime/background.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/web-extensions/resources/runtime/manifest.json"], "git_node": "40cbe2f0b01191a94e5024556eec91598c03721b", "git_parents": ["b8c57fb14e493271272ff56de56c2b4bdbb26ee9"], "node": "7f4d7e8c27d60c9d66a4e4b068297e31846bfb0b", "parents": ["f44045181a243f8ba95753f1ce9608c34213c6d7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Fr\u00e9d\u00e9ric Wang N\u00e9lar \u003cfwang@igalia.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2054229 [wpt PR 61211] - Add test for processing of type attribute with \u003clink rel=compression-dictionary\u003e, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nAdd test for processing of type attribute with \u003clink rel=\"compression-dictionary\"\u003e\n\nrel=compression-dictionary does not have a default type, so it should\nalways fetch the link when the type is omitted. When the type is specified\nthe same is true if \"UA does support the given MIME type for the given link\nrelationship\" and \"even if that is not a valid MIME type string\". Details\ndon't seem to be specified but this test assumes UAs support any type for\nrel=compression-dictionary, which is what Chromium, Firefox and WebKit do.\n\nhttp://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/11620\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/#processing-the-type-attribute\n\n--\naddress review comments\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: cd05db335cb5def1c141fe68f5ad5baa1d0e714a, aa26903a9de470463e8b8ee6e733319baa547083\nwpt-pr: 61211\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/fetch/compression-dictionary/dictionary-fetch-with-type-attribute.tentative.https.html"], "git_node": "8915ff79d81607ba7c920b08db2089771b5babf1", "git_parents": ["40cbe2f0b01191a94e5024556eec91598c03721b"], "node": "2c98bfc534efb87cddce678ee9e0583e6b29ffb6", "parents": ["7f4d7e8c27d60c9d66a4e4b068297e31846bfb0b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Fr\u00e9d\u00e9ric Wang N\u00e9lar \u003cfwang@igalia.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2053195 [wpt PR 61119] - Test link rel=compression-dictionary header as early hints, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nTest link rel=compression-dictionary header as early hints\n\nSpec PR: https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/11620\n\nThis is currently only implemented in Firefox but not covered by any test:\nhttps://searchfox.org/firefox-main/rev/5e465cbe324a291bb69aa85c5c4231e052cabe9a/netwerk/protocol/http/EarlyHintsService.cpp#106\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 27d2ee72d025342dd435074bc5f9b454d9d7191b\nwpt-pr: 61119\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/fetch/compression-dictionary/dictionary-fetch-with-link-element.tentative.https.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/fetch/compression-dictionary/dictionary-fetch-with-link-header-in-early-hints.tentative.https.h2.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/fetch/compression-dictionary/resources/compression-dictionary-util.sub.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/fetch/compression-dictionary/resources/dictionary-fetch-with-link-header-in-early-hints.tentative.https.h2.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/fetch/compression-dictionary/resources/early-hint-for-compression-dictionary-test-loader.h2.py"], "git_node": "5cecf54a8bfc1e45cfc8323156d2603ca26b2be6", "git_parents": ["8915ff79d81607ba7c920b08db2089771b5babf1"], "node": "02297ff55cd2def783bdb7b4739935660b7bb0e1", "parents": ["2c98bfc534efb87cddce678ee9e0583e6b29ffb6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "francovs \u003c34865963+francovs@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055425 [wpt PR 61325] - WebKit export of https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=299410, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nWebKit export: Percent height border-box content should get correct height in percent height cells (#61325)\n\nhttps://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=299410\n\nCo-authored-by: Alan Baradlay \u003czalan@apple.com\u003e\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 3be4046ebe46464ab68552bfed9926591dc87a69\nwpt-pr: 61325\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-ui/widget-percentage-height-001-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-ui/widget-percentage-height-001.html"], "git_node": "af9004b51aeec7441370de47fc7eb3e204206e4f", "git_parents": ["5cecf54a8bfc1e45cfc8323156d2603ca26b2be6"], "node": "39785770475fe15d72ef4db57c1824431d8699ed", "parents": ["02297ff55cd2def783bdb7b4739935660b7bb0e1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Daniel Clark \u003cdaniec@microsoft.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055735 [wpt PR 61349] - [Reference Target] Add HTMLTemplateElement.shadowRootReferenceTarget, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\n[Reference Target] Add HTMLTemplateElement.shadowRootReferenceTarget\n\nAdd the shadowRootReferenceTarget IDL property to HTMLTemplateElement\nreflecting the shadowrootreferencetarget content property.\n\nThe IDL property isn't really useful since shadowrootreferencetarget\nis only applicable to declarative shadow DOM, but this is consistent\nwith other properties like HTMLTemplateElement.shadowRootSerializable\nand is another option for feature-detecting reference target.\n\nBug: 346835896\nChange-Id: I4802fd5d7bf518a5d85f29f71efdf7ec37027159\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8093818\nReviewed-by: Mason Freed \u003cmasonf@chromium.org\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Dan Clark \u003cdaniec@microsoft.com\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1663151}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 343545b382d26332ee9618fb053567f383c47ce4\nwpt-pr: 61349\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/shadow-dom/reference-target/tentative/shadowrootreferencetarget-idl-reflection.html"], "git_node": "13ae7bec6b03760d8ed46a1605334e11042bc663", "git_parents": ["af9004b51aeec7441370de47fc7eb3e204206e4f"], "node": "9af7c26972a1d67eb5ce5f09232129ff7daf77a3", "parents": ["39785770475fe15d72ef4db57c1824431d8699ed"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055735 [wpt PR 61349] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 61349\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/shadow-dom/reference-target/tentative/shadowrootreferencetarget-idl-reflection.html.ini"], "git_node": "cd75478bca38793226256680041f70203c4ca266", "git_parents": ["13ae7bec6b03760d8ed46a1605334e11042bc663"], "node": "d2dcfa6fca07566a780e316a3dbdbb2faf3d3bc3", "parents": ["9af7c26972a1d67eb5ce5f09232129ff7daf77a3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055773 - [wpt-sync] Update web-platform-tests to 343545b382d26332ee9618fb053567f383c47ce4, a=testonly\n\nMANUAL PUSH: wpt sync bot