ea3e559ad645b89e3a9a80c7425ad"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Updatebot \u003cupdatebot@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2056457 - Update android nightly application-services version bump to 07a8bccd512121cb1bb25eef550509a0c3f28b16 r=release-managers,dmeehan\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313150\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/plugins/dependencies/src/main/java/ApplicationServices.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/plugins/dependencies/src/main/java/moz.yaml"], "git_node": "55d9e30e78fed89b9731624795a1303edff9f97c", "git_parents": ["a1756de19678df7d070481612f88b197d56b0be1"], "node": "4529f75faf8e27fb8640a3c4f0da492edfd112af", "parents": ["e4999dc2f608493a4301e2e2edefc814a598f8a7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "stransky \u003cstransky@redhat.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2047140 [Linux] Move source side of D&D operation to extra class nsDragSessionSource r=emilio\n\nNo code changes, only extract source D&D part to a new class.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D312056\n", "files": ["widget/gtk/moz.build", "widget/gtk/nsDragService.cpp", "widget/gtk/nsDragService.h", "widget/gtk/nsDragServiceGtk.h", "widget/gtk/nsDragServiceWayland.h", "widget/gtk/nsDragSessionSource.cpp", "widget/gtk/nsDragSessionSource.h", "widget/gtk/nsWindowWayland.cpp"], "git_node": "af613f7b311a779ae84017deba546d13883cee58", "git_parents": ["55d9e30e78fed89b9731624795a1303edff9f97c"], "node": "948427388a79303cf7faa820d947004727d737aa", "parents": ["4529f75faf8e27fb8640a3c4f0da492edfd112af"], "tags": []}, {"author": "stransky \u003cstransky@redhat.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2047140 [Linux] Keep D&D source GtkWidget live until D&D operations is finished r=emilio\n\nRecently we delete source GtkWidget while the D&D is still live. That may lead to various issues/crashes as\nGtk still renders and uses the widget surface etc.\n\nThe early delete was introduced as a hack for mem leak in Bug 219521. Let's fix that better.\n\nAlso fix logging build errors.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D312259\n", "files": ["widget/gtk/nsDragService.cpp", "widget/gtk/nsDragService.h", "widget/gtk/nsDragServiceGtk.h", "widget/gtk/nsDragServiceWayland.h", "widget/gtk/nsDragSessionSource.cpp", "widget/gtk/nsDragSessionSource.h", "widget/gtk/nsWindowWayland.cpp"], "git_node": "7fd7d34f4911729636ba7435bccdd347d1d55db3", "git_parents": ["af613f7b311a779ae84017deba546d13883cee58"], "node": "6e81b13fc1c4b46cf7de556f7ae997a234dc9448", "parents": ["948427388a79303cf7faa820d947004727d737aa"], "tags": []}, {"author": "AndiAJ \u003candiaj@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2056534 - Fix verifyTheTranslatePageSubMenuOptionTest efficiency UI test r=aaronmt\n\nThe UI test was failing because the translation sheet remained displayed for a prolonged time after clicking the \"Translate\" button\n\nTo fix this, I've increased the timeout for it to disappear from 15s to 25s\n\nThe UI test successfully passed 50x on Firebase \u2705\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313189\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/tests/MainMenuTest.kt"], "git_node": "287f44be15d4c5854f1a245467c21f0380491bbc", "git_parents": ["7fd7d34f4911729636ba7435bccdd347d1d55db3"], "node": "229203cc3b9cf4ff98f42feb88b321709532db79", "parents": ["6e81b13fc1c4b46cf7de556f7ae997a234dc9448"], "tags": []}, {"author": "rperta \u003crperta@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2047140 [Linux] Keep D&D source GtkWidget live until D&D operations is finished r=emilio\" for causing build bustages at nsDragService.cpp\n\nThis reverts commit 7fd7d34f4911729636ba7435bccdd347d1d55db3.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2047140 [Linux] Move source side of D&D operation to extra class nsDragSessionSource r=emilio\"\n\nThis reverts commit af613f7b311a779ae84017deba546d13883cee58.\n", "files": ["widget/gtk/moz.build", "widget/gtk/nsDragService.cpp", "widget/gtk/nsDragService.h", "widget/gtk/nsDragServiceGtk.h", "widget/gtk/nsDragServiceWayland.h", "widget/gtk/nsDragSessionSource.cpp", "widget/gtk/nsDragSessionSource.h", "widget/gtk/nsWindowWayland.cpp"], "git_node": "3393829e6b8cfc740575109857a20c3bbc036957", "git_parents": ["287f44be15d4c5854f1a245467c21f0380491bbc"], "node": "dc317e0f32bde39e6ea0d26aa98fd05cd2cf221f", "parents": ["229203cc3b9cf4ff98f42feb88b321709532db79"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Atila Butkovits \u003cabutkovits@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2055856 - Update gfx SanityTest to load with a resource:// URL in a content process. r=Gijs,gfx-reviewers,aosmond\" for causing failures at browser_all_files_referenced.js.\n\nThis reverts commit 704c491db19e1539e8217425c718718aa5567ead.\n", "files": ["dom/security/nsContentSecurityUtils.cpp", "toolkit/components/gfx/SanityTest.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/gfx/content/gfxFrameScript.js", "toolkit/components/gfx/content/sanitytest.html", "toolkit/components/gfx/jar.mn"], "git_node": "2d239f0663ea3f2199146a8afd435a3d3bbf5a9a", "git_parents": ["3393829e6b8cfc740575109857a20c3bbc036957"], "node": "e8b508d4f810af0bdd835ea57a556ba4cc02ba7d", "parents": ["dc317e0f32bde39e6ea0d26aa98fd05cd2cf221f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Atila Butkovits \u003cabutkovits@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2054145 - Apply PollJSSampling's JS engine calls without the thread data lock held, r=profiler-reviewers,canova.\" for causing failures at JitScript.h.\n\nThis reverts commit 724bca4b404c6fd9e9777839f82174a421a972ab.\n", "files": ["tools/profiler/core/ProfilerThreadRegistrationData.cpp", "tools/profiler/core/platform.cpp", "tools/profiler/public/ProfilerThreadRegistrationData.h"], "git_node": "6157cda96d86a96fea4863bca7a62e3a67bc7bc7", "git_parents": ["2d239f0663ea3f2199146a8afd435a3d3bbf5a9a"], "node": "d10a24ae44ea9a0