navigation/behavior/BehaviorTestPlanner.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/navigation/behavior/SelectorTemplate.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/navigation/behavior/shards/BehaviorShard01.kt", "mobile/android/test_infra/flank-configs/fenix/arm-tae-behavior-tests.yml", "mobile/android/test_infra/flank-configs/fenix/arm64-v8a-detect-leaks.yml", "mobile/android/test_infra/flank-configs/fenix/arm64-v8a.yml"], "git_node": "3193e38d4dd82b59a050e5647acf5f08840882d5", "git_parents": ["f9efb19bdb27f86b9ca5402b60fe772f786d0194"], "node": "6cf67a31d179bbf338ce3bcfe7eb915ef758f39e", "parents": ["63c94bcefa8f05c4a9c237b47cb18fe1ca21dd1e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jackie Johnson \u003cjajohnson@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2056484 - Promote ui/efficiency shared infra out of navigation/planning/ into the navigation/ core and generation/ r=aaronmt\n\nPure move/refactor, no logic changes. First of the two remaining P2b-4\ndiffs (the examples/ -\u003e devtools/ consolidation is the other). Promotes the\nshared non-dev-tool contents of the navigation/planning/ catch-all:\n\n  navigation/planning/PageCatalog.kt              -\u003e navigation/PageCatalog.kt        (core)\n  navigation/planning/NavigationTestPlanner.kt    -\u003e generation/NavigationTestPlanner.kt\n  navigation/planning/DisplayLabels.kt            -\u003e generation/DisplayLabels.kt\n  navigation/planning/ShardUtils.kt               -\u003e generation/ShardUtils.kt\n  navigation/planning/NavigationGraphBootstrap.kt -\u003e generation/NavigationGraphBootstrap.kt\n\nRepoints all importers to the new packages.\n\nLeaves navigation/ as a clean 4-file core: the graph model (NavigationEdge,\nNavigationRegistry, NavigationStep) + page discovery (PageCatalog, which\nstays because helpers/BaseTest uses it). Everything about building test\ncases lives in generation/: NavigationTestPlanner (case-planner),\nDisplayLabels (toDisplayLabel, used only by generation), plus the\nalready-generation-only ShardUtils/NavigationGraphBootstrap. Confirmed via\ngrep that nothing in core or helpers/ references the planner or\ntoDisplayLabel, so keeping them out of core avoids a layering inversion.\n\nNo logic changes beyond package/import lines. No Flank change (nothing\nmoved is a shard class). navigation/planning/ now holds only the 3 dev-tool\nfiles, which the final P2b-4 diff moves to devtools/.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313161\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/examples/NavigationTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/generation/DisplayLabels.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/generation/NavigationGraphBootstrap.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/generation/NavigationTestPlanner.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/generation/ShardUtils.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/generation/behavior/BehaviorCaseFactory.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/generation/behavior/BehaviorCaseGenerator.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/generation/behavior/BehaviorShardData.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/generation/behavior/BehaviorTestPlanner.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/generation/interaction/InteractionCaseFactory.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/generation/interaction/InteractionShardData.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/generation/interaction/InteractionTestPlanner.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/generation/pairs/PairCaseFactory.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/generation/pairs/PairShardData.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/generation/reachability/ReachabilityCaseFactory.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/generation/reachability/ReachabilityShardData.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/helpers/BaseTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/navigation/PageCatalog.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/navigation/planning/DisplayLabels.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/navigation/planning/NavigationCaseGenerator.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/navigation/planning/NavigationGraphBootstrap.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/navigation/planning/NavigationTestPlanner.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/navigation/planning/NavigationTestPlannerLogger.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/navigation/planning/PageCatalog.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/navigation/planning/ShardUtils.kt"], "git_node": "ed98ae483845aa21684a54389df7ec6d0823fbfc", "git_parents": ["3193e38d4dd82b59a050e5647acf5f08840882d5"], "node": "5148b1c49bf5cf6db6eed73411f561825fa9a18a", "parents": ["6cf67a31d179bbf338ce3bcfe7eb915ef758f39e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jackie Johnson \u003cjajohnson@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2056537 - Consolidate ui/efficiency dev-tools into a devtools/ package (rename examples/, gather the generators) r=isabel_rios,aaronmt\n\nFinal P2b-4 diff; completes the Phase 2b reorg. Renames examples/ -\u003e\ndevtools/ (7 debug/test classes, package rename) and gathers all 5 dev-tool\nsource files into it from three packages:\n\n  navigation/planning/DevToolReport.kt            -\u003e devtools/DevToolReport.kt\n  navigation/planning/NavigationCaseGenerator.kt  -\u003e devtools/ReachabilityCaseGenerator.kt  (renamed)\n  navigation/planning/NavigationTestPlannerLogger.kt -\u003e devtools/ReachabilityPlanLogger.kt  (renamed)\n  generation/interaction/InteractionCaseGenerator.kt -\u003e devtools/InteractionCaseGenerator.kt\n  generation/behavior/BehaviorCaseGenerator.kt    -\u003e devtools/BehaviorCaseGenerator.kt\n\nClass renames drop the overloaded \"Navigation\" prefix to match the\nde-prefixed domain naming (method names / log tags left as-is, scoped out).\n\nInteraction/Behavior generators leave their domain packages, so they gain\nexplicit cross-package imports for the domain types they use; the shared\nDevToolReport helpers are same-package in devtools/ now, so those imports\ndrop; debug tests calling the renamed generators are repointed.\n\nUpdates all three Flank configs referencing the examples package\n(arm-experimental-api-tests.yml package; arm64-v8a.yml and\narm64-v8a-detect-leaks.yml notPackage): examples -\u003e devtools.\n\nConfirmed via grep no efficiency.examples or navigation.planning.* refs\nremain. This empties navigation/planning/ entirely, reaching the target\nstructure (navigation/ core, generation/ case-building, devtools/). Built +\nlinted locally.\n\nThis is P2b-4 (MTE-5686), Phase 2b (MTE-5652).\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313195\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/devtools/BehaviorCaseGenerator.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/devtools/BehaviorCaseGeneratorTest.kt"