 "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/base/ice_credentials_iterator_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/base/packet_transport_internal_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/base/port_allocator_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/base/tcp_port_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/channel_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/local_audio_source_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/rtcp_mux_filter_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/sctp_utils_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/test/fake_audio_capture_module_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/numerics/histogram_percentile_counter_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/numerics/moving_average_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/numerics/moving_max_counter_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/rate_statistics_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_tools/frame_analyzer/reference_less_video_analysis_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_tools/rtc_event_log_visualizer/analyzer_bindings_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/rtp_packet_simulator_unittest.cc"], "git_node": "dc98d93bb2121c2bca696897e1e5d2105f2e823d", "git_parents": ["b884e49f30f3e20aa9c6990e8ebe74c14527a429"], "node": "66dcb05b0d209d377652e10854fd70a3d5410550", "parents": ["3dd5e1795a85853391a1dd3eb6eb35eeca79cc42"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 2f3d2c01cc\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/2f3d2c01cc177535420dd080175a058cfc3fa4c3\n    Reland \"Apply global audio options at the engine level\"\n\n    This is a reland of commit 1488f778a7b25c67c1c30dd9e11f9588d4b2ff38\n\n    Reland changes:\n    Move ownership of global audio options to ConnectionContext instead of\n    WebRtcVoiceEngine. That avoids an issue with a downstream implementation\n    where a premature Init/Terminate cycle occurred during CreateAudioSource\n\n    Original change's description:\n    \u003e Apply global audio options at the engine level\n    \u003e\n    \u003e Introduce ApplyGlobalOptions to the MediaEngine interface to configure\n    \u003e global audio processing options (such as AEC, AGC, and noise\n    \u003e suppression) directly at the engine level. This replaces the previous\n    \u003e behavior where media channels implicitly re-applied options to the\n    \u003e engine during initialization and parameter updates.\n    \u003e\n    \u003e Applying global settings during CreateAudioSource ensures engine-level\n    \u003e configurations persist reliably across stream lifecycles. This change\n    \u003e also separates global audio processing options from stream-level\n    \u003e parameters like jitter buffer and audio network adaptor settings.\n    \u003e\n    \u003e                  [Before Decoupling]\n    \u003e +----------------------------------------------------+\n    \u003e |      AudioOptions (AEC/AGC/NS + Jitter/ANA)        |\n    \u003e +----------------------------------------------------+\n    \u003e   /                                                \\\n    \u003e  / (engine()-\u003eApplyOptions)                         \\\n    \u003e v                                                    v\n    \u003e WebRtcVoiceEngine (Global APM)             VoiceSend/RecvChannel\n    \u003e\n    \u003e\n    \u003e               [After Decoupling (This CL)]\n    \u003e +-----------------------+                  +-----------------------+\n    \u003e |  Global Options (APM) |                  |  Channel Options (ST) |\n    \u003e |  - echo_cancellation  |                  |  - jitter_buffer      |\n    \u003e |  - auto_gain_control  |                  |  - audio_network_     |\n    \u003e |  - noise_suppression  |                  |    adaptor            |\n    \u003e +-----------------------+                  +-----------------------+\n    \u003e            |                                           |\n    \u003e            v (ApplyGlobalOptions)                      v\n    \u003e    WebRtcVoiceEngine (APM)                     VoiceSend/RecvChannel\n    \u003e    - Stores in global_options_                 - No ApplyOptions calls\n    \u003e    - Persisted across cycles                   - No leakage / racing\n    \u003e\n    \u003e Bug: webrtc:42224170\n    \u003e Change-Id: I3c23293ae338495ee32330ce5287411947f6d472\n    \u003e Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/476340\n    \u003e Reviewed-by: Per \u00c5hgren \u003cpeah@webrtc.org\u003e\n    \u003e Commit-Queue: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    \u003e Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47844}\n\n    Bug: webrtc:42224170\n    Change-Id: I2e3b0374885c5f8daf25cc2fd62b56653574c13e\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/476782\n    Reviewed-by: Per \u00c5hgren \u003cpeah@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47867}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/peer_connection_interface.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/media/base/fake_media_engine.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/media/base/media_engine.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/media/engine/fake_webrtc_call.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/media/engine/webrtc_voice_engine.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/media/engine/webrtc_voice_engine.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/media/engine/webrtc_voice_engine_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0096.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/connection_context.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/connection_context.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/local_audio_source.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/local_audio_source.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection_factory.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection_factory_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/rtp_sender.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/rtp_transceiver.cc"], "git_node": "9a128d01f4a25d511b0121422187e4a5e9a1431b", "git_parents": ["dc98d93bb2121c2bca696897e1e5d2105f2e823d"], "node": "8949f850e8de2a058d0133faa3c7a0c660b8e4f3", "parents": ["66dcb05b0d209d377652e10854fd70a3d5410550"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from ec9a80084d\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/ec9a80084d021261e49a6dbb08ece1f550c6fbdc\n    Fix tests to respect command line field trials\n\n    Tests that used CreatePeerConnectionFactory without passing\n    FieldTrialsView were falling back to DeprecatedGlobalFieldTrials,\n    which ignored command line flags like --force-fieldtrials.\n    Fixed by passing CreateTestFieldTrialsPtr() or setting\n    dependencies.env = CreateTestEnvironment();.\n\n    Bug: None\n    Change-Id: I08f508f728f8b664ed53c56652c6b2b7dc00d199\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/477720\n    Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47868}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0096.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection_crypto_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection_factory_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection_ice_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection_interface_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection_jsep_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection_rtp_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection_signaling_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection_simulcast_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/sdp_munging_detector_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/sdp_offer_answer_unittest.cc"], "git_node": "3bc1dc7025cc63168c401772cc827fe5feb62165", "git_parents": ["9a128d01f4a25d511b0121422187e4a5e9a1431b"], "node": "f03b81b259e11bf6977f47056f1378a3637c52d2", "parents": ["8949f850e8de2a058d0133faa3c7a0c660b8e4f3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 7bdb4a0b47\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/7bdb4a0b4772a18ccb2dc5465799c9af6175c5c4\n    cleanup: Remove several deprecated symbols\n\n    Removed deprecated symbols that have no usage in WebRTC or\n    downstream projects:\n    - webrtc::InitRandom\n    - some Subscribe* methods in Port, NetworkManager,\n      Network, AsyncPacketSocket, and PortAllocatorSession.\n\n    Tested: rtc_unittests, rtc_p2p_unittests, rtc_pc_unittests,\n    peerconnection_unittests.\n\n    Bug: webrtc:465197113\n    Change-Id: I219eb866775e22ee65b7ef15a4d083027c357565\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/476781\n    Auto-Submit: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47869}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/base/port.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/base/port.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/base/port_allocator.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/async_packet_socket.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/crypto_random.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/crypto_random.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/network.h"], "git_node": "5440ec825bb598f37026804ae8cf275362b830d8", "git_parents": ["3bc1dc7025cc63168c401772cc827fe5feb62165"], "node": "d835062128d72b535cf1abacdb0944902ab71a56", "parents": ["f03b81b259e11bf6977f47056f1378a3637c52d2"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 4babf81ff6\n\nUpstream commit: https: