tps://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/477762\n    Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Auto-Submit: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47877}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/video/rtp_video_frame_assembler_unittests.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/logging/rtc_event_log/rtc_event_log_parser.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/source/flexfec_sender_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/channel_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/rtp_transport_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/rtp_video_stream_receiver2_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/video_quality_test.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/video_send_stream_tests.cc"], "git_node": "b05fb70ee1d29009b6e8fb5cbb5fdd9ad024842d", "git_parents": ["83ec70aad4a3cbec73cee64f36b60f61390148b6"], "node": "45f52b3eebfc9d3a53bd3e84f6975ebec888491b", "parents": ["ef81488cec930caf7c9850a24bb37198ca18aa65"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 7f22a4aa66\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/7f22a4aa6622a6c9c47ed70ce7e0d4d25610e366\n    Perform `{Assembled,Rendered}Margin` calculations in ms-level precision.\n\n    Since the `render_timestamp` only has ms-level precision, there is no\n    point in having us-level precision for the margin calculations. In fact,\n    it is just detracting when trying to analyze the results. Further, we\n    only need ms-level precision for jitter buffer evaluations anyway.\n\n    TESTED=Presubmit\n\n    Bug: b/423646186\n    Change-Id: Ie3f49578af9f24d97d69b6b30b1326f7b2514607\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/478040\n    Reviewed-by: \u00c5sa Persson \u003casapersson@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Rasmus Brandt \u003cbrandtr@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47878}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/rendering_simulator.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/rendering_simulator_unittest.cc"], "git_node": "568bac735d729d82be3ec542a983f4a18dede7ea", "git_parents": ["b05fb70ee1d29009b6e8fb5cbb5fdd9ad024842d"], "node": "369f23c6880648af26bd1a5327460c77cd4f0530", "parents": ["45f52b3eebfc9d3a53bd3e84f6975ebec888491b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 53ca0d6ec7\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/53ca0d6ec71c9de4f8e056bae91869c7a15e743d\n    Deprecate implicit conversion from RtpHeaderExtensionId to int\n\n    Bug: webrtc:514817938\n    Change-Id: Id8e8a1d7e57d68ab385689b2ead0d1baf0d5fc0d\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/476241\n    Commit-Queue: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Auto-Submit: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47879}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/rtp_header_extension_id.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/rtp_parameters.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/source/rtp_packet_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0001.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0027.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0096.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/objc/api/peerconnection/RTCRtpHeaderExtension.mm"], "git_node": "54d96c7df80fe81e7e3a4b790e0be167e131ca9a", "git_parents": ["568bac735d729d82be3ec542a983f4a18dede7ea"], "node": "a620093d69e33db186f730806400470b925c5242", "parents": ["369f23c6880648af26bd1a5327460c77cd4f0530"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 3661efd9f0\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/3661efd9f0dc1a46b213c2f1b46d00d7912610f8\n    Define spaceship \u003c=\u003e operator for StrongAlias\n\n    This simplifies using standard functions that search for the\n    spaceship operator like std::tie.\n\n    Bug: None\n    Change-Id: Id7875b31858c3014b69a6eec0c5cf88ab58c7b1c\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/478120\n    Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Auto-Submit: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47880}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/strong_alias.h"], "git_node": "64d4626b45939dbeeebbe2bb0db48b756d3d7f81", "git_parents": ["54d96c7df80fe81e7e3a4b790e0be167e131ca9a"], "node": "1092059613a0c94e3c42b0e3c2a18ed2a1c118eb", "parents": ["a620093d69e33db186f730806400470b925c5242"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 9616223d38\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/9616223d38733e1231e4565ba0a82db589469ea6\n    Store const audio/video options inside RtpTransceiver on construction\n\n    Move `AudioOptions` and `VideoOptions` initialization to the\n    RtpTransceiver constructor. This guarantees that options cannot change\n    between transceiver construction and a call to CreateChannel. Remove the\n    options parameters from CreateChannel signature. Also clean up redundant\n    SetOptions calls in CreateChannel since options are already applied\n    during channel creation.\n\n    Bug: webrtc:42224170\n    Change-Id: I517b678ee248c6ce3f108bef489fbb107e446811\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/476780\n    Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47881}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/media/engine/webrtc_voice_engine.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/rtp_transceiver.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/rtp_transceiver.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/rtp_transceiver_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/sdp_offer_answer.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/test/fake_peer_connection_for_stats.h"], "git_node": "3cc458c73f88f68f99a706cd2a4bc2d7b0985c10", "git_parents": ["64d4626b45939dbeeebbe2bb0db48b756d3d7f81"], "node": "af80454d7bf7f1e1853e7f39e3f08438f4724ba3", "parents": ["1092059613a0c94e3c42b0e3c2a18ed2a1c118eb"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 08a923a912\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/08a923a9128bb78df5520651837cd00e56055662\n    Configure render delay constant via constructor of VCMTiming.\n\n    Remove set_render_delay method.\n\n    Bug: b/493549134\n    Change-Id: If9bfbfcda8dda745130faa2c6ff29e14099cb9a4\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/476000\n    Reviewed-by: Rasmus Brandt \u003cbrandtr@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: \u00c5sa Persson \u003casapersson@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47882}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/call.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/generic_decoder_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/timing/timing.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/timing/timing.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/timing/timing_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/video_receiver2_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0037.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0042.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0057.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/frame_decode_timing_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/rendering_simulator.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/rendering_simulator.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/rendering_tracker.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/rendering_tracker_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/video_receive_stream2.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/video_receive_stream2_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/video_stream_buffer_controller_unittest.cc"], "git_node": "99a8ffdfb820228e124b9624409403832d727a93", "git_parents": ["3cc458c73f88f68f99a706cd2a4bc2d7b0985c10"], "node": "70f87fbbad882c3c546dda68a3c0dac39022cb3f", "parents": ["af80454d7bf7f1e1853e7f39e3f08438f4724ba3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from caf8ef4f59\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/caf8ef4f59deb9246ddbf9b13a1c92a96b835968\n    Stop relying on the generic libjingle_peerconnection_api dependency.\n\n    Change-Id: I403a643029911fec2808a1a5b6cd845030dcd1dd\n    Bug: webrtc:463418937\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/478101\n    Reviewed-by: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Jeremy Leconte \u003cjleconte@google.com\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47883}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/examples/androidnativeapi/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0096.patch"], "git_node": "c7848b8c84723d2f392ffd0f8646b39959987542", "git_parents": ["99a8ffdfb820228e124b9624409403832d727a93"], "node": "27bb995b3e2b6462afffe63f403a9cf4561041a4", "parents": ["70f87fbbad882c3c546dda68a3c0dac39022cb3f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 08007e5259\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/08007e52590b05a05d89eb7fa02db1ec2b5604b4\n    Relax BasicPortAllocator to take TaskQueue instead of Thread\n\n    This class already uses only TaskQueueBase interface of the Thread\n\n    Bug: webrtc:42225410\n    Change-Id: I1147c8b22046d6089ea2be095d34495515ccc710\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/476260\n    Reviewed-by: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Auto-Submit: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47884}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/client/basic_port_allocator.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/client/basic_port_allocator.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/client/relay_port_factory_interface.h"], "git_node": "b0c09f5ba3628f8d415ced1450e3d2deafed0bf6", "git_parents": ["c7848b8c84723d2f392ffd0f8646b39959987542"], "node": "a52b00e521647092f67a91627a557217899bff7e", "parents": ["27bb995b3e2b6462afffe63f403a9cf4561041a4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from b25fa31955\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/b25fa319558f51f301ea30128f4adb81e04aaa49\n    Cleanup non-deprecated test::DirectTransport constructor\n\n    Relax 'network_thread' parameter to be TaskQueueBase instead of Thread\n    Annotate nullability of pointers\n\n    Bug: webrtc:42225410\n    Change-Id: I0e2f6b1c56b4ef2eb2af1fc6e2a355cf1b9f4847\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/478180\n    Auto-Submit: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Jeremy Leconte \u003cjleconte@google.com\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Jeremy Leconte \u003cjleconte@google.com\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47885}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0027.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0093.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0096.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/direct_transport.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/direct_transport.h"], "git_node": "cb05c21a553c77be6a58a35b36078aea3e05506a", "git_parents": ["b0c09f5ba3628f8d415ced1450e3d2deafed0bf6"], "node": "c09e1e5fcddcee1a929c9abc9259153748252e5d", "parents": ["a52b00e521647092f67a91627a557217899bff7e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 97473dbb3a\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/97473dbb3a434560060b728c09f2da8ab7e45495\n    Remove SetOptions and other unused methods from channel interfaces\n\n    Delete SetOptions from VoiceMediaSendChannelInterface,\n    VoiceMediaReceiveChannelInterface, and VideoMediaSendChannelInterface,\n    as they lack any external or polymorphic callers.\n\n    * Remove unused implementations and associated internal logic from\n      WebRtcVideoSendChannel, WebRtcVideoSendStream, and\n      WebRtcVoiceReceiveChannel.\n    * Retain WebRtcVoiceSendChannel::SetOptions as a private non-virtual\n      helper function.\n    * Mark internal tracking fields (default_send_options_ and options_)\n      as const and drop their RTC_GUARDED_BY thread annotations, as they\n      no longer undergo mutations or require explicit synchronization.\n    * Remove an unused VideoOptions parameter from the constructor of\n      WebRtcVideoReceiveChannel and its creation call site.\n    * Drop now-obsolete virtual overrides and mock definitions across\n      fake and mock implementations.\n\n    Bug: none\n    Change-Id: I508393646b4968c808d0c163fc036be969b807e9\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/477040\n    Commit-Queue: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47886}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/media/base/fake_media_engine.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/media/base/fake_media_engine.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/media/base/media_channel.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/media/base/media_engine.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/media/engine/webrtc_video_engine.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/media/engine/webrtc_video_engine.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/media/engine/webrtc_video_engine_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/media/engine/webrtc_voice_engine.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/media/engine/webrtc_voice_engine.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/media/engine/webrtc_voice_engine_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0027.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/channel_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/rtp_sender_receiver_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/rtp_transceiver.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/test/mock_voice_media_receive_channel_interface.h"], "git_node": "dac6338922037d784da5b9ca10a424e103610d88", "git_parents": ["cb05c21a553c77be6a58a35b36078aea3e05506a"], "node": "3ef472a6e94c9a38e818960f9a6139c1c090eb84", "parents": ["c09e1e5fcddcee1a929c9abc9259153748252e5d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 6f7e6237c5\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/6f7e6237c5c52c0b9566be7f1a5ce2df9d8dbf0d\n    PT: Fix test failures and PT mapping conflicts under WebRTC-PayloadTypesInTransport\n\n    This CL addresses multiple test failures in rtc_pc_unittests when the\n    WebRTC-PayloadTypesInTransport field trial is enabled:\n\n    1. Reverts a too-permissive directionality check bypass in\n    pc/codec_vendor.cc to restore correct negotiation of kInactive via\n    reversed offer direction, fixing legacy AudioCodecsAnswerTest\n    failures.\n\n    2. Adds BUNDLE support to FakePayloadTypeSuggester by mapping bundled\n    MIDs to share the same PayloadTypeRecorder instance.\n\n    3. Fixes TestBundleOfferWithSameCodecPlType by configuring bundle\n    groups on the fake suggester.\n\n    4. Avoids force-registering conflicting preferred payload types in\n    RegisterExpectations inside CodecLookupHelperForTesting if they are\n    already mapped. This allows fake suggester conflict resolution to\n    work correctly in tests.\n\n    5. Updates 15 asymmetric H265 level negotiation tests to use\n    CodecListsMatch instead of strict EXPECT_EQ, as TypedCodecVendor\n    does not pre-assign payload types in video_sendrecv_codecs().\n\n    Bug: webrtc:360058654\n    Change-Id: I9431d77b2e3eceba25c2df71f5fef69f70480495\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/477860\n    Reviewed-by: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47887}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/fake_payload_type_suggester.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/codec_vendor.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/media_session_unittest.cc"], "git_node": "89c4b223f9ef75dd15f4902f4a2f464fe8b03ca4", "git_parents": ["dac6338922037d784da5b9ca10a424e103610d88"], "node": "2cd5c43763ebca2e93e6d8f75ebdb195daca9ccf", "parents": ["3ef472a6e94c9a38e818960f9a6139c1c090eb84"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from e61e8bdd5e\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/e61e8bdd5e24ec2d9f7a479a6520427ccaa74c65\n    [visualizer] Add RTCP bitrate time series and packet overhead to total graphs\n\n    This change adds RTCP bitrate time series and dynamically calculated\n    packet overhead to both the total incoming and outgoing bitrate graphs,\n    controlled by a new command line flag: --include_overhead (defaulting to true).\n\n    Specifically:\n    - RTP and RTCP packet sizes are dynamically augmented with path-specific\n      network-level overhead (IP/UDP/SRTP/STUN) matching their timeline.\n    - Both incoming and outgoing total bitrate calculations are refactored\n      to process RTP/RTCP in a single combined sliding window loop.\n    - A command line flag --include_overhead is added to main.cc, with a\n      description clarifying that it only affects total incoming and\n      outgoing bitrate graphs.\n\n    Bug: None\n    Change-Id: I43473c7fd3ae3970dda71627aefea39f742f4371\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/477700\n    Commit-Queue: Per Kjellander \u003cperkj@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Bj\u00f6rn Terelius \u003cterelius@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47888}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_tools/rtc_event_log_visualizer/analyze_bwe.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_tools/rtc_event_log_visualizer/analyze_bwe.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_tools/rtc_event_log_visualizer/analyzer.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_tools/rtc_event_log_visualizer/analyzer.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_tools/rtc_event_log_visualizer/analyzer_bindings_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_tools/rtc_event_log_visualizer/main.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_tools/rtc_event_log_visualizer/plot_base.h"], "git_node": "e44003a5c55f7731fe8619e474ddb5d09f3d2559", "git_parents": ["89c4b223f9ef75dd15f4902f4a2f464fe8b03ca4"], "node": "c72ea7513fa8f9fe0ebb370f696fdd3117960bb0", "parents": ["2cd5c43763ebca2e93e6d8f75ebdb195daca9ccf"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 50a60b7fdc\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/50a60b7fdcfbf4b34eff34d45ef4eefb25ffc02c\n    Reenable markdown autoformat\n\n    Now that tool supports formatting markdown tables.\n\n    Bug: chromium:510238003\n    Change-Id: Id1f19694a6049aa9423e7fd22a7e87c6a2495b97\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/478380\n    Reviewed-by: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47889}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/.style.mdformat", "third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/g3doc/style-guide.md"], "git_node": "35726a9809ab671dc1a3378dc62129a950c22d08", "git_parents": ["e44003a5c55f7731fe8619e474ddb5d09f3d2559"], "node": "85437784e596034608a00b3aaf13da400a078d63", "parents": ["c72ea7513fa8f9fe0ebb370f696fdd3117960bb0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from c952a43053\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/c952a43053072fa309e5af628935900104e0c9bd\n    Delete deprecated test::DirectTransport constructor\n\n    Bug: webrtc:42223992\n    Change-Id: Icd3082b63c1b1b4c6a92e9eb7c7407b8a2396ef0\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/478400\n    Commit-Queue: Jeremy Leconte \u003cjleconte@google.com\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Jeremy Leconte \u003cjleconte@google.com\u003e\n    Auto-Submit: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47890}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0027.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0093.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0096.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/direct_transport.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/direct_transport.h"], "git_node": "975427663ce3279eda0caca2fc4ebea2552f9ef8", "git_parents": ["35726a9809ab671dc1a3378dc62129a950c22d08"], "node": "6b33fd3d59122f4a75b581e9ca48d69a5794a331", "parents": ["85437784e596034608a00b3aaf13da400a078d63"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 5a6c17b54d\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/5a6c17b54d67901dd7cb972053f9e1fa83f1a749\n    Add initial DefaultVideoJitterTiming class.\n\n    To be owned by VCMTiming and hold video jitter timing logic.\n\n    Bug: b/493549134\n    Change-Id: I59e8721555c672bd871691b9c514e430979c9766\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/478440\n    Commit-Queue: \u00c5sa Persson \u003casapersson@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Rasmus Brandt \u003cbrandtr@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47891}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/timing/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/timing/default_video_jitter_timing.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/timing/default_video_jitter_timing.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/timing/default_video_jitter_timing_unittest.cc"], "git_node": "d1ac1708d50d83bfc444347a5fe445d96eeafb86", "git_parents": ["975427663ce3279eda0caca2fc4ebea2552f9ef8"], "node": "a9895bc624f43a6f7f690b289c5a01d45857271a", "parents": ["6b33fd3d59122f4a75b581e9ca48d69a5794a331"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 3a013ef968\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/3a013ef968191c818f85dd24ee6f87fc89a1fb8f\n    Merge rtc_stats and rtc_st