com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 5c92dc003d\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/5c92dc003d09a78541f9ffa52ab53925e686553c\n    Move api/stats/OWNERS constraints in the parent folder.\n\n    Update the owners to mitigate the risk of having no-one available to review.\n\n    Change-Id: I7a271b47ef456bdb397bff4c99a0602c3496e1ee\n    Bug: None\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/478381\n    Reviewed-by: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Jeremy Leconte \u003cjleconte@google.com\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47895}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/OWNERS", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/stats/OWNERS"], "git_node": "44a4f665af7adc02865be13e78d12f135455dd92", "git_parents": ["c0ff0e82b37cfe003a076ba3f1f08b732e86314d"], "node": "670d2f8ec1227fda30de6b4406b9816894565286", "parents": ["1dc2c8fd9d63b070db0ad7c3224b3437cdff9608"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 43f43f8286\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/43f43f828637ea9d48c278f773884838504bd566\n    Delete SSLFingerprint factories returning raw pointer with ownership\n\n    To resolve TODOs in SSLFingerprint api\n\n    Remove factory function returning raw pointer with ownership.\n    Rename factory function returning unique_ptr as suggested,\n    deprecate old names.\n    Add nullability annotation to the factory functions\n\n    Bug: None\n    Change-Id: I28f433466d4d1f770cd79b671237f79cda645ce6\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/476743\n    Reviewed-by: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47896}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0001.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0027.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0053.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0085.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0087.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0088.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0096.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0101.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/ssl_fingerprint.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/ssl_fingerprint.h"], "git_node": "dd526247665bf12e6efbcfaff004082aec797d12", "git_parents": ["44a4f665af7adc02865be13e78d12f135455dd92"], "node": "158a4e13bc38dd268d12b7bd9f948833755d4c62", "parents": ["670d2f8ec1227fda30de6b4406b9816894565286"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from e72179b2a1\n\nEssentially a no-op since we're going to see this change\nreverted when we vendor in da4da9ca17.\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/e72179b2a11594b6f7d9df68286bb56edf75b11b\n    Migrate test_support_unittests to rtc_test_suite\n\n    Bug: webrtc:498394143\n    Change-Id: Ibb9fec5792d7b08d6377a5c42a6ddbfbcafc6c05\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/474740\n    Commit-Queue: Jeremy Leconte \u003cjleconte@google.com\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Mirko Bonadei \u003cmbonadei@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47897}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/da4da9ca17.no-op-cherry-pick-msg", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/p0001.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/p0002.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/p0003.patch"], "git_node": "93b221b7759e270cf8ecdb16e160d84f37548cac", "git_parents": ["dd526247665bf12e6efbcfaff004082aec797d12"], "node": "84f99d4ba706327a55f7db7cd4d5908d9469f090", "parents": ["158a4e13bc38dd268d12b7bd9f948833755d4c62"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from b5cf1fa607\n\nWe already cherry-picked this when we vendored fb583c5809.\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/b5cf1fa607113788cf894d5b6895c72fba1d9254\n    [WGC] Fix frame size synchronization\n\n    Fixes a scenario where the mapped_texture_ and frame_pool_ sizes of the\n    WGC capturer could get out of sync and potentially bypass their\n    reconciliation on the following frame.\n\n    Fixed: chromium:517727318\n    Change-Id: Ie4e951bbdf41491200b7ba1289f85e4c02bc22d1\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/476860\n    Commit-Queue: Mark Foltz \u003cmfoltz@chromium.org\u003e\n    Auto-Submit: Alexander Cooper \u003calcooper@chromium.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Mark Foltz \u003cmfoltz@chromium.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47898}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/b5cf1fa607.no-op-cherry-pick-msg", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/p0002.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/p0003.patch"], "git_node": "d833b0e08f98b8a9177dfdf98da6a088cc6e64ce", "git_parents": ["93b221b7759e270cf8ecdb16e160d84f37548cac"], "node": "3008c96c774d5160cf2e2b1ec3f9f46367e960c3", "parents": ["84f99d4ba706327a55f7db7cd4d5908d9469f090"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from fc7f8509f2\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/fc7f8509f2db6fb8f78782ee302c6cdb409ac153\n    Add settling delay to CroppingWindowCapturer\n\n    On Windows, DXGI can be slow to update the window position in the\n    screen capture because DWM composition is deferred to vsync. If a\n    window moves immediately before a capture attempt, the screen capture\n    might still show stale pixels from before the move.\n\n    This CL adds a check in CroppingWindowCapturer::CaptureFrame to detect\n    if the window has moved since the last capture attempt. If a move is\n    detected, we fallback to the window capturer for one frame to allow\n    DWM/DXGI to settle before we attempt screen capture again.\n\n    Fixed: chromium:518242046\n    Change-Id: I89dd5cdd30aeb9cca4e2877916dfbeb4aaa612c3\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/477921\n    Reviewed-by: Mark Foltz \u003cmfoltz@chromium.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Alexander Cooper \u003calcooper@chromium.org\u003e\n    Auto-Submit: Alexander Cooper \u003calcooper@chromium.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47899}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/desktop_capture/cropping_window_capturer.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/desktop_capture/cropping_window_capturer.h"], "git_node": "29746aaf64133c6a63c0eca692ae6e03186d47e5", "git_parents": ["d833b0e08f98b8a9177dfdf98da6a088cc6e64ce"], "node": "306216e0ec791aaaab0939995bf3719c7e70b6a1", "parents": ["3008c96c774d5160cf2e2b1ec3f9f46367e960c3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 7c6a6a312d\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/7c6a6a312d31b18392775e1398b401e0b02a4ca8\n    Update WebRTC code version (2026-06-05T04:10:06).\n\n    Bug: None\n    Change-Id: I16d3a6d1dc52bafadf9ebfb0966e74af7b5d5176\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/478680\n    Bot-Commit: webrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com \u003cwebrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: webrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com \u003cwebrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47900}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/version.cc"], "git_node": "03821339ffc28ed134b5654bc7e696f226c1ac90", "git_parents": ["29746aaf64133c6a63c0eca692ae6e03186d47e5"], "node": "a194318bcc174eecb197bbfe648faf069cb770f3", "parents": ["306216e0ec791aaaab0939995bf3719c7e70b6a1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from d63cf5a486\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/d63cf5a48647ec4497b4cf1eb797181a8c22fd39\n    Add TargetTransferRate.is_bwe_limited and support in googcc and scream\n\n    This is exposed in order to know if the congestion controller currently believe WebRTC packet sending is constrained by the BWE.\n\n    Change-Id: Ia4bd825a59018d3e7814285e235a30d2ee7c8167\n    Bug: webrtc:519655843\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/478441\n    Commit-Queue: Bj\u00f6rn Terelius \u003cterelius@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Auto-Submit: Per Kjellander \u003cperkj@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Bj\u00f6rn Terelius \u003cterelius@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47901}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/transport/network_types.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/congestion_controller/goog_cc/goog_cc_network_control.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/congestion_controller/goog_cc/goog_cc_network_control.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/congestion_controller/goog_cc/goog_cc_network_control_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/congestion_controller/scream/scream_network_controller.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/congestion_controller/scream/scream_network_controller.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/congestion_controller/scream/scream_network_controller_unittest.cc"], "git_node": "6290f18f45542aff692853060c2808c1fde3fcf8", "git_parents": ["03821339ffc28ed134b5654bc7e696f226c1ac90"], "node": "5d15f72b925f42c420f7ae395d82b3398ff168c5", "parents": ["a194318bcc174eecb197bbfe648faf069cb770f3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 706cbfab82\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/706cbfab821d814e3e5af13078f6bd2bde573308\n    Remove libjingle_peerconnection_api\n\n    Change-Id: I85ca6501d6eb461ea6f9e11bc73c681ad4154562\n    Bug: webrtc:463418937\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/478340\n    Commit-Queue: Jeremy Leconte \u003cjleconte@google.com\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47902}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0027.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0096.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/tools_webrtc/gn_check_autofix.py"], "git_node": "24a5ce2fc8f5e0f9e0866c60aa5e875bb104a8f3", "git_parents": ["6290f18f45542aff692853060c2808c1fde3fcf8"], "node": "5b6370ba39677f6c1ee2d99af7f38cf94a05cd75", "parents": ["5d15f72b925f42c420f7ae395d82b3398ff168c5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 605d43163e\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/605d43163eaa0100e51c26e93c4381c493763fa4\n    fix(test): Handle worktrees in repo root detection scripts\n\n    The scripts assumed the repo root was named 'src' or 'chromium'. This failed when running in a worktree with a different name. Changed to look for the 'DEPS' file instead, which is more robust.\n\n    Affected files:\n\n    - tools_webrtc/validate_test_registration.py\n\n    - tools_webrtc/presubmit_checks_lib/build_helpers.py\n\n    - tools_webrtc/autoroller/roll_deps.py\n\n    Bug: None\n    Change-Id: Ide6a800456ef4e279d0a292d8391f38337cc838c\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/477460\n    Commit-Queue: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Mirko Bonadei \u003cmbonadei@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47903}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/tools_webrtc/autoroller/roll_deps.py", "third_party/libwebrtc/tools_webrtc/presubmit_checks_lib/build_helpers.py", "third_party/libwebrtc/tools_webrtc/validate_test_registration.py"], "git_node": "77c2dda3eb729c0ff281f5ca43b9a483579a3d2f", "git_parents": ["24a5ce2fc8f5e0f9e0866c60aa5e875bb104a8f3"], "node": "e0dc47437c8b54e06097d89a87d9f3872179d9e6", "parents": ["5b6370ba39677f6c1ee2d99af7f38cf94a05cd75"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 48c80a6549\n\nEssentially a no-op since we're going to see this change\nreverted when we vendor in 1c9a7db602.\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/48c80a6549f5d21feb33aafa9c5c440879b2eaf5\n    Merge ScopedFakeClock and ScopedBaseFakeClock\n\n    Their implementation is almost identical. Only 'InvokesInDelayOrder'\n    test relied on extra behavior of the ScopedFakeClock. This test is\n    adjusted to call 'ProcessAllTasks' itself instead of relying on\n    'ScopedFakeClock' to do so for it.\n\n    Bug: webrtc:42223992\n    Change-Id: I5221ee76fec11315846649bb84dd4098451a8b80\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/478382\n    Commit-Queue: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47904}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/1c9a7db602.no-op-cherry-pick-msg", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/p0001.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/p0002.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/p0003.patch"], "git_node": "1794e53e24246d2f850bd452cf41135b0230c02b", "git_parents": ["77c2dda3eb729c0ff281f5ca43b9a483579a3d2f"], "node": "85fef22d79d02c0fbc9ec8f509ce3378b8e59a6e", "parents": ["e0dc47437c8b54e06097d89a87d9f3872179d9e6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from da4da9ca17\n\nWe already cherry-picked this when we vendored e72179b2a1.\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/da4da9ca176eb5c6ede87df6553443a253c137e9\n    Revert \"Migrate test_support_unittests to rtc_test_suite\"\n\n    This reverts commit e72179b2a11594b6f7d9df68286bb56edf75b11b.\n\n    Reason for revert: Breaks roll into chromium: https://ci.chromium.org/ui/p/chromium/builders/try/win-libfuzzer-asan-rel/2662745/overview\n    Original change's description:\n    \u003e Migrate test_support_unittests to rtc_test_suite\n    \u003e\n    \u003e Bug: webrtc:498394143\n    \u003e Change-Id: Ibb9fec5792d7b08d6377a5c42a6ddbfbcafc6c05\n    \u003e Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/474740\n    \u003e Commit-Queue: Jeremy Leconte \u003cjleconte@google.com\u003e\n    \u003e Reviewed-by: Mirko Bonadei \u003cmbonadei@webrtc.org\u003e\n    \u003e Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47897}\n\n    Bug: webrtc:498394143\n    No-Presubmit: true\n    No-Tree-Checks: true\n    No-Try: true\n    Change-Id: Ic193b40a07bf3f4829f3274e1d8a4adfe2839051\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/478880\n    Bot-Commit: rubber-stamper@appspot.gserviceaccount.com \u003crubber-stamper@appspot.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Owners-Override: Ilya Nikolaevskiy \u003cilnik@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Ilya Nikolaevskiy \u003cilnik@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47905}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/da4da9ca17.no-op-cherry-pick-msg", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/p0002.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/p0003.patch"], "git_node": "aa2107840e336d5c4b007b7aa4de0d4ca82738af", "git_parents": ["1794e53e24246d2f850bd452cf41135b0230c02b"], "node": "585e7ff31da02947bf38416336c34158ad94b82e", "parents": ["85fef22d79d02c0fbc9ec8f509ce3378b8e59a6e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 590e27da70\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/590e27da7010f9b6407686f77975fa12e99f63bd\n    Make ICE tiebreaker a construction time argument of Port\n\n    rebase of\n      https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/372762\n    which was a reland of\n      https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/352340\n    only deprecating SetIcetiebreaker for now.\n\n    Bug: webrtc:42224914\n    Change-Id: I14a4c04464a0aae6b85fbf63b2811aac345d3d98\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/476840\n    Commit-Queue: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47906}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0096.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/base/connection_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/base/p2p_transport_channel.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/base/port.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/base/port.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/base/port_interface.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/base/port_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/base/stun_port_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/base/tcp_port_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/base/turn_port.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/base/turn_port_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/client/basic_port_allocator.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/client/relay_port_factory_interface.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/test/fake_port_allocator.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/BUILD.gn"], "git_node": "2fb9ada0abf9b3021837834051bccb18ab4d2879", "git_parents": ["aa2107840e336d5c4b007b7aa4de0d4ca82738af"], "node": "84dcd42d2083dc6bcc5f5ae470cfb21a9631ddb6", "parents": ["585e7ff31da02947bf38416336c34158ad94b82e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 1c9a7db602\n\nWe already cherry-picked this when we vendored 48c80a6549.\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/1c9a7db60246006724e91677e341fbc3e5f34892\n    Revert \"Merge ScopedFakeClock and ScopedBaseFakeClock\"\n\n    This reverts commit 48c80a6549f5d21feb33aafa9c5c440879b2eaf5.\n\n    Reason for revert: breaks downstream\n\n    Original change's description:\n    \u003e Merge ScopedFakeClock and ScopedBaseFakeClock\n    \u003e\n    \u003e Their implementation is almost identical. Only 'InvokesInDelayOrder'\n    \u003e test relied on extra behavior of the ScopedFakeClock. This test is\n    \u003e adjusted to call 'ProcessAllTasks' itself instead of relying on\n    \u003e 'ScopedFakeClock' to do so for it.\n    \u003e\n    \u003e Bug: webrtc:42223992\n    \u003e Change-Id: I5221ee76fec11315846649bb84dd4098451a8b80\n    \u003e Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/478382\n    \u003e Commit-Queue: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    \u003e Reviewed-by: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    \u003e Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47904}\n\n    Bug: webrtc:42223992\n    No-Presubmit: true\n    No-Tree-Checks: true\n    No-Try: true\n    Change-Id: I173441e27a66adbaa99335ea6b59a3d5e3b67fc5\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/478841\n    Commit-Queue: rubber-stamper@appspot.gserviceaccount.com \u003crubber-stamper@appspot.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Bot-Commit: rubber-stamper@appspot.gserviceaccount.com \u003crubber-stamper@appspot.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Auto-Submit: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47907}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/1c9a7db602.no-op-cherry-pick-msg", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/p0001.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/p0002.patch"], "git_node": "3780898a800f394db4fd4b9a3b324ba91b9370f3", "git_parents": ["2fb9ada0abf9b3021837834051bccb18ab4d2879"], "node": "bfc74b96f0c3ac69e481de8f117185829cba2fb0", "parents": ["84dcd42d2083dc6bcc5f5ae470cfb21a9631ddb6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 40e0bfd24f\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/40e0bfd24fca003e221fb9ab31f7e12641e466d0\n    Simplify RtpTransceiver and BaseChannel construction threading\n\n    Perform media channel creation and `BaseChannel` construction\n    synchronously on the signaling thread rather than deferring them to the\n    worker thread. This change avoids worker thread tasks when possible. and\n    simplifies the asynchronous initialization process.\n\n    Bug: webrtc:42224170\n    Change-Id: If5d3d68ee334609bce243b06fb0f7be352bb4bda\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/475140\n    Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47908}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/channel.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/rtp_transceiver.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/rtp_transceiver_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/scoped_operations_batcher.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/scoped_operations_batcher.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/scoped_operations_batcher_unittest.cc"], "git_node": "d2f5f29b0256acc106db92c7353618dd7900b8a5", "git_parents": ["3780898a800f394db4fd4b9a3b324ba91b9370f3"], "node": "bbbccb912dabbf9462580e71a4feed8952d20eb7", "parents": ["bfc74b96f0c3ac69e481de8f117185829cba2fb0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 33a14aa72a\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/33a14aa72a926b160a189d75494c727ee9c6183f\n    Migrate from deprecated SSLFingerprint::CreateUnique* factories\n\n    Instead use shorter SSLFingerprint::Create* names with the same functionality.\n    Update nearby checks for nullability to more modern practices.\n    Mark old names deprecated to prevent new usages of it in WebRTC\n\n    Bug: None\n    Change-Id: I558806cd892737a8d0e55192c46d55e798e089c0\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/478840\n    Commit-Queue: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Auto-Submit: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47909}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/webrtc_sdp.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/jsep_transport.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/jsep_transport_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection_integrationtest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/ssl_fingerprint.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/ssl_fingerprint.h"], "git_node": "65004a494eef5626c76abe4190c965e81748ac04", "git_parents": ["d2f5f29b0256acc106db92c7353618dd7900b8a5"], "node": "854df7d70f6326038551ba2bdc0e909cbd03aad5", "parents": ["bbbccb912dabbf9462580e71a4feed8952d20eb7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from ef4a476573\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/ef4a47657302b6173dd19252f7ad0a1bbbd2d212\n    Audio: Apply ABWENoTWCC trial to ReconfigureBitrateObserver\n\n    The Start() path short-circuits the BitrateAllocator registration gate\n    on `allocate_audio_without_feedback_`, but ReconfigureBitrateObserver()\n    does not. As a result, a Reconfigure() with an SDP that does not\n    negotiate transport-cc for audio unregisters the stream from the\n    BitrateAllocator, defeating the field trial.\n\n    Mirror the Start() condition so the trial behaves consistently across\n    the stream lifecycle.\n\n    Bug: None\n    Change-Id: I047bbf19827f907dd45c8fb3aefe61edab191b91\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/478860\n    Reviewed-by: Jakob Ivarsson\u200e \u003cjakobi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Henrik Lundin \u003chenrik.lundin@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Henrik Lundin \u003chenrik.lundin@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47910}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/audio/audio_send_stream.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/audio/audio_send_stream_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0029.patch"], "git_node": "1e1bebc446251b064a1224520b2ed1c0b902ea02", "git_parents": ["65004a494eef5626c76abe4190c965e81748ac04"], "node": "35b6bc15f51b289e34462ca5dcfdb3c8bd740935", "parents": ["854df7d70f6326038551ba2bdc0e909cbd03aad5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from d370c22579\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/d370c22579378dca65e514dca5c6944d16bb4fce\n    Hdrext: Replace ABSL_DEPRECATE_AND_INLINE with [[deprecated]]\n\n    Replaced ABSL_DEPRECATE_AND_INLINE with [[deprecated]] ABSL_REFACTOR_INLINE\n    in api/rtp_parameters.h, modules/rtp_rtcp/include/rtp_header_extension_map.h,\n    and modules/rtp_rtcp/source/rtp_rtcp_interface.h.\n\n    Bug: webrtc:514817938\n    Change-Id: I73bb17ea32a6eab44804d284fdeaef130f14fc29\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/477480\n    Commit-Queue: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47911}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/rtp_parameters.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/include/rtp_header_extension_map.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/source/flexfec_sender_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/source/rtp_header_extension_map_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/source/rtp_rtcp_interface.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0001.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0003.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0004.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0035.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0042.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0049.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0080.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0124.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/fuzzers/receive_side_congestion_controller_fuzzer.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/fuzzers/rtp_packet_fuzzer.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/fuzzers/rtp_video_frame_assembler_fuzzer.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/fuzzers/utils/rtp_replayer.cc"], "git_node": "bc701304a17ac20463604af8bd124a1bc99de80e", "git_parents": ["1e1bebc446251b064a1224520b2ed1c0b902ea02"], "node": "7f16d19aa31ea0bc4c3bdf121e1bbb132c19f3b2", "parents": ["35b6bc15f51b289e34462ca5dcfdb3c8bd740935"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from f8f44e931c\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/f8f44e931c1118cfa66755abfe65b9497b451d4f\n    Update WebRTC code version (2026-06-06T04:08:08).\n\n    Bug: None\n    Change-Id: I5c2539be874a2902ce2a93a3ca06987535507f42\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/479081\n    Commit-Queue: webrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com \u003cwebrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Bot-Commit: webrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com \u003cwebrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47912}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/version.cc"], "git_node": "c0af589ca686e38bc2bb74f07eea9e878225130e", "git_parents": ["bc701304a17ac20463604af8bd124a1bc99de80e"], "node": "b0cf7a8fe974604c55537599909cd550c5487be4", "parents": ["7f16d19aa31ea0bc4c3bdf121e1bbb132c19f3b2"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from daabde7b61\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/daabde7b6186302ca0abebac9db7b2ba5ddbac36\n    Remove TaskQueueBase::Current() from Call construction\n\n    This change removes implicit reliance on `TaskQueueBase::Current()`\n    during the instantiation of `Call`, `CallStats`,\n    `RtpTransportControllerSend`, and `TaskQueuePacedSender`. Task queue\n    pointers are now explicitly injected through configuration structures\n    rather than being resolved at runtime.\n\n    Key modifications include:\n    * Adding explicit `worker_task_queue` and `network_task_queue`\n      parameters to `CallConfig` and related factories.\n    * Replacing `sequence_checker_` with explicit thread bounds using\n      the injected `worker_thread_` in `RtpTransportControllerSend`.\n    * Removing the `GetCurrentTaskQueueOrThread()` fallback logic in\n      favor of strict null checks on the injected queues.\n    * Providing `CreateWithJoinedWorkerAndNetworkQueue` to simplify\n      configuration where worker and network queues are identical.\n\n    Bug: none\n    Change-Id: Iad95bf32018510cace5687abe71a035c26d11726\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/478960\n    Reviewed-by: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47913}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/audio/channel_send_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/call.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/call_config.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/call_config.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/call_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/rtp_transport_config.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/rtp_transport_controller_send.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/rtp_transport_controller_send.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/rtp_transport_controller_send_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/rtp_video_sender_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/media/engine/webrtc_video_engine_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/media/engine/webrtc_voice_engine_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/pacing/task_queue_paced_sender.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/pacing/task_queue_paced_sender.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/pacing/task_queue_paced_sender_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0001.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0027.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0125.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection_factory.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_tools/video_replay.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/call_test.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/call_test.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/fuzzers/utils/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/fuzzers/utils/rtp_replayer.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/scenario/call_client.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/call_stats2.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/end_to_end_tests/call_operation_tests.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/end_to_end_tests/multi_stream_tester.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/video_send_stream_tests.cc"], "git_node": "73f89959e5ac474898910ef8de758ae5b0f60281", "git_parents": ["c0af589ca686e38bc2bb74f07eea9e878225130e"], "node": "6c36438459020d0f43d5544dac5f3066da6a6192", "parents": ["b0cf7a8fe974604c55537599909cd550c5487be4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from a7fb01c0c1\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/a7fb01c0c15598c5a485b746baef5a15028a3de7\n    Update WebRTC code version (2026-06-07T04:05:09).\n\n    Bug: None\n    Change-Id: If90b4a9071a8359545d34d46957e444b135e81fa\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/479360\n    Commit-Queue: webrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com \u003cwebrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Bot-Commit: webrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com \u003cwebrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47914}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/version.cc"], "git_node": "976f19bd23f7d460ac6685ece3f8ec5131ba20a5", "git_parents": ["73f89959e5ac474898910ef8de758ae5b0f60281"], "node": "17d351f5900f1744f1b9ce208bbe22c39658c1fa", "parents": ["6c36438459020d0f43d5544dac5f3066da6a6192"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from c6bfde4de9\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/c6bfde4de9f93f0e45f9a4a5a3f756e82fb07507\n    Associate RTX with preceding codec in redesign\n\n    In the payload type redesign path, associate RTX codecs with the\n    immediately preceding codec in the supported formats list.\n\n    - pc/typed_codec_vendor.cc: Update CollectVideoCodecConfigurations to\n      associate RTX with the preceding codec. Add validation to reject\n      RTX preceded by a resiliency codec. Skip generic RTX at the end\n      of the formats list if auxiliary codecs are added anyway.\n    - pc/codec_vendor.cc: Use MatchesWithCodecRules and negotiate\n      packetization when merging codecs.\n    - pc/media_session_unittest.cc: Update AddRtxCodec helper to insert\n      RTX after its primary codec in tests. Adjust test expectations to\n      match negotiated codec order (which appends new RTX).\n\n    Bug: webrtc:360058654\n    Change-Id: I667089b8eef502b1da10e4ad811f919dadef2e6d\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/479180\n    Reviewed-by: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47915}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/fake_payload_type_suggester.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0096.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/codec_vendor.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/codec_vendor_redesign_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/media_session_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/typed_codec_vendor.cc"], "git_node": "6358da46f5cf9a31c2282c39bdfc739b0fcf0216", "git_parents": ["976f19bd23f7d460ac6685ece3f8ec5131ba20a5"], "node": "637dc28272bca0ce5fcfc3e886ead35bf62a65e9", "parents": ["17d351f5900f1744f1b9ce208bbe22c39658c1fa"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from aa6281e223\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/aa6281e2231e3dce625003525b5fe00e30863e73\n    Update WebRTC code version (2026-06-08T04:07:43).\n\n    Bug: None\n    Change-Id: I0bd0f98d9cebc714eb2e54f4c6de8047965f26fb\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/479680\n    Bot-Commit: webrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com \u003cwebrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: webrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com \u003cwebrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47916}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/version.cc"], "git_node": "1e34e7bab86d9d43f4d415f56c761266c58cf19d", "git_parents": ["6358da46f5cf9a31c2282c39bdfc739b0fcf0216"], "node": "5d1b72686222c54bff949219059061e8b14accf8", "parents": ["637dc28272bca0ce5fcfc3e886ead35bf62a65e9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from fd40e3870b\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/fd40e3870b698d359cb78edb1e3698ec8170281b\n    Construct Call on the signaling thread\n\n    Move the construction of the Call object owned by PeerConnection from\n    the worker thread to the signaling thread.\n\n    This change:\n    * Removes thread checks in Call constructor and moves repeating tasks\n      startup and stats registration to EnsureStarted().\n    * Updates RtpTransportControllerSend to defer pacer configuration\n      and BWE callback registration to EnsureStarted().\n    * Updates WebRtcVoiceEngine to make audio_state_ const and thread safe.\n    * Updates PeerConnectionFactory to construct Call on signaling thread\n      and safely destroy metronomes on worker thread.\n\n    Bug: webrtc:42222117\n    Change-Id: I88771e127c61b280da29bde8ef9d83e3d74ad06b\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/479480\n    Reviewed-by: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47917}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/call.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/call.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/rtp_transport_controller_send.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/media/engine/webrtc_voice_engine.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/media/engine/webrtc_voice_engine.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0111.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0125.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0136.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/connection_context.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection_factory.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection_factory.h"], "git_node": "d6f75dc796b57a31a6f4d8b01655e8b5e6b7b7f8", "git_parents": ["1e34e7bab86d9d43f4d415f56c761266c58cf19d"], "node": "ad9b217a755be9355dd02e56f5ed84dd1e36872f", "parents": ["5d1b72686222c54bff949219059061e8b14accf8"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 57bc4f89a0\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/57bc4f89a01599519d9ff5139d68fdd3f2c07788\n    Reland \"Migrate test_support_unittests to rtc_test_suite\"\n\n    This is a reland of commit e72179b2a11594b6f7d9df68286bb56edf75b11b\n\n    Original change's description:\n    \u003e Migrate test_support_unittests to rtc_test_suite\n    \u003e\n    \u003e Bug: webrtc:498394143\n    \u003e Change-Id: Ibb9fec5792d7b08d6377a5c42a6ddbfbcafc6c05\n    \u003e Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/474740\n    \u003e Commit-Queue: Jeremy Leconte \u003cjleconte@google.com\u003e\n    \u003e Reviewed-by: Mirko Bonadei \u003cmbonadei@webrtc.org\u003e\n    \u003e Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47897}\n\n    Bug: webrtc:498394143\n    Change-Id: I00a1ac9a731a3bcd5ef25cc131768e619594153a\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/478881\n    Commit-Queue: Jeremy Leconte \u003cjleconte@google.com\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Mirko Bonadei \u003cmbonadei@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47918}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0027.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0034.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0045.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0055.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0082.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0087.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0093.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0096.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0099.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0101.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/resources/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/fuzzers/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/jitter/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/pc/e2e/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/pc/e2e/analyzer/video/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/pc/e2e/analyzer/video/dvqa/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/peer_scenario/bwe_integration_tests/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/peer_scenario/tests/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/scenario/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/time_controller/BUILD.gn"], "git_node": "45c4bbb0b986bf5662c317000150ead808daf1b3", "git_parents": ["d6f75dc796b57a31a6f4d8b01655e8b5e6b7b7f8"], "node": "725b5e13aef87574e76dd6c364a649c4fe05fd8a", "parents": ["ad9b217a755be9355dd02e56f5ed84dd1e36872f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from e5387e2685\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/e5387e2685883e7ecabd74c1e2bd6f482a87e52c\n    Modernize and simplify AudioState\n\n    Update the class to be more in line with the rest of the code, improve\n    thread safety annotations, naming etc of the internal AudioState\n    implementation.\n\n    * Remove the unused process_thread_checker_.\n    * Rename thread_checker_ to worker_thread_checker_ to clarify its\n      underlying purpose.\n    * Add thread safety annotations (RTC_GUARDED_BY and RTC_RUN_ON) to\n      member variables and helper methods to enforce proper access.\n    * Replace std::map with flat_map for storing sending streams to\n      align with the expected memory footprint.\n    * Clean up redundant webrtc:: namespace prefixes across the file.\n    * Mark the audio_device_module() accessor method as const.\n\n    Bug: none\n    Change-Id: Ie97ca8d367bcd12ee790b813ea1f6f2cb1b35ecb\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/479500\n    Commit-Queue: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Jakob Ivarsson\u200e \u003cjakobi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47919}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/audio/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/audio/audio_state.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/audio/audio_state.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/audio_state.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0096.patch"], "git_node": "6e648421034573e95aedbacfd435b4f8de705da9", "git_parents": ["45c4bbb0b986bf5662c317000150ead808daf1b3"], "node": "d1a7080025fa846809fe79ebcbaae467d99c08bf", "parents": ["725b5e13aef87574e76dd6c364a649c4fe05fd8a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from d82ea360a0\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/d82ea360a01fe32b17ff0f3a1c8003560cb8dc89\n    Initialize TaskQueuePacedSender with configuration at construction\n\n    Update TaskQueuePacedSender to support construction-time configuration\n    by introducing a new constructor that accepts PacerConfig. This allows\n    RtpTransportControllerSend to initialize the pacer directly in its\n    constructor initializer list and removes the need for a separate\n    SetConfig call inside EnsureStarted().\n\n    Bug: none\n    Change-Id: I6a438bf0527a749b9fa92937de33d4d704ec0889\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/479520\n    Reviewed-by: Erik Spr\u00e5ng \u003csprang@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47920}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/rtp_transport_controller_send.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/pacing/pacing_controller.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/pacing/pacing_controller.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/pacing/task_queue_paced_sender.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/pacing/task_queue_paced_sender.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/pacing/task_queue_paced_sender_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0125.patch"], "git_node": "3d70f25a90b0f3c7a0fcc4db3da57e6dfc0b6b2b", "git_parents": ["6e648421034573e95aedbacfd435b4f8de705da9"], "node": "e0887dbbcb792a3c2b2006de20615d33e998ea2f", "parents": ["d1a7080025fa846809fe79ebcbaae467d99c08bf"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 400089b88e\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/400089b88ef4fbc44a56a4b65863281f8359b369\n    [dcsctp] Treat forward tsn as payload when saving it for later processing\n\n    To prevent unbound growth of the deferred messages queue\n\n    Bug: b/510385580\n    Change-Id: Ie2125392f6d98ffb7169eca69ecfd303cce46f77\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/478501\n    Reviewed-by: Victor Boivie \u003cboivie@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47921}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/net/dcsctp/rx/reassembly_queue.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/net/dcsctp/rx/reassembly_queue_test.cc"], "git_node": "339ea78c66597135b86abd2f47c0f04b4f0171ca", "git_parents": ["3d70f25a90b0f3c7a0fcc4db3da57e6dfc0b6b2b"], "node": "290fa3ba1149bff23020286c58fb74e196632ed6", "parents": ["e0887dbbcb792a3c2b2006de20615d33e998ea2f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from f295e887f5\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/f295e887f564a418954eec69395052122ac4598b\n    Add `RtcpRttCalculator`.\n\n    This class takes a sequences of RTCP messages (SR, RR, XR) and\n    calculates individual RTT samples. It will be integrated into the video\n    timing simulator in an upcoming change.\n\n    Bug: b/423646186\n    Change-Id: I59661a50a1491cd0dcf79b68d9d9d91519a8d1cd\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/478882\n    Commit-Queue: Rasmus Brandt \u003cbrandtr@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: \u00c5sa Persson \u003casapersson@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47922}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/rtcp_rtt_calculator.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/rtcp_rtt_calculator.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/rtcp_rtt_calculator_unittest.cc"], "git_node": "348d1fcc6722326d64da77c822e5c9a19bf7ff97", "git_parents": ["339ea78c66597135b86abd2f47c0f04b4f0171ca"], "node": "a3c0abb181265388a2d94331f26041b101796a4f", "parents": ["290fa3ba1149bff23020286c58fb74e196632ed6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 0b08bb9e3f\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/0b08bb9e3f459b162e4eb6b75bf77ef0a34e081b\n    Add an allowlist for expand_directory\n\n    This is to fix WebRTC roll into Chromium which was broken by https://chromium-review.git.corp.google.com/c/chromium/src/+/7783246.\n    https://ci.chromium.org/ui/p/webrtc/builders/try/linux_more_configs/88418/overview\n\n    Change-Id: Iaa5314832d18f9171ef9d8edb6ddd02fdae93f8e\n    Bug: None\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/479760\n    Reviewed-by: Ilya Nikolaevskiy \u003cilnik@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Jeremy Leconte \u003cjleconte@google.com\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47923}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0027.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0090.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0094.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0096.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0109.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0142.patch"], "git_node": "14cca0c615743fd9e5420db2979c0ff910c45c32", "git_parents": ["348d1fcc6722326d64da77c822e5c9a19bf7ff97"], "node": "443ad99889e90963e645e7d613f281b1f3f3726a", "parents": ["a3c0abb181265388a2d94331f26041b101796a4f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 8ba84065aa\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/8ba84065aa568022c5453533c32b696ed86f9b4b\n    Don't include private header \u003casm-generic/errno.h\u003e\n\n    https://ci.chromium.org/ui/p/webrtc/builders/try/linux_more_configs/88783/overview\n\n    update include cleaner to not raise an error if the value of _IWYU_MAPPING is already included in the cc file.\n\n    Change-Id: I8b9fa0e3b54a18dba06a7ff0af4e1d73aebd9cda\n    Bug: None\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/478843\n    Commit-Queue: Jeremy Leconte \u003cjleconte@google.com\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47924}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/audio_devic