lt", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 420975b747\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/420975b74748f19700d75669ec52bdc214677b5e\n    RtcpRttCalculator bugfix: do NOT reject reports whose dlsr or dlrr ==0.\n\n    I had misread the RFC, thinking that dlsr or dlrr that were ==0 should\n    be rejected. That is not the case -- we should only reject reports whose\n    lsr or lrr ==0. (Note the missing 'd'.)\n\n    Bug: b/423646186\n    Change-Id: I864a2df87d51efee605c21fa8fba00898ab1a4e9\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/479980\n    Commit-Queue: Rasmus Brandt \u003cbrandtr@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: \u00c5sa Persson \u003casapersson@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47943}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/rtcp_rtt_calculator.cc"], "git_node": "6dfa7401404e312642fc18607d7cff6bd48c5038", "git_parents": ["5c212644ae0cf2483d62bed1b56651678bd556ba"], "node": "b66ca76cc79c50b87aff55a4012a29544cbcc0fb", "parents": ["72cb8ad3ecba87919762de391a18a0be57aaea38"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 7843cb4adc\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/7843cb4adc46703b8e6416d623c8178457d875c5\n    Use CreateTestEnvironment in media tests\n\n    This is needed to get --force-fieldtrials obeyed.\n\n    Bug: None\n    Change-Id: I595f34de59f50e4b1a21da74eb1ce7750e3b7507\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/479802\n    Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47944}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0096.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection_media_unittest.cc"], "git_node": "7e2dc9c90918ec6eea99349757a262b0394deeec", "git_parents": ["6dfa7401404e312642fc18607d7cff6bd48c5038"], "node": "1cdb45a048fad75cfcb73f62f994d449a3bb8b35", "parents": ["b66ca76cc79c50b87aff55a4012a29544cbcc0fb"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from a432b11e56\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/a432b11e569fa530cc65deff43d459af7384309a\n    Use ScopedTaskSafety in WebRtcSessionDescriptionFactory\n\n    Replace WeakPtrFactory with ScopedTaskSafety in\n    WebRtcSessionDescriptionFactory. This simplifies task posting to\n    signaling thread by using SafeTask.\n\n    Bug: none\n    Change-Id: I6af1c82f2b4bad39d874708b925d5121647244c8\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/478844\n    Reviewed-by: Sameer Vijaykar \u003csamvi@google.com\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47945}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0096.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/webrtc_session_description_factory.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/webrtc_session_description_factory.h"], "git_node": "4acb23d1f2432cdedb4ce7d528e0bd202946d56e", "git_parents": ["7e2dc9c90918ec6eea99349757a262b0394deeec"], "node": "3213c5ba502875b40e6837da9bc1e6287cf5de8e", "parents": ["1cdb45a048fad75cfcb73f62f994d449a3bb8b35"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 01794837cc\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/01794837ccc66bac902dc6ee8a61a38171451b31\n    Roll chromium_revision 079ad5b815..d931749ef3 (1643675:1643829)\n\n    Change log: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+log/079ad5b815..d931749ef3\n    