": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 51728d27a5\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/51728d27a5177a091a674ce4528b6ca7d682afaa\n    Add force-test-environment flag and checks\n\n    Add --force-test-environment flag to test_main.\n    This flag sets a global boolean that CreateEnvironment\n    and FieldTrials will check, crashing if they are used\n    in tests instead of the test-specific versions.\n\n    Generated by prompt:\n\n    We want a way to detect if CreateEnvironment or CreateFieldTrials is\n    used in tests where we should be using CreateTestEnvironment or\n    CreateTestFieldTrials. Add code to test/test_main.cc to have a\n    command line flag '--force-test-environment' that sets a global\n    boolean that CreateEnvironment and CreateFieldTrials will RTC_CHECK on\n    so that we immediately crash if the non-test versions are used.\n\n    Bug: webrtc:521534686\n    Change-Id: I7f47b4ccfc396f90d7626d430140e92834b6a483\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/480160\n    Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47947}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/environment/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/environment/environment_factory.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/environment/environment_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/environment/force_test_environment.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/environment/force_test_environment.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/field_trials.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/field_trials_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0027.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0082.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0093.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0096.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0137.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/create_test_environment.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/create_test_field_trials.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/create_test_field_trials_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/create_test_field_trials_without_absl_flag.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/test_main.cc"], "git_node": "64e34711581ef159c7e279d9bac419faeedbc212", "git_parents": ["5bda9ec8d4d1edfbfe9255e77dfe094dd3c185b9"], "node": "6bdf9dd36c066f49f25b45d09b0b3839fa2562ed", "parents": ["f436032c798771fbafa6c2695cfbeabee3457825"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 51728d27a5 - moz.build file updates\n", "files": ["CLOBBER", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/environment/force_test_environment_gn/moz.build", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz.build"], "git_node": "d83aae22319fb5272dbf0f280b6c5635bb3b28de", "git_parents": ["64e34711581ef159c7e279d9bac419faeedbc212"], "node": "1988754363d082b41fbba57c352c80a43875ca4d", "parents": ["6bdf9dd36c066f49f25b45d09b0b3839fa2562ed"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from c1a44ec5a3\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/c1a44ec5a39ecd76a5b98ebd09d1e1c97c7a74da\n    Delete ThreadProcessingFakeClock as unused\n\n    Bug: webrtc:42223992\n    Change-Id: I81a680d0e93aea1031f1a2d82c7ae3351cc9206b\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/478480\n    Commit-Queue: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Auto-Submit: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47948}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/fake_clock.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/fake_clock.h", "third_pa