am-level\n    RTT samples. The session-level RTT will be propagated to the streams\n    through the `RtcEventLogDriver` in an upcoming change.\n\n    Bug: b/423646186\n    Change-Id: Ic0c27123d4a711262b42410e4f28156607736267\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/479142\n    Reviewed-by: \u00c5sa Persson \u003casapersson@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Rasmus Brandt \u003cbrandtr@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47955}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/rtt_simulator.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/rtt_simulator.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/rtt_simulator_unittest.cc"], "git_node": "f29d4d4ab18af36375833525761989642af500b5", "git_parents": ["65610fe7e8c98607df00c0f850ef126d8c339cbd"], "node": "4c310438da2d58701b9d7a062c840f860a006cc2", "parents": ["b7e9b3dce49fe8ac247ccef3744ba4026df98a44"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 41a7487ea4\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/41a7487ea4e604cb5b8a973dd7d1aa44bafa06c1\n    Bugfix: include `rtx_ssrc` in `all_known_ssrcs_`\n\n    By not including it, we might get some log spam when using the `ssrc_filter` functionality.\n\n    Bug: b/423646186\n    Change-Id: I2daaa2df5485176b453324fb0983d074eaaa6103\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/480461\n    Reviewed-by: \u00c5sa Persson \u003casapersson@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: \u00c5sa Persson \u003casapersson@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Auto-Submit: Rasmus Brandt \u003cbrandtr@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47956}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/rtc_event_log_driver.cc"], "git_node": "e5dc1f