": "1835bf0beacbe9ee6d9a088d0967f6bfbfdbdc97", "parents": ["21a7028c94363f41e158c60af23ef718010e3259"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 6d9c53310c\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/6d9c53310cf1849d8d6087823753959e3a11db93\n    Add documentation on SCReAM v2 implementation differences\n\n    This CL adds a new g3doc file describing the differences between the\n    current WebRTC SCReAM v2 implementation and the IETF draft\n    (draft-johansson-ccwg-rfc8298bis-screamv2-07).\n\n    R=perkj@webrtc.org\n\n    Bug: webrtc:447037083\n    Change-Id: I9e26bcbd9bfb9a0102cb356f390e8ff5e98b1ec3\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/480260\n    Reviewed-by: Bj\u00f6rn Terelius \u003cterelius@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Per Kjellander \u003cperkj@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Rasmus Brandt \u003cbrandtr@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47959}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/congestion_controller/scream/g3doc/implementation_diff.md"], "git_node": "49632202e4ae0ae036262dc6ed87da8201013eaa", "git_parents": ["510a5702bb197ab3efe22439d6e5fd32d1f592ca"], "node": "91e73b1710dccc5e79b111ddda460f34ed934031", "parents": ["1835bf0beacbe9ee6d9a088d0967f6bfbfdbdc97"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 83cdac9fb3\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/83cdac9fb3b1877f85c73c1a9f5f796ccecff476\n    Integrate `RttSimulator` into video timing simulator\n\n    In this change, the previously landed `RttSimulator` is integrated into\n    the video timing simulator. The `RtcEventLogDriver` receives the\n    smoothed session-level RTT estimates, and distributes them to the\n    streams. The streams use the RTTs to adapt the NACK module (inside the\n    `Assembler`) and the jitter estimator (inside the `RenderingTracker`).\n\n    Bug: b/423646186\n    Change-Id: I792fcfea7ac7f4bf8d97a73f674a7d5ca8c25727\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/479821\n    Commit-Queue: Rasmus Brandt \u003cbrandtr@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: \u00c5sa Persson \u003casapersson@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47960}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/assembler.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/assembler.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/decodability_simulator.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/rendering_simulator.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/rendering_simulator_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/rendering_tracker.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/rendering_tracker.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/rtc_event_log_driver.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/rtc_event_log_driver.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/rtc_event_log_driver_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/rtt_simulator.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/rtt_simulator_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/test/parsed_rtc_event_log_builder.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/test/parsed_rtc_event_log_builder.h"], "git_node": "6a43d27d487f3be81dae9f6dd53be96b79c9b39e", "git_parents": ["49632202e4ae0ae036262dc6ed87da8201013eaa"], "node": "80f453690998ef18a54b5232db23c834b59579e7", "parents": ["91e73b1710dccc5e79b111ddda460f34ed934031"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 18d2cdb21a\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/18d2cdb21aaee9de48f15a7d91cfe2a8d6b469ec\n 