Reviewed-by: Rasmus Brandt \u003cbrandtr@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47973}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0094.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0096.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0143.patch"], "git_node": "ae7afab3d2c939873973597b28ac225233a71713", "git_parents": ["ddcd709d784d595dcca0b118a93b855d09ff0197"], "node": "7693f449ee7af5f92dfea0f20473e3ce7645599c", "parents": ["8eb29d63150a4260eb4661c72c23e45ee2991970"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from efff37e7f9\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/efff37e7f9780b01f98d5673c58c124cd833226f\n    Sframe: rename Encrypter/Decrypter to Encryptor/Decryptor\n\n    Aligns the SFrame API with the existing -or naming used elsewhere in\n    WebRTC (FrameEncryptorInterface / FrameDecryptorInterface) and with the\n    broader convention in the cryptography/software space, where -or is the\n    overwhelming favorite for non-human components performing an automated\n    operation (encryptor, decryptor, processor, compressor, descriptor).\n\n    This CL is purely a rename: file names, class names, GN target names,\n    member/parameter names, and comments. No behavior changes, no API\n    contract changes beyond the spelling.\n\n    Bug: webrtc:479862368\n    Change-Id: I8eeff299d83c43dc3d267c48dfae9c77a8ee03eb\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/478961\n    Reviewed-by: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47974}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/rtp_receiver_interface.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/rtp_sender_interface.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/sframe/sframe_decrypter_interface.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/sframe/sframe_decryptor_interface.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/sframe/sframe_encrypter_interface.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/sframe/sframe_encryptor_interface.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0027.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0096.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/rtp_receiver.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/rtp_receiver.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/rtp_receiver_proxy.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/rtp_sender.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/rtp_sender.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/rtp_sender_proxy.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/rtp_sender_receiver_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/rtp_transceiver.h"], "git_node": "02f64465fb091ee102fcb86027ae0a39ab3d7fd8", "git_parents": ["ae7afab3d2c939873973597b28ac225233a71713"], "node": "89f131fb8bc43d20f8882ce5152c244af65f1140", "parents": ["7693f449ee7af5f92dfea0f20473e3ce7645599c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from d2f6e778fc\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/d2f6e778fcc09ff158b5918fc94ecb3f9a9193fe\n    Fix peerconnection_unittests for force-test-env\n\n    Update unittests in peerconnection_unittests to use test environment\n    and test field trials instead of production ones, allowing them\n    to pass with the --force-test-environment flag.\n\n    Specifically, fix a lifetime issue in PeerConnectionTestWrapper\n    where the field trials unique_ptr was deleted too early by moving it.\n\n    Bug: webrtc:521534686\n    Change-Id: I36004a5574896fb0fa0c487d2417d8f22f080930\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/480881\n    Commit-Queue: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47975}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0096.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection_audio_options_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection_bundle_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection_data_channel_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection_factory_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection_histogram_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection_ice_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection_interface_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/test/peer_connection_test_wrapper.cc"], "git_node": "e67572e0349ee78a9638e3affab45d604850949c", "git_parents": ["02f64465fb091ee102fcb86027ae0a39ab3d7fd8"], "node": "1e84d80bd2e1fb1fd878a708701ea21d0233da9a", "parents": ["89f131fb8bc43d20f8882ce5152c244af65f1140"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 081a7fb0af\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/081a7fb0af90faf259bae7619d64cd914dfc3415\n    Fix rtc_media_unittests for force-test-env flag\n\n    Update media/ and modules/video_coding/ unittests\n    to use CreateTestEnvironment and CreateTestFieldTrials\n    instead of production versions, allowing\n    rtc_media_unittests to pass with the\n    --force-test-environment flag.\n\n    Bug: webrtc:521534686\n    Change-Id: Id37f4753decb1bd118f9b5a7576dd456dbff515c\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/480880\n    Commit-Queue: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Auto-Submit: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47976}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/media/engine/simulcast_encoder_adapter_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/media/engine/webrtc_video_engine_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/media/engine/webrtc_voice_engine_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/utility/simulcast_test_fixture_impl.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0094.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0096.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0143.patch"], "git_node": "5b9244f1e054c372a9e86e0f8946b6733d39d173", "git_parents": ["e67572e0349ee78a9638e3affab45d604850949c"], "node": "0c59dc0ac29b59e750beb50e7c9a412078906ecf", "parents": ["1e84d80bd2e1fb1fd878a708701ea21d0233da9a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 1ae16aca40\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/1ae16aca40c0e7b415cbcf794e8bfbf0b678c4ef\n    Fix rtc_p2p_unittests for force-test-env flag\n\n    Update p2p unittests to use CreateTestEnvironment and\n    CreateTestFieldTrials instead of production versions,\n    allowing rtc_p2p_unittests to pass with the\n    --force-test-environment flag.\n\n    Bug: webrtc:521534686\n    Change-Id: I7b06f9f86c9b3b8bf7db916120cd21b2e014d21e\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/480980\n    Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47977}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/base/connection_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/dtls/dtls_ice_integration_fixture.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/dtls/dtls_transport_unittest.cc"], "git_node": "b3ae98cef7cbf60ed529e269230bf19eae8c4208", "git_parents": ["5b9244f1e054c372a9e86e0f8946b6733d39d173"], "node": "ca3d92dc8de365b11939b08c221c32e7c679bed9", "parents": ["0c59dc0ac29b59e750beb50e7c9a412078906ecf"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 0b0f9f61eb\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/0b0f9f61eb1a68fd191fd99a77ac8a22ccb5997e\n    [WebRTC] Migrate from Legacy Natives to Proxy Natives\n\n    A deprecated JNI Zero syntax that we would like to migrate away from is called Legacy Natives. It is basically using the \"native\" keyword in Java files to specify Java-\u003eNative methods.\n\n    We would like to migrate these calls to Proxy Natives, where we are using the @NativeMethods annotation in Java files to specify Java-\u003eNative methods.\n\n    Bug: chromium:40253109\n    Change-Id: I11d0a5078f9784c5324ca9d7668339caf8ba0d22\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/476440\n    Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Martin Kong \u003cmartinkong@google.com\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Zo\u00e9 Lepaul \u003czlep@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47978}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/examples/androidnativeapi/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/examples/androidvoip/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0001.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0022.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0027.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0034.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0045.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0069.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0094.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0095.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0096.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0097.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0101.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0108.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_tools/network_tester/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/android/api/org/webrtc/AudioTrack.java", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/android/api/org/webrtc/BuiltinAudioDecoderFactoryFactory.java", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/android/api/org/webrtc/BuiltinAudioEncoderFactoryFactory.java", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/android/api/org/webrtc/CallSessionFileRotatingLogSink.java", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/android/api/org/webrtc/DataChannel.java", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/android/api/org/webrtc/Dav1dDecoder.java", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/android/api/org/webrtc/DtmfSender.java", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/android/api/org/webrtc/Environment.java", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/android/api/org/webrtc/JavaI420Buffer.java", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/android/api/org/webrtc/LibaomAv1Encoder.java", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/android/api/org/webrtc/LibvpxVp8Decoder.java", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/android/api/org/webrtc/LibvpxVp8Encoder.java", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/android/api/org/webrtc/LibvpxVp9Decoder.java", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/android/api/org/webrtc/LibvpxVp9Encoder.java", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/android/api/org/webrtc/MediaSource.java", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/android/api/org/webrtc/MediaStreamTrack.java", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/android/api/org/webrtc/Metrics.java", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/android/api/org/webrtc/SoftwareVideoDecoderFactory.java", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/android/api/org/webrtc/SoftwareVideoEncoderFactory.java", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/android/api/org/webrtc/TimestampAligner.java", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/android/api/org/webrtc/TurnCustomizer.java", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/android/api/org/webrtc/VideoDecoderFallback.java", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/android/api/org/webrtc/VideoEncoderFallback.java", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/android/api/org/webrtc/VideoTrack.java", "third_party/libwebrtc/sdk/android/api/org/webrtc/YuvHelper.java", "third_party/libwebrtc/s