Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47981}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/base/packet_transport_internal_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/test/fake_packet_transport.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/channel_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/rtp_transport_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/srtp_transport_unittest.cc"], "git_node": "d8c9820d9b4b1f3f0b197e5bb182a8f33a5ac737", "git_parents": ["009f19fc1308dadd9a9231a1dd3ef59788de879c"], "node": "f52cd6d3de53a0d9658a73066354daf11b75279c", "parents": ["45c3a51c6c8877714844fcc1b55b2fa7c3e41eb2"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from e3850ce93e\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/e3850ce93ea947387043fc98dd20473aa03217bf\n    stats: use correct IANA registry for SRTP cipher\n\n    which incorrect used the SDES registry, i.e.\n      AES_CM_128_HMAC_SHA1_80\n    instead of the DTLS-SRTP registry, i.e.\n      SRTP_AES128_CM_HMAC_SHA1_80\n    et al.\n\n    Note: this is technically a breaking change.\n\n    PSA: https://groups.google.com/g/discuss-webrtc/c/bEWMKetC40U\n    Bug: webrtc:518266748\n    Change-Id: I6040c576aea993b56cf4033e9c7ff622bbbc9e36\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/477381\n    Reviewed-by: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Guido Urdaneta \u003cguidou@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Philipp Hancke \u003cphilipp.hancke@googlemail.com\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47982}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/rtc_stats_collector_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/openssl_stream_adapter.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/ssl_stream_adapter.cc"], "git_node": "b95fcb1fa0fd3ba0d6291453ab5ec08c599ea260", "git_parents": ["d8c9820d9b4b1f3f0b197e5bb182a8f33a5ac737"], "node": "37c7732213ea7e5d091916ce77bc9bf4fe9d8bd6", "parents": ["f52cd6d3de53a0d9658a73066354daf11b75279c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 198a2b6aa5\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/198a2b6aa5f6449ab3e2b6aecadfbdd968a18824\n    Add pre-reviewer skill containing code review guidelines+best practices\n\n    Introduce a pre-reviewer skill under agents/skills/pre-reviewer. The\n    skill documents common patterns and guidance compiled from C++ reviews.\n\n    This first pass is based on review feedback given by danilchap@ in\n    several recent CLs.\n\n    No-try: true\n    Bug: none\n    Change-Id: I9f13bb1c0190ed68160c72b0c8a29709fa1fd0af\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/481381\n    Commit-Queue: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47983}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/agents/skills/pre-reviewer/SKILL.md"], "git_node": "d2d60ed0da713bac2a8cb678351fa4cebdfe80b6", "git_parents": ["b95fcb1fa0fd3ba0d6291453ab5ec08c599ea260"], "node": "8ffd16ee88a4839d89ba3c53587f6aecfd557e84", "parents": ["37c7732213ea7e5d091916ce77bc9bf4fe9d8bd6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 7708fa5814\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/7708fa58141199ded65072cb5fe595fa2a13f96f\n    Adding dct@ to WebRTC owners.\n\n    Bug: None\n    Change-Id: I5fc73425c3b942a6d2a1107286dd3046159907c3\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/481320\n    Reviewed-by: Denise Tell \u003cdct@google.com\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Mirko Bonadei \u003cmbonadei@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47984}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/OWNERS", "third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor"], "git_node": "ae610373205930cfba9a9d34960aaacc8c0128ee", "git_parents": ["d2d60ed0da713bac2a8cb678351fa4cebdfe80b6"], "node": "cbf5596873b518f81a9d69064b93e10055694505", "parents": ["8ffd16ee88a4839d89ba3c53587f6aecfd557e84"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 55510f917f\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/55510f917f6919cfb3ff8bae0aba918b5c811c11\n    Clean up android build targets\n\n    * use_default_launcher is set to false globally in webrtc.gni\n    * resource_dirs hack is not needed anymore\n\n    Change-Id: I3a92ba6907d1a42b9ad60628fb18788c16078d63\n    Bug: webrtc:152419689\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/481281\n    Reviewed-by: Mirko Bonadei \u003cmbonadei@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Jeremy Leconte \u003cjleconte@google.com\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47985}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/examples/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/examples/androidnativeapi/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/examples/androidvoip/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/audio_coding/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0001.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0027.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0034.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0045.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0055.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0069.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0082.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0087.patch", "third_party