nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/91bf46e3fdba4822b7df95ae44056a22a2260033\n    Add Environment-based constructor to DefaultVideoJitterTiming.\n\n    The existing one will be removed in a separate CL once no longer used.\n\n    Bug: b/493549134\n    Change-Id: I4786ed17b2c6b94c0236c8c17c1581ed362fa6f8\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/482280\n    Commit-Queue: \u00c5sa Persson \u003casapersson@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Rasmus Brandt \u003cbrandtr@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#47999}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/timing/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/timing/default_video_jitter_timing.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/timing/default_video_jitter_timing.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/timing/default_video_jitter_timing_unittest.cc"], "git_node": "41f9e1b5e7233c47ecb93431447ee571b786fdba", "git_parents": ["e31803325c65dd658bca802960ed8e97f861e6d9"], "node": "2a63f8a2a93bcca7d0b0d1bb2be94d72ca3d56c0", "parents": ["7a253cce10c99286cc1919eb068009e4db0725b8"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 1caed75b8c\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/1caed75b8cdaf90100e92aada9d07889386a5fa7\n    [RFC8888] Enable ALR probing when Congestion Control Feedback is enabled.\n\n    When the RFC8888 Congestion Control Feedback (CCFB) experiment is\n    enabled, send-side bandwidth estimation (BWE) is active, but TWCC might\n    not be configured (as feedback is sent via CCFB instead).\n\n    This CL updates VideoSendStreamImpl to check if CCFB is enabled when\n    deciding whether to apply ALR probing and pacing settings. If CCFB is\n    enabled, we allow ALR probing and queue time limits to be configured,\n    but we do NOT set the pacing factor on the transport controller (as\n    pacing is handled exclusively by the congestion controller in this\n    mode).\n\n    This CL also refactors the tests to remove the use of the internal\n    configured_pacing_factor_ member, allowing it to be removed from\n    VideoSendStreamImpl.\n\n    Bug: webrtc:522844909, chromium:523643492\n    Change-Id: I8920e0551b5385de5426a37c926080d90883ce87\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/481601\n    Reviewed-by: Erik Spr\u00e5ng \u003csprang@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Per Kjellander \u003cperkj@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Bj\u00f6rn Terelius \u003cterelius@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48000}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/congestion_controller/goog_cc/goog_cc_network_control.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/video_send_stream_impl.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/video_send_stream_impl.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/video_send_stream_impl_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/video_send_stream_tests.cc"], "git_node": "527f0c9ed812b5ec5eb708b8fd6249cb33cd908a", "git_parents": ["41f9e1b5e7233c47ecb93431447ee571b786fdba"], "node": "6b6451e49e6d3df8cd020e9359ba11aac0c85188", "parents": ["2a63f8a2a93bcca7d0b0d1bb2be94d72ca3d56c0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 7424e9ee54\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/7424e9ee54e8d2a60acea97862ed4954d91dc1bb\n    Roll chromium_revision 01106d5b5d..f87cbd2513 (1646328:1646681)\n\n    Change log: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+log/01106d5b5d..f87cbd2513\n    Full diff: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/01106d5b5d..f87cbd2513\n\n    Changed dependencies\n    * src/build: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/build/+log/d1acf1ffaf..4cd1b3187e\n    * src/ios: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/ios/+log/46c81cebf7..1da199984a\n    * src/testing: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/testing/+log/7bb5f0aa05..6511455f15\n    * src/third_party: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/third_party/+log/afd5049432..fa28529bf6\n    * src/third_party/boringssl/src: https://boringssl.googlesource.com/boringssl.git/+log/5124f7e67b..825a42ab64\n    * src/third_party/compiler-rt/src: https://chromium.googlesource.com/external/github.com/llvm/llvm-project/compiler-rt.git/+log/c556c9b651..bc97b63a26\n    * src/third_party/depot_tools: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/tools/depot_tools.git/+log/30e761311c..eb6357f46c\n    * src/third_party/eigen3/src: https://chromium.googlesource.com/external/gitlab.com/libeigen/eigen.git/+log/5b3089dd7b..fc56f71c7e\n    * src/third_party/google-truth/src: https://chromium.googlesource.com/external/github.com/google/truth.git/+log/2c6bc15ab7..2b500d6f97\n    * src/third_party/grpc/src: https://chromium.googlesource.com/external/github.com/grpc/grpc.git/+log/4370fdfbee..ff38d87dd6\n    * src/third_party/jsoncpp/source: https://chromium.googlesource.com/external/github.com/open-source-parsers/jsoncpp.git/+log/d4d0721772..5f1f240f10\n    * src/third_party/libpfm4/src: https://chromium.googlesource.com/external/git.code.sf.net/p/perfmon2/libpfm4.git/+log/fbcd0c258b..6870a9f004\n    * src/third_party/llvm-libc/src: https://chromium.googlesource.com/external/github.com/llvm/llvm-project/libc.git/+log/a853da69cd..6512d233b3\n    * src/third_party/perfetto: https://chromium.googlesource.com/external/github.com/google/perfetto.git/+log/a78362f0e2..01c9b1e4b5\n    * src/tools: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/tools/+log/6803984f61..93d11739ea\n    DEPS diff: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/01106d5b5d..f87cbd2513/DEPS\n\n    BUG=None\n\n    Change-Id: I1c99b6690970c12582eb7ce69a51947cdfaf0143\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/482380\n    Bot-Commit: chromium-webrtc-autoroll@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com \u003cchromium-webrtc-autoroll@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: chromium-webrtc-autoroll@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com \u003cchromium-webrtc-autoroll@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48001}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/DEPS", "third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor"], "git_node": "ddffb2937e6700d2f2e960cb0a3a949cc67516d0", "git_parents": ["527f0c9ed812b5ec5eb708b8fd6249cb33cd908a"], "node": "c418a26dcf6e5d1b479ca5cd6e446cf240f202f1", "parents": ["6b6451e49e6d3df8cd020e9359ba11aac0c85188"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from e1caa732b4\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/e1caa732b402c0d293dc53a5f3331d3c7d010303\n    Consolidate temporal layer limit to kMaxTemporalStreams\n\n    The VP8 and VP9 RTP reference finders defined their own local constant,\n    `kMaxTemporalLayers`, with a value of 5. This was inconsistent with the\n    global constant `kMaxTemporalStreams`, which has a value of 4 and is\n    used for this purpose elsewhere.\n\n    This patch removes the redundant local `kMaxTemporalLayers` definitions\n    in `rtp_vp8_ref_finder.h` and `rtp_vp9_ref_finder.h`. All usages (array\n    bounds, frame validation checks, and log messages) are updated to use\n    the global `kMaxTemporalStreams` constant instead.\n\n    This change aligns the validation logic with the rest of the codebase,\n    dropping frames with a temporal index of 4 or greater.\n\n    Fixed: chromium:456855150\n    Change-Id: I0de0b2b765ccf9bef30dfbca504b9c9f7179dabe\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/422720\n    Reviewed-by: Erik Spr\u00e5ng \u003csprang@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Johannes Kron \u003ckron@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48002}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/rtp_vp8_ref_finder.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/rtp_vp8_ref_finder.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/rtp_vp9_ref_finder.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/rtp_vp9_ref_finder.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/rtp_vp9_ref_finder_unittest.cc"], "git_node": "ce86d7d02a5061fdf740914fc641d43a23270fad", "git_parents": ["ddffb2937e6700d2f2e960cb0a3a949cc67516d0"], "node": "69eb541aeb88c5fc42cacf6516fc5069383ad700", "parents": ["c418a26dcf6e5d1b479ca5cd6e446cf240f202f1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 2446962413\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/24469624138212f987bcdcdba7a6d33251ab0001\n    Remove unused environment_factory dependencies\n\n    Remove dependencies on api/environment:environment_factory from targets\n    that do not use it (none of the source files include environment_factory.h).\n\n    Bug: webrtc:521534686\n    Change-Id: I0e258d6f24a1d1012689ae2a1b2f7a5d40c58d74\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/482420\n    Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48003}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/audio/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/audio_codecs/opus/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/audio_codecs/test/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/video_codecs/test/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/audio/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/audio/voip/test/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/media/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/audio_coding/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/audio_proce