742", "parents": ["8d452e819a5f2a61cbb82d1d7aa93d1e17ff7762"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from d5276a0762\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/d5276a0762965a2d528acee0c9663540d82904e4\n    Cleanup unused code in test audio Channel\n\n    - Remove construction parameter and derived code as unused.\n    - Remove Bitrate function and thus need for this type to query time through the global time functions.\n\n    Bug: webrtc:42223992\n    Change-Id: I229caaec0151916097c482cc471d958017c731f2\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/481580\n    Commit-Queue: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Jakob Ivarsson\u200e \u003cjakobi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48006}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/audio_coding/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/audio_coding/test/Channel.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/audio_coding/test/Channel.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0027.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0093.patch"], "git_node": "800a897bdb54d22ff48a53c80f87335049f95ff6", "git_parents": ["3e76dc9ec1d60d040e801f15d6e8d86202a574ab"], "node": "2384b2d494e7afc0e0f5b4536f5174998bcb8105", "parents": ["d3bfcc06e8198dadd63ecee5db58900c91868742"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 55058f4f3a\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/55058f4f3ad6de9a8c3101a5e0b410f265c36849\n    Fix extmap URI validation in SDP parsing and sanitise logging\n\n    Update SDP parsing of extmap URIs to reject raw control characters and\n    percent-encoded control characters.\n\n    Bug: webrtc:509982955\n    Change-Id: I3aeff9e0f3b59490476e20a89ab5579ceed41824\n    Reviewed-on: h