ndor"], "git_node": "632fd44543a0f5102b55885db8afefec35f92c01", "git_parents": ["abe73afcf1e51328115398dc0871d1584d17a805"], "node": "7ec651aa06051160e46fa97f6dac3d14a03f8847", "parents": ["f967302c37e6f4d68d77452f841ce45019bf1111"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 478a8e6bda\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/478a8e6bda67c7501e48adabd053a4a4cee3b75c\n    Fix double zlep in android/OWNERS\n\n    They can't be both legacy and new.\n\n    No-try: True\n    Bug: None\n    Change-Id: I31e20ffdb59ba12a06b188a792815cbc7e3d465e\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/482700\n    Auto-Submit: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Mirko Bonadei \u003cmbonadei@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Mirko Bonadei \u003cmbonadei@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48015}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor"], "git_node": "15acd93ed742e20d19caf218f9dbd8c4ad40c317", "git_parents": ["632fd44543a0f5102b55885db8afefec35f92c01"], "node": "970ba1ad680a880ab4c3ddf5323cfe6826f88270", "parents": ["7ec651aa06051160e46fa97f6dac3d14a03f8847"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 85db644285\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/85db64428518119bc32bd2118668d1382a72de9a\n    Improve threading annotations in `RenderingTracker`.\n\n    Bug: b/423646186\n    Change-Id: Ibb174296f6f48460946f286af8da729634f50a84\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/481360\n    Auto-Submit: Rasmus Brandt \u003cbrandtr@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: \u00c5sa Persson \u003casapersson@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: \u00c5sa Persson \u003casapersson@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48016}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/rendering_tracker.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/rendering_tracker.h"], "git_node": "87dfb056901ae2250c5f0ec8d2fa20f27603436d", "git_parents": ["15acd93ed742e20d19caf218f9dbd8c4ad40c317"], "node": "c624506a5f653a1bda0972ceeca88aef8b0c960d", "parents": ["970ba1ad680a880ab4c3ddf5323cfe6826f88270"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 9cb2a61b06\n\nEssentially a no-op since we're going to see this change\nreverted when we vendor in 031d798a20.\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/9cb2a61b06bacaeb9a7abedc1d00517d7f79548d\n    Make RtpHeaderExtensionId(int) explicit\n\n    Make RtpHeaderExtensionId(int) constructor explicit to prevent\n    implicit conversions. Added a deprecated template constructor to\n    allow implicit conversion downstream to avoid breaking them. Also\n    added explicit constructor for uint8_t to avoid matching the template\n    in WebRTC.\n\n    Bug: webrtc:514817938\n    Change-Id: I5f8a03dc2ffb6d6d76164e734e1627f07727da49\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/482540\n    Commit-Queue: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48017}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/031d798a20.no-op-cherry-pick-msg", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/p0001.patch"], "git_node": "72d100b8a3e299e77e50ec46faa8bad364209000", "git_parents": ["87dfb056901ae2250c5f0ec8d2fa20f27603436d"], "node": "605738b03a3eace0a282b329b1724086b603fe5d", "parents": ["c624506a5f653a1bda0972ceeca88aef8b0c960d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 031d798a20\n\nWe already cherry-picked this when we vendored 9cb2a61b06.\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/031d798a20cc5d9c867598a38632accb20c6effe\n    Revert \"Make RtpHeaderExtensionId(int) explicit\"\n\n    This reverts commit 9cb2a61b06bacaeb9a7abedc1d00517d7f79548d.\n\n    Reason for revert: Suspected downstream failures.\n\n    Failure Link: https://fusion2.corp.google.com/invocations/abc66f5c-f5bc-4767-8ff8-e67efeaa0f7c/targets/%2F%2Fbuzz%2Ftest%2Fpclf%2Ftests:absolute_capture_time_test_experiments_launched;config=a544fae14671853db631fbeeb923d84e665cd2045db88e266d17af360c6b5925/tests?q=status:failed%20OR%20status:broken%20OR%20status:cancelled%20OR%20status:running%20OR%20status:timed_out%20OR%20status:tool_failure%20label:buildbucket-8678846321400548705\n\n    Original change's description:\n    \u003e Make RtpHeaderExtensionId(int) explicit\n    \u003e\n    \u003e Make RtpHeaderExtensionId(int) constructor explicit to prevent\n    \u003e implicit conversions. Added a deprecated template constructor to\n    \u003e allow implicit conversion downstream to avoid breaking them. Also\n    \u003e added explicit constructor for uint8_t to avoid matching the template\n    \u003e in WebRTC.\n    \u003e\n    \u003e Bug: webrtc:514817938\n    \u003e Change-Id: I5f8a03dc2ffb6d6d76164e734e1627f07727da49\n    \u003e Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/482540\n    \u003e Commit-Queue: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    \u003e Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    \u003e Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48017}\n\n    Bug: webrtc:514817938\n    No-Presubmit: true\n    No-Tree-Checks: true\n    No-Try: true\n    Change-Id: I367b804a5f3af448f1ce49b8f178a079edab1612\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/482800\n    Auto-Submit: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Jeremy Leconte \u003cjleconte@google.com\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Jeremy Leconte \u003cjleconte@google.com\u003e\n    Bot-Commit: rubber-stamper@appspot.gserviceaccount.com \u003crubber-stamper@appspot.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: rubber-stamper@appspot.gserviceaccount.com \u003crubber-stamper@appspot.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48018}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/031d798a20.no-op-cherry-pick-msg", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/p0001.patch"], "git_node": "4c0bf3e6823397cef2630a43b3ed7068976f26fb", "git_parents": ["72d100b8a3e299e77e50ec46faa8bad364209000"], "node": "c1bcd6f6bbb93c15c32ea9754ee70790b7cf04ab", "parents": ["605738b03a3eace0a282b329b1724086b603fe5d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from dc6bb59f6b\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/dc6bb59f6b07c9f3d7dc0188b5cdf28e4e270f1c\n    Roll chromium_revision 908858e632..e3bb41fa95 (1647332:1647438)\n\n    Change log: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+log/908858e632..e3bb41fa95\n    Full diff: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/908858e632..e3bb41fa95\n\n    Changed dependencies\n    * src/build: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/build/+log/0fdbc45298..44ba1f8618\n    * src/ios: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/ios/+log/9dda2cd80e..0a4639dc60\n    * src/testing: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/testing/+log/1b7c5746f0..6860555ced\n    * src/third_party: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/third_party/+log/c821452c17..80d7ea1b85\n    * src/third_party/androidx/cipd: UY_vBgBotCy5O0ZUQpJajcmcmc3nPHHfzQW5MPA1N_gC..rO584iETQkpleG9Y6EERCmFHbtQUTb3P37MUxw3vdn8C\n    * src/third_party/depot_tools: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/tools/depot_tools.git/+log/fb8d33261b..10eda50a3f\n    * src/third_party/grpc/src: https://chromium.googlesource.com/external/github.com/grpc/grpc.git/+log/5e5217df7e..8e43f7e85c\n    * src/tools: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/tools/+log/dec866d0d8..72a9404c95\n    DEPS diff: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/908858e632..e3bb41fa95/DEPS\n\n    BUG=None\n\n    Change-Id: I4805e09fdab755cc5657c44350d99310c0e0aa67\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/482780\n    Bot-Commit: chromium-webrtc-autoroll@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com \u003cchromium-webrtc-autoroll@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: chromium-webrtc-autoroll@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com \u003cchromium-webrtc-autoroll@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48019}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/DEPS", "third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor"], "git_node": "8a77f1c2ea2c5f65616b30be15ed602124a2021d", "git_parents": ["4c0bf3e6823397cef2630a43b3ed7068976f26fb"], "node": "225e36da2e210e76542de9097387154313dc7ceb", "parents": ["c1bcd6f6bbb93c15c32ea9754ee70790b7cf04ab"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 21c8bd5b1f\n\nEssentially a no-op since we're going to see this change\nreverted when we vendor in 16a6280205.\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/21c8bd5b1fb6f4e3b1cc96fd928e18dc6281f67a\n    SetLocalDescription: Avoid redundant offer/answer generation\n\n    In parameterless SetLocalDescription(), we currently always generate a\n    new description. This change optimizes it by reusing the last created\n    offer or answer if no renegotiable state changes have occurred since it\n    was generated.\n\n    Bug: chromium:40120757\n    Change-Id: I158c0b900adde0966537ef274d0d750492e68449\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/481600\n    Reviewed-by: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48020}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/16a6280205.no-op-cherry-pick-msg", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/p0001.patch"], "git_node": "0bf6c74a231bd6e8170740b73c3b74db0791e698", "git_parents": ["8a77f1c2ea2c5f65616b30be15ed602124a2021d"], "node": "a446a6e8038eadcd0a5a7988792c17192ca0f9c0", "parents": ["225e36da2e210e76542de9097387154313dc7ceb"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from f55e8b2e21\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/f55e8b2e21caf852394864399be30ec7eacf3e0b\n    Update RFC8888 feedback_fraction from 0.05 to 0.1 in l4s_test.cc\n\n    A feedback fraction of 0.05 can be too restrictive or infrequent in certain bandwidth-limited or test scenarios. Updating to 0.1 ensures timelier feedback generation and stable congestion control behavior across BWE integration tests.\n\n    Bug: webrtc:519655843\n    Change-Id: I40b70035a68b6d66d757df137b23e7c842df4b44\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/482760\n    Reviewed-by: Bj\u00f6rn Terelius \u003cterelius@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Per Kjellander \u003cperkj@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48021}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/peer_scenario/bwe_integration_tests/l4s_test.cc"], "git_node": "420638a8d1befe5272c711200026867f973133e5", "git_parents": ["0bf6c74a231bd6e8170740b73c3b74db0791e698"], "node": "0e942181c012a4fe3cbf1dd3040e5d64079e3224", "parents": ["a446a6e8038eadcd0a5a7988792c17192ca0f9c0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 16a6280205\n\nWe already cherry-picked this when we vendored 21c8bd5b1f.\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/16a62802051a3ef428cf272431e06813b2c6cd07\n    Revert \"SetLocalDescription: Avoid redundant offer/answer generation\"\n\n    This reverts commit 21c8bd5b1fb6f4e3b1cc96fd928e18dc6281f67a.\n\n    Reason for revert: Downstream issues need to be investigated.\n\n    Original change's description:\n    \u003e SetLocalDescription: Avoid redundant offer/answer generation\n    \u003e\n    \u003e In parameterless SetLocalDescription(), we currently always generate a\n    \u003e new description. This change optimizes it by reusing the last created\n    \u003e offer or answer if no renegotiable state changes have occurred since it\n    \u003e was generated.\n    \u003e\n    \u003e Bug: chromium:40120757\n    \u003e Change-Id: I158c0b900adde0966537ef274d0d750492e68449\n    \u003e Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/481600\n    \u003e Reviewed-by: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    \u003e Commit-Queue: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    \u003e Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48020}\n\n    Bug: chromium:40120757\n    No-Presubmit: true\n    No-Tree-Checks: true\n    No-Try: true\n    Change-Id: Id9b549b3e220245476c00a686fe947a000aefe4b\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/482920\n    Auto-Submit: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Bot-Commit: rubber-stamper@appspot.gserviceaccount.com \u003crubber-stamper@appspot.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: rubber-stamper@appspot.gserviceaccount.com \u003crubber-stamper@appspot.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48022}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/16a6280205.no-op-cherry-pick-msg", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/p0001.patch"], "git_node": "f6c42f2c2c726397b71541ee9f4106ca6c933600", "git_parents": ["420638a8d1befe5272c711200026867f973133e5"], "node": "f9a44ffc69dbdfac15dd297f785a81dabbf9ebf8", "parents": ["0e942181c012a4fe3cbf1dd3040e5d64079e3224"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 1b3d0f781e\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/1b3d0f781e4e4560258f2a5fa9202474b456f3f3\n    Change force-test-environment flag to true\n\n    This will enforce use of CreateTestEnvironment on all tests\n    that use test_main for their main.\n\n    Bug: webrtc:521534686\n    Change-Id: Ibf746bde7a6b0e3407b5f0e921038832fba80b9c\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/480960\n    Commit-Queue: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48023}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/test_main.cc"], "git_node": "7889ac48254e01a477049b74b4c5f8e7939a5c97", "git_parents": ["f6c42f2c2c726397b71541ee9f4106ca6c933600"], "node": "678868d69d62baac7fca53588d9e7e64d013313e", "parents": ["f9a44ffc69dbdfac15dd297f785a81dabbf9ebf8"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 52da1ea818\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/52da1ea818a8368899a37cc5e4d9d533f076ec17\n    Use accessors to reach into ASN1_STRING\n\n    This does the same thing, just is a bit more future-proof for when\n    BoringSSL and OpenSSL make the type opaque in the future.\n\n    Bug: chromium:443769299\n    Change-Id: I4a74db8ef58bbd464e6a6a46b31b20aada746432\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/462700\n    Auto-Submit: David Benjamin \u003cdavidben@google.com\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: David Benjamin \u003cdavidben@google.com\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Mirko Bonadei \u003cmbonadei@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48024}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/boringssl_certificate.cc"], "git_node": "cf6981b9ab028398dd338c5491b78d080280489d", "git_parents": ["7889ac48254e01a477049b74b4c5f8e7939a5c97"], "node": "5471a758139417dfde31404992d65cc3cce13cd9", "parents": ["678868d69d62baac7fca53588d9e7e64d013313e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 33875ce0b4\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/33875ce0b4287376e7642c412be2a1975a78d425\n    Remove deprecated symbols from rtc_base and p2p\n\n    Remove deprecated methods from:\n    - DtlsTransportInternal\n    - ByteBufferWriterT\n    - VirtualSocketServer\n    - SampleStats\n    - ProxyBinding\n    - AsyncProxyServerSocket\n    - Socket\n    - SSLAdapter\n\n    And some untagged Subscribe methods from Connection,\n    IceTransportInternal, Port, PortInterface, and\n    PortAllocator\n\n    Bug: webrtc:465197113, webrtc:42225170, webrtc:42224904\n    Change-Id: Idf44ea082d561f43162144337c18e6a17f18ee50\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/482761\n    Commit-Queue: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Auto-Submit: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48025}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/g3doc/todo/remove_deprecated.md", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/base/connection.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/base/ice_transport_internal.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/base/ice_transport_internal.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/base/port.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/base/port.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/base/port_allocator.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/base/port_interface.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/base/port_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/dtls/dtls_transport_internal.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/byte_buffer.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/byte_buffer_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/numerics/sample_stats.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/numerics/sample_stats.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/openssl_adapter.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/openssl_adapter.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/proxy_server.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/server_socket_adapters.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/ssl_adapter.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/virtual_socket_server.h"], "git_node": "11157701f67c783470868a9720bf7914da9c4571", "git_parents": ["cf6981b9ab028398dd338c5491b78d080280489d"], "node": "1256ac06f8023b74ed1f342a473a5cbcf4f03ff9", "parents": ["5471a758139417dfde31404992d65cc3cce13cd9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 86fc980100\n\nEssentially a no-op since we're going to see this change\nreverted when we vendor in ff95cab2f0.\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/86fc98010046899a27f3804668b28fdc3e6781cd\n    Exclude rate_tracker_rust_tests from ASan builds\n\n    In is_asan=true is_debug=false builds, it fails to link (see bug).\n    Exclude it to unbreak the builds.\n\n    Bug: chromium:513478482\n    Change-Id: Iceae7d2b94e3a2ce014f2da2f0dad2e136c125f9\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/482721\n    Commit-Queue: Hans Wennborg \u003chans@chromium.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Mirko Bonadei \u003cmbonadei@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48026}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/ff95cab2f0.no-op-cherry-pick-msg", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/p0001.patch"], "git_node": "c43c0b438c4a4079be1fc48c342c701cb62513e5", "git_parents": ["11157701f67c783470868a9720bf7914da9c4571"], "node": "e8771409887c9b5da72c7b0443ae13b025151887", "parents": ["1256ac06f8023b74ed1f342a473a5cbcf4f03ff9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from cb0f1fad49\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/cb0f1fad496956c0c03af9a968be9d8e46809a40\n    Roll chromium_revision e3bb41fa95..ee69804239 (1647438:1647621)\n\n    Change log: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+log/e3bb41fa95..ee69804239\n    Full diff: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/e3bb41fa95..ee69804239\n\n    Changed dependencies\n    * src/build: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/build/+log/44ba1f8618..9428d4f9bb\n    * src/ios: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/ios/+log/0a4639dc60..21d40fe48d\n    * src/testing: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/testing/+log/6860555ced..ae62c08ecd\n    * src/third_party: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/third_party/+log/80d7ea1b85..365b570c3f\n    * src/third_party/androidx/cipd: rO584iETQkpleG9Y6EERCmFHbtQUTb3P37MUxw3vdn8C..Im-uadqQ0bQc6KGQzqsMigS3Yf2tltXJbmWh82zQ_eIC\n    * src/third_party/boringssl/src: https://boringssl.googlesource.com/boringssl.git/+log/a30f663a47..bd6f41c308\n    * src/third_party/breakpad/breakpad: https://chromium.googlesource.com/breakpad/breakpad.git/+log/5359c2336d..432f6631bd\n    * src/third_party/grpc/src: https://chromium.googlesource.com/external/github.com/grpc/grpc.git/+log/8e43f7e85c..7aaeb28ba7\n    * src/third_party/llvm-libc/src: https://chromium.googlesource.com/external/github.com/llvm/llvm-project/libc.git/+log/628eb31790..5ff32e4427\n    * src/tools: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/tools/+log/72a9404c95..a00e59ef1c\n    DEPS diff: https://c