c/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/version.cc"], "git_node": "e860e148f8a2ad639f11b173e21d86693141e10a", "git_parents": ["d4ce66d42db5833cf52b8c3fb243c277f081da91"], "node": "6bb609264db8df9c2291ee7696a05d97f7cfbfe7", "parents": ["f7c0290b2a1d7541ce68eebc83d17c250800438c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049872 - Vendor libwebrtc from 43dd156d2f\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/43dd156d2fe074db4f942b237c65a0c52cc14f65\n    Refactor media constants to inline constexpr absl::string_view\n\n    This CL converts most string constants in media/base/media_constants.h\n    to inline constexpr absl::string_view, moving their definitions to the\n    header file. Constants marked with RTC_EXPORT are preserved as\n    extern const char[] for ABI compatibility.\n\n    Infrastructure updates:\n    - Updated CodecParameterMap to use a transparent comparator (std::less\u003c\u003e)\n      allowing lookups with string_view.\n    - Updated Codec, SdpVideoFormat, and SdpAudioFormat to better handle\n      absl::string_view in constructors and parameter methods.\n    - systemically updated downstream call sites to use SetParam or explicit\n      std::string conversions where necessary.\n\n    Bug: webrtc:42223790\n    Change-Id: I017fd4e6c85b072a8d31aa0aec09cb1264464627\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/467720\n    Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Harald Alvestrand \u003chta@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48098}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/audio_codecs/audio_format.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/audio_codecs/audio_format.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/rtp_parameters.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/rtp_parameters_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/test/pclf/media_configuration.cc", "t