03cmconley@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055945 - Remove version documentGlobal fallbacks in BrowserTestUtils and ContentTaskUtils. r=florian\n\nThese shims were added so that newtab could trainhop to versions before 152. Now that\n152 is EOL, we can remove the shims.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D312819\n", "files": ["testing/mochitest/BrowserTestUtils/BrowserTestUtils.sys.mjs", "testing/specialpowers/content/ContentTaskUtils.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "42bf3093a18a9a78f3f740e2a284ea8f9c5c37ad", "git_parents": ["3a6de55e12daccda7ede9396a64460c25cf11829"], "node": "d53212cad6ea25e8094251a7666173394e9c439c", "parents": ["06604f2b7da3d0a445f5590380c75d799009a690"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Florian Zia \u003cfzia@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2051359 - Part 1: Add small size variant to ai-website-chip r=czhou\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D312330\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-website-chip/ai-website-chip.css", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-website-chip/ai-website-chip.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-website-chip/ai-website-chip.stories.mjs"], "git_node": "39b8b137c7c6d3abc401d9018bf0205ee48b7bc4", "git_parents": ["42bf3093a18a9a78f3f740e2a284ea8f9c5c37ad"], "node": "41b545b46163be9d471ae149024318da5c04ec86", "parents": ["d53212cad6ea25e8094251a7666173394e9c439c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Florian Zia \u003cfzia@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2051359 - Part 2: Support custom child items in smartwindow-panel-list r=czhou\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D312331\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/smartwindow-panel-list/smartwindow-panel-list.css", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/smartwindow-panel-list/smartwindow-panel-list.mjs"], "git_node": "69639fa7bb7740ea4ff708f388123cc8789d0cd6", "git_parents": ["39b8b137c7c6d3abc401d9018bf0205ee48b7bc4"], "node": "67717fa1bfcc1cb8a4f38bc6684b3110cec90156", "parents": ["41b545b46163be9d471ae149024318da5c04ec86"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Florian Zia \u003cfzia@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2051359 - Part 3: Add citation component for assistant chat messages r=fluent-reviewers,czhou,bolsson\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D312332\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-chat-content/chat-assistant-citations/chat-assistant-citations.css", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-chat-content/chat-assistant-citations/chat-assistant-citations.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-chat-content/chat-assistant-citations/chat-assistant-citations.stories.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/jar.mn", "browser/locales/en-US/browser/aiWindowContent.ftl"], "git_node": "1bd4d53e00717061dd6dd936fce5933c54dbdaeb", "git_parents": ["69639fa7bb7740ea4ff708f388123cc8789d0cd6"], "node": "ec6faa4337d372bf80698172d6038fd83a04472d", "parents": ["67717fa1bfcc1cb8a4f38bc6684b3110cec90156"], "tags": []}, {"author": "AndiAJ \u003candiaj@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057154 - Fix SettingsSavedPasswordsPage navigation reachability UI test r=aaronmt\n\nBased on past problems encountered with our \"legacy\" tests in some cases espresso clicks the wrong elements.\n\nBecause of this, I've switched from the ESPRESSO_BY_TEXT to UIAUTOMATOR_WITH_TEXT selector strategy.\n\nAll navigation reachability UI tests successfully passed 50x on Firebase \u2705\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313717\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/selectors/SettingsSelectors.kt"], "git_node": "8ac5089979ee340ffa12eae798bb597cc4bbe49a", "git_parents": ["1bd4d53e00717061dd6dd936fce5933c54dbdaeb"], "node": "bfb75acbecdcc670b7ad8e3428b0a9639f58fe36", "parents": ["ec6faa4337d372bf80698172d6038fd83a04472d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "acreskeyMoz \u003cacreskey@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2056992 - Don't report the HTTP version in network markers for cached responses r=necko-reviewers,kershaw\n\nFor a cached response (including a 304 revalidation) the response head's version reflects the original fetch, not this request's connection.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313587\n", "files": ["netwerk/protocol/http/HttpChannelChild.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpChannel.cpp"], "git_node": "0318aba862cd34b4b2357bc39d74bdc6c8e92bda", "git_parents": ["8ac5089979ee340ffa12eae798bb597cc4bbe49a"], "node": "b8d8a02dc669008c43883670bd5cfffde532586a", "parents": ["bfb75acbecdcc670b7ad8e3428b0a9639f58fe36"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Stephen Thompson \u003csthompson@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055035 - fix Nova failure for browser_navigator_clipboard_contextmenu_suppression.js r=edgar\n\nPerform the middle-click paste in the center of the content document instead of the (1,1) position.\n\nIn the Proton design, the `.browserContainer` around the content window usually does not have a rounded corner in the upper-left, although there is an 8px border-radius when `sidebar.revamp` is enabled. In the Nova design, the `.browserContainer` has a platform-specific border radius, with macOS Tahoe and later having the largest value at 16px. When the mouse event occurs at (1,1), it's outside of the region clipped by .browserContainer so the paste event is never fired in the content document.\n\nIt didn't seem like the position of the paste was important, so I decided to perform the click in the center instead of using a different set of hardcoded offsets.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313657\n", "files": ["dom/events/test/clipboard/browser_navigator_clipboard_contextmenu_suppression.js"], "git_node": "2900b57e6b650616080b9a9366f02429d0070f05", "git_parents": ["0318aba862cd34b4b2357bc39d74bdc6c8e92bda"], "node": "d5baab8c492d8200ba6e812c684ebb9f7292705b", "parents": ["b8d8a02dc669008c43883670bd5cfffde532586a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "acreskeyMoz \u003cacreskey@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2056999 - Don't record http_ver in the pageload event for revalidated responses r=necko-reviewers,kershaw\n\nAccumulatePageLoadTelemetry already skips http_ver for plain cache hits; extend that to 304 revalidations, which have the same stale-version problem.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313588\n", "files": ["dom/base/Document.cpp"], "git_node": "3bb63336ddd6fb72b08b44cc7fd322fb2acb934a", "git_parents": ["2900b57e6b650616080b9a9366f02429d0070f05"], "node": "7abb0dc4327a660258e04e80e6f1c337c7bcd31d", "parents": ["d5baab8c492d8200ba6e812c684ebb9f7292705b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Christopher DiPersio \u003ccdipersio@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057024 - Memories in v1 schema pre-source field do not convert to v2 r=cmurray,ai-platform-reviewers,thasan\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313610\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/services/MemoryStore.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/services/tests/xpcshell/test_MemoryStore.js"], "git_node": "5235d59814a561984b5473597d47b2750c091770", "git_parents": ["3bb63336ddd6fb72b08b44cc7fd322fb2acb934a"], "node": "59128e8c59815d28a10ea774c611d07eac88dfc8", "parents": ["7abb0dc4327a660258e04e80e6f1c337c7bcd31d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "AndiAJ \u003candiaj@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2053797 - Migrate verifyTheSaveAsPDFSubMenuOptionTest UI test to the efficiency framework r=aaronmt\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D311303\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/MainMenuTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/helpers/BasePage.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/selectors/DownloadsSelectors.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/selectors/MainMenuSelectors.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/tests/MainMenuTest.kt"], "git_node": "dc281bc2d7aab1138a26e48839fb36e5e3fbf186", "git_parents": ["5235d59814a561984b5473597d47b2750c091770"], "node": "4625e50b425eac44527272d3328578eb715688d2", "parents": ["59128e8c59815d28a10ea774c611d07eac88dfc8"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2051959 - [IPC Urlbar] Phase 6: Add an onProviderEngagement notification so content can await a provider's engagement side effect. r=daleharvey\n\nProvider `onEngagement` hooks run parent-side, so a provider's engagement side\neffect (e.g. `UrlbarProviderUnitConversion` copying its result to the clipboard)\nlands on the content side asynchronously over the actor message path, with no\nsignal content can wait on. Add a controller notification, `onProviderEngagement`,\nfired once the picked result's provider has handled the engagement, so\ncontent-side listeners can await that the side effect has run. It fires\nsynchronously on the direct path and after the actor round-trip on the message\npath, riding the existing controller notification bus.\n\n`UrlbarTestUtils.promiseProviderEngagement` wraps it for tests, so a test can\nawait a provider's engagement side effect instead of polling for it:\n`browser_unitConversion.js` before reading the clipboard, `browser_result_menu.js`\nbefore asserting the dismissed result was removed, `browser_action_tabgroups.js`\nbefore asserting the group expanded or the tab switched, and\n`browser_secondaryActions.js`, `browser-quickactions/browser_general.js` and\n`browser_contextualsearch.js` before asserting a quickaction's callback ran. The\nnotification is behavior-neutral on the direct path.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D311533\n", "files": ["browser/components/urlbar/UrlbarProvidersManager.sys.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/content/UrlbarShared.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/UrlbarTestUtils.sys.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser-quickactions/browser_general.js", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser-results/browser_result_menu.js", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser-results/browser_secondaryActions.js", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser-results/browser_unitConversion.js", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser-search/browser_contextualsearch.js", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser-tabs/browser_action_tabgroups.js"], "git_node": "f5a5ff6ebacd2b9cce63abb022830693b0f5a053", "git_parents": ["dc281bc2d7aab1138a26e48839fb36e5e3fbf186"], "node": "48861775d168492a3c88d2b060dabcb8c3ca7aaf", "parents": ["4625e50b425eac44527272d3328578eb715688d2"], "tags": []}, {"author": "hannajones \u003chjones@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049716 - add tests for about:editprofile theme picker integration r=mstriemer,niklas\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D312568\n", "files": ["browser/components/profiles/content/edit-profile-card.mjs", "browser/components/profiles/tests/browser/browser.toml", "browser/components/profiles/tests/browser/browser_edit_profile_test.js", "browser/components/profiles/tests/browser/browser_edit_profile_theme_picker_nova_test.js", "toolkit/content/widgets/theme-picker/theme-picker.mjs"], "git_node": "c4e66525848761035fa2a62d734d72ec139ebf17", "git_parents": ["f5a5ff6ebacd2b9cce63abb022830693b0f5a053"], "node": "95d4ff41337bd3da317b66d5e9b8d873ad70452e", "parents": ["48861775d168492a3c88d2b060dabcb8c3ca7aaf"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Silaghi \u003casilaghi@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2051359 - Part 3: Add citation component for assistant chat messages r=fluent-reviewers,czhou,bolsson\" for causing bc failures at chat-assistant-citations.css\n\nThis reverts commit 1bd4d53e00717061dd6dd936fce5933c54dbdaeb.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2051359 - Part 2: Support custom child items in smartwindow-panel-list r=czhou\"\n\nThis reverts commit 69639fa7bb7740ea4ff708f388123cc8789d0cd6.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2051359 - Part 1: Add small size variant to ai-website-chip r=czhou\"\n\nThis reverts commit 39b8b137c7c6d3abc401d9018bf0205ee48b7bc4.\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-chat-content/chat-assistant-citations/chat-assistant-citations.css", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-chat-content/chat-assistant-citations/chat-assistant-citations.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-chat-content/chat-assistant-citations/chat-assistant-citations.stories.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-website-chip/ai-website-chip.css", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-website-chip/ai-website-chip.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-website-chip/ai-website-chip.stories.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/smartwindow-panel-list/smartwindow-panel-list.css", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/smartwindow-panel-list/smartwindow-panel-list.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/jar.mn", "browser/locales/en-US/browser/aiWindowContent.ftl"], "git_node": "3cba2d0f218044956130e68e3bb991e43d92ce01", "git_parents": ["c4e66525848761035fa2a62d734d72ec139ebf17"], "node": "0d1b20400e3528230b379f359306ac4977404d65", "parents": ["95d4ff41337bd3da317b66d5e9b8d873ad70452e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Maile Lucks \u003cmaile.lucks@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2050092 - Nova SW Header Font Treatment r=omarg\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313613\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/smartwindow-heading/smartwindow-heading.css"], "git_node": "509a3b96e7ac16a8da65737194f11fd5ff5a0d65", "git_parents": ["3cba2d0f218044956130e68e3bb991e43d92ce01"], "node": "4df4dbf893aba81fab9e504dce3cc215040e31d1", "parents": ["0d1b20400e3528230b379f359306ac4977404d65"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jari Jalkanen \u003cjjalkanen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1729711 - Fix __FILE__ path separator handling in QuotaCommon on Windows. r=dom-storage-reviewers,asuth\n\nWhen the objdir is under the source tree (the default setup on\nWindows), the source tree base is a prefix of the objdir base. This\ncauses exported headers to incorrectly match the source tree check\nfirst in MakeSourceFileRelativePath, producing paths like\nobj-ff-dbg/dist/include/mozilla/dom/header.h instead of stripping\nthe objdir prefix.\n\nFix by reordering the objdir check before the source tree check.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D304430\n", "files": ["dom/quota/QuotaCommon.cpp", "dom/quota/QuotaCommon.h"], "git_node": "9f2e8c25f0b40fdce8d2f2ca40281e8711815a6d", "git_parents": ["509a3b96e7ac16a8da65737194f11fd5ff5a0d65"], "node": "6d21b1fa30fe11dfef209e78ffc4aa762013407b", "parents": ["4df4dbf893aba81fab9e504dce3cc215040e31d1"], "tags": []}], "date": 1784839211, "git_changesets": ["3a6de55e12daccda7ede9396a64460c25cf11829", "42bf3093a18a9a78f3f740e2a284ea8f9c5c37ad", "39b8b137c7c6d3abc401d9018bf0205ee48b7bc4", "69639fa7bb7740ea4ff708f388123cc8789d0cd6", "1bd4d53e00717061dd6dd936fce5933c54dbdaeb", "8ac5089979ee340ffa12eae798bb597cc4bbe49a", "0318aba862cd34b4b2357bc39d74bdc6c8e92bda", "2900b57e6b650616080b9a9366f02429d0070f05", "3bb63336ddd6fb72b08b44cc7fd322fb2acb934a", "5235d59814a561984b5473597d47b2750c091770", "dc281bc2d7aab1138a26e48839fb36e5e3fbf186", "f5a5ff6ebacd2b9cce63abb022830693b0f5a053", "c4e66525848761035fa2a62d734d72ec139ebf17", "3cba2d0f218044956130e68e3bb991e43d92ce01", "509a3b96e7ac16a8da65737194f11fd5ff5a0d65", "9f2e8c25f0b40fdce8d2f2ca40281e8711815a6d"], "user": "smolnar@mozilla.com"}, "44950": {"c