": "Bug 2057146 - Fix fenix TabsTray status bar styling r=007,android-reviewers\n\nThe TabsTray theme does not follow browsing mode, so we must opt out of the\nStatusBarColorManager mechanism and make status bar color updates ourselves.\nThis is broken in edge-to-edge mode which doesn't set the background, but does\nstill update the text color. On non-edge-to-edge devices, we theme now theme\nthe bars to our current Compose theme.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313666\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/tabstray/ui/TabManagementFragment.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/theme/StatusBarColorManager.kt"], "git_node": "bc94b1e7210236b2611a61022763e6ba9fe0f1ba", "git_parents": ["3c89df269fe48dc4f7f648269d56fdc1b142cf67"], "node": "db6f5777f8695a8868187c5846a6a5100803e6fa", "parents": ["b41420512927721a9feae14d76d6813e36d994cd"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Florian Zia \u003cfzia@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2051359 - Part 1: Add small size variant to ai-website-chip r=czhou\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D312330\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-website-chip/ai-website-chip.css", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-website-chip/ai-website-chip.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-website-chip/ai-website-chip.stories.mjs"], "git_node": "bcd7e9e1bc2734e5abc44f5086ad12c9ce854ade", "git_parents": ["bc94b1e7210236b2611a61022763e6ba9fe0f1ba"], "node": "9510cc36c422769f376c1efb820ebe112a8d2ee4", "parents": ["db6f5777f8695a8868187c5846a6a5100803e6fa"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Florian Zia \u003cfzia@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2051359 - Part 2: Support custom child items in smartwindow-panel-list r=czhou\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D312331\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/smartwindow