=gfx-reviewers,gw\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314014\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/aa/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/backface/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/blend/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/border/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/boxshadow/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/clip/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/compositor-surface/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/compositor/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/crash/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/filters/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/gradient/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/image/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/mask/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/performance/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/scrolling/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/snap/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/split/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/text/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/tiles/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/transforms/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/src/reftest.rs", "gfx/wr/wrench/src/yaml_frame_reader.rs"], "git_node": "47897f0709d3e321e639951a540763fcd8733cb1", "git_parents": ["2374635d65b095e231002690a1a40ca04c98a77e"], "node": "dfe607c7e978b13a45accf2635394770442da348", "parents": ["e7486796800ca8966b25daf67ed115a9742a507b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nicolas Silva \u003cnsilva@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057509 - Allow per-scale wrench reference images. r=gfx-reviewers,gw\n\nWith this change, when wrench loads a reference for a test run a certain scale (say 0.5), it will first look for foo-scale:0.5.png and fall back to foo.png if the former does not exist.\nThis enables declaring reftest at multiple scales and png reference images in a single line for example scale(1, 2, 0.5) == foo.yaml foo.png.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314024\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/gradient/linear-aligned-border-radius-scale0.51.png", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/gradient/linear-aligned-border-radius-scale1.51.png", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/gradient/linear-aligned-border-radius-scale2.png", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/gradient/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/src/reftest.rs"], "git_node": "857bf898d3cfb7dbd23b704843f2f8f2ed664f5a", "git_parents": ["47897f0709d3e321e639951a540763fcd8733cb1"], "node": "b0268d06d7559d375aa7aa3e66afddf3293e0ae3", "parents": ["dfe607c7e978b13a45accf2635394770442da348"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Roger Yang \u003croyang@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2056590 - Add Skyflag as a new marketing partner in Adjust. r=android-reviewers,twhite\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313516\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/metrics/AdjustMetricsService.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/metrics/InstallReferrerHandlingService.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/metrics/InstallReferrerWorker.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/utils/Settings.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values/preference_keys.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/metrics/AdjustMetricsServiceTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/metrics/InstallReferrerHandlingServiceTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/metrics/InstallReferrerWorkerTest.kt"], "git_node": "e653a8dcc605657436f0a8767cdee1069cc1e1d7", "git_parents": ["857bf898d3cfb7dbd23b704843f2f8f2ed664f5a"], "node": "a7c67b8b54cf5c7257a5b8db9737455528bf4b62", "parents": ["b0268d06d7559d375aa7aa3e66afddf3293e0ae3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Drew Willcoxon \u003cadw@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058817 - [Nova] Draw favicon badges at a slightly smaller size. r=dao,desktop-theme-reviewers,urlbar-reviewers\n\nThis updates all the SVGs so that the paths and masks are scaled (from 24 to 20\nunits) and shifted over more toward the corner. Doing it this way turned out to\nbe a lot simpler than updating the CSS, which I did try at first. Plus, whenever\nthese are redrawn to the new smaller size, we should be able to just swap out\nthe SVGs, or at least the paths in them, without having to touch the CSS.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314838\n", "files": ["browser/themes/shared/urlbar/icons/badge-bookmark.svg", "browser/themes/shared/urlbar/icons/badge-history.svg", "browser/themes/shared/urlbar/icons/badge-pin.svg", "browser/themes/shared/urlbar/icons/badge-tab.svg"], "git_node": "141cd5d3c37c81861152a023399ce2514b9fd81f", "git_parents": ["e653a8dcc605657436f0a8767cdee1069cc1e1d7"], "node": "d8241536e256efd56087a3ec467da69764835f56", "parents": ["a7c67b8b54cf5c7257a5b8db9737455528bf4b62"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lee Salzman \u003clsalzman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2050584. r=gfx-reviewers,nical\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313883\n", "files": ["dom/canvas/WebGLFramebuffer.cpp"], "git_node": "bd92d332234416ed6f648394941194d15a7a51ac", "git_parents": ["141cd5d3c37c81861152a023399ce2514b9fd81f"], "node": "f939e9c2db8377fac8cada4f223d12c54aa3156d", "parents": ["d8241536e256efd56087a3ec467da69764835f56"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Serban Stanca \u003csstanca@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2057509 - Allow per-scale wrench reference images. r=gfx-reviewers,gw\" for causing wrench bustages.\n\nThis reverts commit 857bf898d3cfb7dbd23b704843f2f8f2ed664f5a.\n\nThis reverts commit 47897f0709d3e321e639951a540763fcd8733cb1.\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/aa/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/backface/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/blend/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/border/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/boxshadow/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/clip/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/compositor-surface/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/compositor/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/crash/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/filters/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/gradient/linear-aligned-border-radius-scale0.51.png", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/gradient/linear-aligned-border-radius-scale1.51.png", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/gradient/linear-aligned-border-radius-scale2.png", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/gradient/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/image/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/mask/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/performance/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/scrolling/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/snap/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/split/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/text/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/tiles/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/transforms/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/src/reftest.rs", "gfx/wr/wrench/src/yaml_frame_reader.rs"], "git_node": "69a7c0664c0e163c2e653511ea7370ca7ed443a9", "git_parents": ["bd92d332234416ed6f648394941194d15a7a51ac"], "node": "43c3f6baa4669dddbe27d07ca221e38ca25385fa", "parents": ["f939e9c2db8377fac8cada4f223d12c54aa3156d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csylvestre@debian.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058054 - Coverity CID 1697192: drop redundant null check after dereference in NewXULOrHTMLElement r=edgar\n\n*aResult is dereferenced by the SetDefined(false) call right above, so the\nextra `&& *aResult` in the registry fallback condition is dead. Both element\nconstructors on this path are infallible.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314323\n", "files": ["dom/base/nsContentUtils.cpp"], "git_node": "f9db12789e8f5f8574d8f9e6d9b5f7a50b7d8e8a", "git_parents": ["69a7c0664c0e163c2e653511ea7370ca7ed443a9"], "node": "2c5bd988500053fbefbdda8981ae32aea75481a0", "parents": ["43c3f6baa4669dddbe27d07ca221e38ca25385fa"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csylvestre@debian.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1975552 - Migrate from the remove_dir_all crate to std::fs::remove_dir_all r=ErichDonGubler,gfx-reviewers,supply-chain-reviewers\n\nThe vendored remove_dir_all 0.5.3 is affected by RUSTSEC-2023-0018, a\ntime-of-check to time-of-use race in the crate's own Windows implementation.\nOn other platforms the crate is a plain re-export of std::fs::remove_dir_all,\nso the only in-tree call site, in webrender_bindings' program_cache, can drop\nthe dependency entirely.\n\nUpgrading in place is not practical: every fixed release is built on fs_at,\nwhich pins nix ^0.29 and windows-sys ^0.52 against the 0.30 and 0.61 we already\nvendor, and mach vendor rust rejects duplicate versions.\n\nThis was previously done in bug 1959801 and backed out in bug 1973947, because\nthird-party DLL injection on Windows detours NtOpenFile and crashed Rust's\nstd::fs::remove_dir_all (rust#143078). The agreed condition for redoing it was\nRust 1.90 becoming the minimum supported version, which happened in bug 1975583\nand shipped in Firefox 149; the tree now requires 1.90.0.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314599\n", "files": ["Cargo.lock", "gfx/webrender_bindings/Cargo.toml", "gfx/webrender_bindings/src/program_cache.rs", "supply-chain/config.toml", "third_party/rust/remove_dir_all/.cargo-checksum.json", "third_party/rust/remove_dir_all/.cargo_vcs_info.json", "third_party/rust/remove_dir_all/Cargo.toml", "third_party/rust/remove_dir_all/Cargo.toml.orig", "third_party/rust/remove_dir_all/LICENCE-APACHE", "third_party/rust/remove_dir_all/LICENCE-MIT", "third_party/rust/remove_dir_all/README.md", "third_party/rust/remove_dir_all/src/fs.rs", "third_party/rust/remove_dir_all/src/lib.rs"], "git_node": "42bb28d34250ecd9d4b15a51c3fa0a7b86a43fd5", "git_parents": ["f9db12789e8f5f8574d8f9e6d9b5f7a50b7d8e8a"], "node": "8f6e85221b85932dfbb8eeb894964b7918216029", "parents": ["2c5bd988500053fbefbdda8981ae32aea75481a0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "AndiAJ \u003candiaj@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057199 - Migrate verifyThePrintSubMenuOptionTest UI test to the efficiency framework r=aaronmt\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313715\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/MainMenuTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/helpers/BasePage.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/selectors/MainMenuSelectors.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/tests/MainMenuTest.kt"], "git_node": "9d0c7d75f303b16930388cf1b8ef93d161d72c29", "git_parents": ["42bb28d34250ecd9d4b15a51c3fa0a7b86a43fd5"], "node": "aea36f7c13cee7e70f5b27c073c11088c6e1725e", "parents": ["8f6e85221b85932dfbb8eeb894964b7918216029"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785318691, "git_changesets": ["937fca8523304be195dc207171c2bc8b21c411aa", "7187a54bc9f14fa295a65f4f97d3519a4442b3c4", "a1a9e3128b22ff428df62d82470657569ea2a84c", "061cafdb376a26c8786d09399cb525ea9ed66815", "e336c3b62c71963cd16ae09b410111c3eefa4b9b", "15ec5c3090eeb8089e6f4bf278002813e6f23059", "bcd7d64215eb3fdd84dfd9d0fe8ef5d2ba06d358", "8e9c58616a60e8a05d34e85e567b59d19ee91cdc", "aba9ba21657e8c579b5419b257624ce141783eb2", "ed9780c55df6a61009a49a6aec8137aa51bd3ee5", "81711771c06a3029ae49472e710265ec3d132eb9", "24d67cd36bae610c6cd470b1e82938af148c0617", "20658c62af8ec7258645d692e22ecbeac4ec1fed", "9cc90dea3e019ab4c2162582c2df66d72a6a0a81", "679e60c8d3174f55c095af69d8c83c143a0cd83d", "ae9004a4a2b2828035c061ee9f97a747757cd6d9", "3b5a94722152b1ba6fa1a46f8fd31618410b7495", "50cb89dbd315e692da9f414f4ff7c93331fa47ee", "a2430492c3ba60b7d5df1ff8f3ae4537629bd796", "4dc01fb8be9809352190f0de7a2aa406cb52f479", "3d334d3b17233db9fcf257a37ff07578d8aa742f", "fc8d3638b8c023160df271d9