08add137a78aeb651b3c", "05a2c4435bd7b3e39ee9592c7f3a0a044928b3f6", "36791c923c6525549e85d00f016a02dede8be6c8", "d21912fbd533f7a180465fdbf63fcff4ab0ed5e1", "5196821075557b6252fcfd23dee447d87cf2e47a", "2cc2dbb3a5f04acfda5d55cc62de6450612fd48e", "c1243b5a590be259c737d2dabd2fa961185ab654", "897f2096901824e50cb757da4c7f02ceba8db114", "fe767d7ea7a6cfdc705fa7b780686a88b49df85a", "bea8db6aa32da62281241b8163b9b067be6a50aa", "e7a0b9b00b177917b96257bb2651bfd8bd4fafd7", "d0be2f3d44d694e68c76698b36a3ad3ce8c21f77", "5fbd2f131255776ba6e34e4b426b3920435fc908", "9f667bd744984f722a7dcfb7d955a66858ad98c8", "c9637487c1550050b51e0bc98855a259e3bafbd1", "95e52347227cf3a24171270446b3b1684d87191b", "3ac6c32c842195a42f2c3367a55ebec2bfa5ed8b", "4901460b0e2da2897b3f66740b8bf510dac0104f", "7d438b99e58d16388e4327f2460d14ad4c8be075"], "user": "nfay@mozilla.com"}, "44995": {"changesets": [{"author": "Giulia Cardieri \u003cgcardieri@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055463: Make ai-grouped-chip-container links open other tabs r=pdahiya\n\n**Issue**: When clicking on a panel-item link part of the grouped chips container, nothing happens.\n\n**Root Cause**: I didn't add a function to open links when I created the component\n\n**Solution**: Add a functionality similar to the other context chips and a test to avoid this bug from happening again.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D312806\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-grouped-chip-container/ai-grouped-chip-container.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_aiwindow_grouped_chips.js"], "git_node": "7eb76047eae5884218382b5ed36ca79a4661d5ce", "git_parents": ["7d438b99e58d16388e4327f2460d14ad4c8be075"], "node": "e649158b65b1393afbdfae2e44745fa2f24e61e3", "parents": ["1c497fb7074266f2b1cb9d5b11e4b9482fe560b0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Brian Smith \u003cbrian@smith.berlin\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2008554 - Validate enterprise policy schema with xpcshell tests. r=mkaply,Standard8\n\n__Supersedes:__ https://github.com/mozilla/enterprise-firefox/pull/910\n\n__Background:__\n\nThis validates incoming changes to the enterprise policies schema against a meta-schema, so that every policy provides the metadata downstream tooling relies on.\n\nAn earlier revision implemented this as a mozlint linter. Per review feedback, using an xpcshell test instead, so the check runs as part of the enterprisepolicies xpcshell suite.\n\n__Additions:__\n\n- `schemas/policies-schema.meta.json`: a contract for the required fields\n- `tests/xpcshell/test_policies_schema.js`: validate against a meta-schema\n- `tests/xpcshell/xpcshell.toml`: register the test, with both schemas as `support-files`.\n\n__Changes:__\n\n- `schemas/policies-schema.json`: fill in the missing metadata for `CNSA2KeyAgreementEnabled`.\n\n### Testing\n\n* [x] Added tests\n* [x] Manual testing performed\n\n**Steps to verify changes:**\n\n1. run `./mach test browser/components/enterprisepolicies/tests/xpcshell/test_policies_schema.js`\n2. edit `browser/components/enterprisepolicies/schemas/policies-schema.json` (for example, remove `x-category` for a given policy)\n3. re-run the test\n\n**Expected result:**\n\nThere are test failures detected.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D311472\n", "files": ["browser/components/enterprisepolicies/schemas/policies-schema.json", "browser/components/enterprisepolicies/schemas/policies-schema.meta.json", "browser/components/enterprisepolicies/tests/xpcshell/test_policies_schema.js", "browser/components/enterprisepolicies/tests/xpcshell/xpcshell.toml"], "git_node": "b201e2a68fb581ea673d80791e33e81677b7ae4d", "git_parents": ["7eb76047eae5884218382b5ed36ca79a4661d5ce"], "node": "23780b70f2814598737079fd58fc14a3a50a47ae", "parents": ["e649158b65b1393afbdfae2e44745fa2f24e61e3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Giulia Cardieri \u003cgcardieri@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057503 - Replace smart window logos with new version r=desktop-theme-reviewers,sfoster,jlewis\n\nReplace smart window main and simplified logos with new version.\n\nMove smart window main logo to the aiwindow folder and replace its references.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314036\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/assets/smart-window.svg", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-chat-content/chat-assistant-loader/chat-assistant-loader.css", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/smartwindow-heading/smartwindow-heading.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/jar.mn", "browser/themes/shared/icons/smart-window-simplified.svg", "browser/themes/shared/icons/smart-window.svg", "browser/themes/shared/jar.inc.mn"], "git_node": "d26b23fbfbaff0e95407a79879b7096c746ccee5", "git_parents": ["b201e2a68fb581ea673d80791e33e81677b7ae4d"], "node": "e691732167eced573375327f38187053d89720ad", "parents": ["23780b70f2814598737079fd58fc14a3a50a47ae"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mark Banner \u003cstandard8@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058922 - Change the test manifest toml linter to report the sections that are out of order and the line number. r=linter-reviewers,sylvestre\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315291\n", "files": ["tools/lint/test-manifest-toml/__init__.py", "tools/lint/test/test_manifest_toml.py"], "git_node": "8b39f0393b358ad23ce16f66220898d7db1aea2a", "git_parents": ["d26b23fbfbaff0e95407a79879b7096c746ccee5"], "node": "070c5d11dc91703705c7757ef0ad81712d9f50e8", "parents": ["e691732167eced573375327f38187053d89720ad"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Kelly Cochrane \u003ckcochrane@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1919183 - Fix for failures in browser/components/sidebar/tests/browser/browser_glean_sidebar.js r=sfoster\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314619\n", "files": ["browser/components/sidebar/tests/browser/browser.to