tial Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315241\n", "files": ["devtools/client/aboutdebugging/src/components/RuntimePage.js", "devtools/client/aboutdebugging/src/components/connect/NetworkLocationsForm.js", "devtools/client/aboutdebugging/src/components/debugtarget/TemporaryExtensionInstallSection.js", "devtools/client/aboutdebugging/src/components/shared/Message.js", "devtools/client/aboutdebugging/src/reducers/ui-state.js", "devtools/client/aboutdebugging/test/browser/browser_aboutdebugging_addons_temporary_install_error.js", "devtools/client/aboutdebugging/test/browser/browser_aboutdebugging_connect_networklocations.js"], "git_node": "f41736558b9011c9a60168d94a05e57160c07e11", "git_parents": ["381b9e492fb38404f8e52775d8f4be00245f66ea"], "node": "e8d80b10ceef4533a13d13eaa44881d2e4a9e73c", "parents": ["d7a6118a4f1c89e55a01a422e6d4a1cf48d29249"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mr. Beedell, Roke Julian Lockhart (RJLB) \u003c5wkuhn4z@rokejulianlockhart.addy.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057835 - Convert prepositions and conjunctions, in NetMonitor HAR menu labels, to lower-case r=jdescottes,devtools-reviewers\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315413\n", "files": ["devtools/client/locales/en-US/netmonitor.properties"], "git_node": "1a0190c54c1b04ef81322c51335f006dbd7f0eda", "git_parents": ["f41736558b9011c9a60168d94a05e57160c07e11"], "node": "9441b8d05ecd4e8df7f37f64192227080a3f27a7", "parents": ["e8d80b10ceef4533a13d13eaa44881d2e4a9e73c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sandor Molnar \u003csmolnar@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2056134: apply code formatting via Lando\" for causing build bustages @ ScriptLoader.cpp\n\nThis reverts commit 1505b4958d559e8f0b5a961bd98392e7e24527a9.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2056134 - Part 5: Add tests. r=bthrall\"\n\nThis reverts commit 56048444867a93fe8274c2fbe88076c1a55809e9.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2056134 - Part 4: Use pre-calculated fallback encoding for the classic script disk cache MIME-Type. r=bthrall\"\n\nThis reverts commit 8f1cbb9d65483b2d92920a2208c004f1116f0da5.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2056134 - Part 3: Use pre-calculated fallback encoding for the in-memory cache key. r=bthrall\"\n\nThis reverts commit e7f54c323f020bc597dc30239ea184b8e61fc8e3.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2056134 - Part 2: Pre-calculate the fallback encoding for the classic script source. r=bthrall,dom-worker-reviewers,edenchuang\"\n\nThis reverts commit ad62acfd4b757f46945dfb1d9dd5ca346bb9a368.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2056134 - Part 1: Include the hint charset into the cache key string for the ChromeUtils.getCachedJavaScriptSource. r=bthrall,devtools-reviewers,jdescottes\"\n\nThis reverts commit 75948f8125f838f05f4333e119f9ab8b382b81e4.\n", "files": ["devtools/server/actors/network-monitor/network-event-actor.js", "devtools/server/actors/resources/network-events-content.js", "dom/base/ChromeUtils.cpp", "dom/base/ChromeUtils.h", "dom/base/test/browser.toml", "dom/base/test/browser_script_loader_js_cache_charset.js", "dom/base/test/file_js_cache_charset.sjs", "dom/base/test/head.js", "dom/chrome-webidl/ChromeUtils.webidl", "dom/script/ScriptLoadHandler.cpp", "dom/script/ScriptLoader.cpp", "dom/script/ScriptLoader.h", "dom/script/SharedScriptCache.cpp", "dom/script/SharedScriptCache.h", "dom/workers/ScriptLoader.cpp", "js/loader/LoadedScript.cpp", "js/loader/LoadedScript.h", "js/loader/ScriptLoadRequest.cpp", "js/loader/ScriptLoadRequest.h", "remote/shared/NetworkResponse.sys.mjs", "testing/web-platform/meta/html/semantics/scripting-1/the-script-element/script-charset-03.html.ini"], "git_node": "4e4fb20b51b3a23df14aeffe976c24fc101304a4", "git_parents": ["1a0190c54c1b04ef81322c51335f006dbd7f0eda"], "node": "01151b82ec2b80810ce10ee93cdeb0627aee5030", "parents": ["9441b8d05ecd4e8df7f37f64192227080a3f27a7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "mcarare \u003c48995920+mcarare@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2051898 - Refactor IntentProcessor to use Android Components intent processors r=jonalmeida\n\nRefactor `IntentProcessor` to implement `mozilla.components.feature.intent.processing.IntentProcessor` and delegate standard intent handling to `TabIntentProcessor` and `CustomTabIntentProcessor`. This simplifies the implementation by leveraging standard component logic while maintaining Focus-specific handling for home screen shortcuts and text selection.\n\nAdditionally, this change ensures that all tabs created via external intents\u2014including voice search, shortcuts, and text selection\u2014correctly set `LoadUrlFlags.external()`.\n\nKey changes:\n- `IntentProcessor` now uses `TabIntentProcessor` and `CustomTabIntentProcessor` internally.\n- Logic in `handleIntent` is simplified to track tab state changes before and after processing.\n- Refactor ACTION_SEND handling to delegate to TabIntentProcessor,\n  unifying search URL construction with standard components.\n- Explicitly set `LoadUrlFlags.external()` in `IntentProcessor` and `ExternalIntentNavigation`.\n- Added unit tests to verify that `ACTION_VIEW`, `ACTION_SEND`, and voice search intents result in tabs with the `EXTERNAL` load flag.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D310565\n", "files": ["mobile/android/focus-android/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/focus/activity/IntentReceiverActivity.kt", "mobile/android/focus-android/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/focus/activity/MainActivity.kt", "mobile/android/focus-android/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/focus/searchwidget/ExternalIntentNavigation.kt", "mobile/android/focus-android/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/focus/session/IntentProcessor.kt", "mobile/android/focus-android/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/focus/searchwidget/ExternalIntentNavigationTest.kt", "mobile/android/focus-android/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/focus/session/IntentProcessorTest.kt"], "git_node": "7c42ef6ebbb7d5b6a365f8be1eb809be6ce91a59", "git_parents": ["4e4fb20b51b3a23df14aeffe976c24fc101304a4"], "node": "c763aef6f0dd99f2532efdcbfa00fd13fa6dd2cf", "parents": ["01151b82ec2b80810ce10ee93cdeb0627aee5030"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mark Banner \u003cstandard8@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1998719 - Fix ESLint JSDoc valid-types issues in UITour-lib.js. r=omc-reviewers,frontend-codestyle-reviewers,mossop,emcminn\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315243\n", "files": ["browser/components/uitour/UITour-lib.js", "eslint-rollouts.config.mjs"], "git_node": "e380e4caa13dd91b31001378680eee7531505fb7", "git_parents": ["7c42ef6ebbb7d5b6a365f8be1eb809be6ce91a59"], "node": "82478b58297791c54df41d4b3539683bfeb3bc96", "parents": ["c763aef6f0dd99f2532efdcbfa00fd13fa6dd2cf"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Updatebot \u003cupdatebot@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2059609 - Update PDF.js to a80897dc9a2eb80c474717b683a4153f5b628ac7 r=pdfjs-reviewers,calixte\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315486\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/build/pdf.mjs", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/build/pdf.scripting.mjs", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/build/pdf.worker.mjs", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/web/viewer-geckoview.mjs", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/web/viewer.mjs", "toolkit/components/pdfjs/moz.yaml"], "git_node": "d050d9d0f98565edbf2b50d5a7b175a1bc28121f", "git_parents": ["e380e4caa13dd91b31001378680eee7531505fb7"], "node": "2e01a9db137a8dec616e5ab53f0b89c542ec9e6c", "parents": ["82478b58297791c54df41d4b3539683bfeb3bc96"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nicolas Silva \u003cnsilva@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2059188 - Add the missing WebGL texel unpack specializations. r=gfx-reviewers,lsalzman\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315284\n", "files": ["dom/canvas/TexUnpackBlob.cpp", "dom/canvas/WebGLTexelConversions.cpp", "dom/canvas/WebGLTexelConversions.h"], "git_node": "f31830e7293d0b41e5a919ed00b4e0b89e7b9790", "git_parents": ["d050