anch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058205 - Restyle the Auto Tab Grouping panel with the chrome panel tokens r=desktop-theme-reviewers,Mardak,dao\n\nAuto Tab Grouping / 'Organize Tabs'\n\nFigma: https://www.figma.com/design/75Z1LtkCEUJWCxoY2KyNHv/Smart-Window-Q2?node-id=10472-13052&focus-id=10472-13052&view=focus&m=dev\n\nv0 Brief: https://docs.google.com/document/d/15_lGUTaAM6HFimBwkfBVPPCg_0ROGIyInNeLSPPb0NE/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.k0db31goubh2\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314717\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/smartwindow-group-tabs/smartwindow-group-tabs.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/modules/AutoTabGrouping.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_aiwindow_group_tabs_button.js", "browser/themes/shared/smartwindowGroupTabs.css"], "git_node": "1072dbec91838a91c1c983562a07f2bee4b6da91", "git_parents": ["9b9054d4f3b42e26a6fb4aeb7339e6eb83247e2d"], "node": "ecc674920c3c4e68e08dff04d1f8f2ffebac37c0", "parents": ["c4c1400cd2c63f1a1c1e003e7b0d61163b78cf41"], "tags": []}, {"author": "unifolia \u003cjlewis@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058205 - Anchor the Auto Tab Grouping flyout on the panel's end side r=Mardak\n\nAuto Tab Grouping / 'Organize Tabs'\n\nFigma: https://www.figma.com/design/75Z1LtkCEUJWCxoY2KyNHv/Smart-Window-Q2?node-id=10472-13052&focus-id=10472-13052&view=focus&m=dev\n\nv0 Brief: https://docs.google.com/document/d/15_lGUTaAM6HFimBwkfBVPPCg_0ROGIyInNeLSPPb0NE/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.k0db31goubh2\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314718\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/modules/AutoTabGrouping.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_aiwindow_group_tabs_button.js"], "git_node": "1b6a2e51810cf729397f2d2c8a72169433f1b21a", "git_parents": ["1072dbec91838a91c1c983562a07f2bee4b6da91"], "node": "716236d67c66d6e7994b0728b585e285fc414a10", "parents": ["ecc674920c3c4e68e08dff04d1f8f2ffebac37c0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "unifolia \u003cjlewis@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058205 - Rename the feature's user-visible strings to \"Organize Tabs\" r=fluent-reviewers,desktop-theme-reviewers,Mardak,bolsson,dao\n\nAuto Tab Grouping / 'Organize Tabs'\n\nFigma: https://www.figma.com/design/75Z1LtkCEUJWCxoY2KyNHv/Smart-Window-Q2?node-id=10472-13052&focus-id=10472-13052&view=focus&m=dev\n\nv0 Brief: https://docs.google.com/document/d/15_lGUTaAM6HFimBwkfBVPPCg_0ROGIyInNeLSPPb0NE/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.k0db31goubh2\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314719\n", "files": ["browser/base/content/navigator-toolbox.inc.xhtml", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/modules/AIWindow.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/modules/AIWindowUI.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/modules/AutoTabGrouping.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/modules/AutoTabGroupingSuggestions.sys.mjs", "browser/locales-preview/autoTabGrouping.ftl", "browser/locales/en-US/browser/aiWindow.ftl", "browser/themes/shared/smartwindowGroupTabs.css"], "git_node": "67b96bc4842c0f9026b685f5d7d5800f1c821de5", "git_parents": ["1b6a2e51810cf729397f2d2c8a72169433f1b21a"], "node": "de252c0a7f56eb41965980e02978a066d1ad098b", "parents": ["716236d67c66d6e7994b0728b585e285fc414a10"], "tags": []}, {"author": "unifolia \u003cjlewis@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058205 - Restyle the Organize Tabs toolbar button per the design r=desktop-theme-reviewers,Mardak,dao\n\nAuto Tab Grouping / 'Organize Tabs'\n\nFigma: https://www.figma.com/design/75Z1LtkCEUJWCxoY2KyNHv/Smart-Window-Q2?node-id=10472-13052&focus-id=10472-13052&view=focus&m=dev\n\nv0 Brief: https://docs.google.com/document/d/15_lGUTaAM6HFimBwkfBVPPCg_0ROGIyInNeLSPPb0NE/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.k0db31goubh2\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314725\n", "files": ["browser/themes/shared/icons/grid-sparkle.svg", "browser/themes/shared/jar.inc.mn", "browser/themes/shared/toolbarbutton-icons.css", "browser/themes/shared/toolbarbuttons.css"], "git_node": "7db6835be69a06d1a7c7fefecb830901695d5302", "git_parents": ["67b96bc4842c0f9026b685f5d7d5800f1c821de5"], "node": "8a1132f57aeb777e60a19bcf9e95b28684731e80", "parents": ["de252c0a7f56eb41965980e02978a066d1ad098b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "unifolia \u003cjlewis@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2059806 - Add a Close Duplicate Tabs action to the Organize Tabs panel and fix the flyout auto-hide r=fluent-reviewers,Mardak,bolsson\n\nAuto Tab Grouping / 'Organize Tabs'\n\nFigma: https://www.figma.com/design/75Z1LtkCEUJWCxoY2KyNHv/Smart-Window-Q2?node-id=10202-80249&m=dev\n\nAdds a \"Close Duplicate Tabs\" row to the bottom of the Organize Tabs panel,\nreusing the same gBrowser.removeAllDuplicateTabs() action the All Tabs menu\noffers. The row is only rendered when the window actually has duplicates, and\nthat is re-checked every time the panel syncs, so it never offers a no-op. The\ncount comes from the same getAllDuplicateTabsToClose() list the action closes,\nso the row can name it and say how many tabs it will close. The panel is\ndismissed before the tabs close because the resulting confirmation hint anchors\nto the All Tabs button, which the open panel would cover.\n\nAlso fixes the suggestion flyout never auto-hiding. _scheduleHideFlyout read\npanel.ownerGlobal, which is undefined on the panel, so it took its early return\nand no hide was ever scheduled; the flyout stayed open no matter what the\npointer did next. It now uses the module's Timer.sys.mjs import, keeps a flyout\nthat holds focus open so pointer drift cannot close one the keyboard is working\nin, and marks the row dismissed before hiding so the focus the popup hands back\ndoes not immediately reopen it.\n\nThe panel test file now asks for a longer timeout. Every subtest passes, but\neach one opens its own Smart Window and waits for clustering, and with the tests\nthis stack adds the file runs 101s against the 90s per-file limit on ASAN.\nSplitting it up is left to a follow-up.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315692\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/smartwindow-group-tabs/smartwindow-group-tabs.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/modules/AutoTabGrouping.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_aiwindow_group_tabs_button.js", "browser/locales-preview/autoTabGrouping.ftl"], "git_node": "254b497ba5858b4cb7934bbf8c11b375118ae57d", "git_parents": ["7db6835be69a06d1a7c7fefecb830901695d5302"], "node": "ba3572f92ce34ae38d4f2c15590351f7d926b801", "parents": ["8a1132f57aeb777e60a19bcf9e95b28684731e80"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Niklas Baumgardner \u003cnbaumgardner@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2051700 - Add referrals section to about:preferences. r=fluent-reviewers,nbarrett,hjones,bolsson\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314382\n", "files": ["browser/app/profile/firefox.js", "browser/base/content/browser-init.js", "browser/base/content/browser.js", "browser/base/content/browser.js.globals", "browser/base/content/test/menubar/browser_menu_referrals_page.js", "browser/components/preferences/config/account-sync.mjs", "browser/components/preferences/preferences.js", "browser/components/referrals/Referrals.sys.mjs", "browser/components/referrals/tests/browser/browser_referralsAppMenu.js", "browser/locales/en-US/browser/preferences/preferences.ftl"], "git_node": "c3d8604fd10e8462a31a9083bad6fdc1e5396209", "git_parents": ["254b497ba5858b4cb7934bbf8c11b375118ae57d"], "node": "f448fda954397f3d509006a92b3b3f2883699d2a", "parents": ["ba3572f92ce34ae38d4f2c15590351f7d926b801"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Christopher DiPersio \u003ccdipersio@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2059553 - Send more user messages to relevant memories retrieval to increase recall r=cmurray,ai-platform-reviewers,ai-security-