mp as a legacy shorthand for line-clamp. r=AlaskanEmily,dshin,firefox-style-system-reviewers,emilio\n\nThis also adds special handling for the case where modern line-clamp property\nis pref disabled, but we still want the legacy -webkit-line-clamp to work\nwithout exposing disabled line-clamp. Removed -webkit-line-clamp longhand.\n\nUpdate property database and style tests so -webkit-line-clamp is\nrepresented as a legacy shorthand instead of as a longhand. Teach test\nhelpers to skip disabled subproperties when handling shorthands.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D312529\n", "files": ["devtools/server/actors/animation-type-longhand.js", "layout/style/nsStyleStruct.cpp", "layout/style/test/property_database.js", "layout/style/test/test_all_shorthand.html", "layout/style/test/test_ch_ex_no_infloops.html", "layout/style/test/test_inherit_computation.html", "layout/style/test/test_inherit_storage.html", "layout/style/test/test_initial_computation.html", "layout/style/test/test_initial_storage.html", "layout/style/test/test_property_database.html", "layout/style/test/test_transitions_per_property.html", "layout/style/test/test_value_computation.html", "layout/style/test/test_value_storage.html", "servo/components/style/properties/data.py", "servo/components/style/properties/declaration_block.rs", "servo/components/style/properties/longhands.toml", "servo/components/style/properties/mod.rs", "servo/components/style/properties/properties.mako.rs", "servo/components/style/properties/shorthands.rs", "servo/components/style/properties/shorthands.toml", "servo/components/style/style_adjuster.rs", "servo/components/style/values/generics/box.rs", "servo/components/style/values/specified/box.rs", "servo/ports/geckolib/glue.rs", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-overflow/line-clamp/line-clamp-019.html.ini"], "git_node": "4889e720448b570304f42ff7ee6af52ef5c2f1f2", "git_parents": ["5c0ace0918254e8eb01eaafa0fa5e1ce47433f0e"], "node": "2be0cc55dc5f8c29bc6e463cbc9b221ff524720c", "parents": ["fd3ff1ce6c543fb756e34f93e5e6bb560595005b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "mike a \u003cmavduevskiy@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057032 - Make vpn onboarding wait past WarmingUp r=android-reviewers,jonalmeida\n\nAdding NoAccount state for the onboarding to distinguish between fxa\nmanager initializing and having no account at the app start.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313887\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/ipprotection/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/ipprotection/IPProtectionFeature.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/ipprotection/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/ipprotection/IPProtectionStorageSynchronizer.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/ipprotection/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/ipprotection/store/Reducers.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/ipprotection/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/ipprotection/store/state/State.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/ipprotection/src/test/java/mozilla/components/feature/ipprotection/FxaAccountStoreSyncTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/ipprotection/src/test/java/mozilla/components/feature/ipprotection/store/IPProtectionReducerTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/ipprotection/IPProtectionTelemetryMiddleware.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ipprotection/store/IPProtectionOnboardingPrompt.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ipprotection/store/IPProtectionOnboardingPromptTest.kt"], "git_node": "5a1f79236f4d3df6b63bbfc198e20d8743714c96", "git_parents": ["4889e720448b570304f42ff7ee6af52ef5c2f1f2"], "node": "6dda76b22387d9b362f857b3b87527f0a01a5b6d", "parents": ["2be0cc55dc5f8c29bc6e463cbc9b221ff524720c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "mike a \u003cmavduevskiy@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058646 - Account initialization clean up r=jonalmeida,android-reviewers,gmalekpour\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314743\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/ipprotection/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/ipprotection/IPProtectionStorageSynchronizer.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/ipprotection/src/test/java/mozilla/components/feature/ipprotection/FxaAccountStoreSyncTest.kt"], "git_node": "525c0e60f9998377318e98e45f32acbb2ea8c9f0", "git_parents": ["5a1f79236f4d3df6b63bbfc198e20d8743714c96"], "node": "e09b6fe71576fd493490cd0c340950061544e6f1", "parents": ["6dda76b22387d9b362f857b3b87527f0a01a5b6d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "R\u00e9mi Papilli\u00e9 \u003crpapillie@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058091 - Implement superellipse contouring for corner-shape. r=gfx-reviewers,nical\n\nAdd all the required math to compute contoured paths for corner shape's\nsuperellipses.\n\nThe superellipse calculation now correctly extends outside the curved region\nfollowing the curve tangents.\n\nAlso add inset support to distance_to_shaped_rect(), and correctly test\nall corners to allow them to overlap.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316301\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/res/ellipse.glsl", "gfx/wr/webrender/res/ps_quad_box_shadow.glsl", "gfx/wr/webrender/res/ps_quad_mask.glsl", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/clip/clip-superellipse.png"], "git_node": "01323fef09ab23eae129df46d1e010c423603804", "git_parents": ["525c0e60f9998377318e98e45f32acbb2ea8c9f0"], "node": "f6ca0b539f4fba3df46ddf50b2e3a6774917acc5", "parents": ["e09b6fe71576fd493490cd0c340950061544e6f1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "R\u00e9mi Papilli\u00e9 \u003crpapillie@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058091 - Add missing min/max operators in SWGL. r=gfx-reviewers,nical\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316302\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/swgl/src/glsl.h"], "git_node": "58ac633a13d8a756a35238497df24884dd464185", "git_parents": ["01323fef09ab23eae129df46d1e010c423603804"], "node": "4b87421bed7fcde8ee49eeb69cf460a7d6582414", "parents": ["f6ca0b539f4fba3df46ddf50b2e3a6774917acc5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "R\u00e9mi Papilli\u00e9 \u003crpapillie@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058091 - Add inset to ps_quad_mask. r=gfx-reviewers,nical\n\nCompute the contoured superellipse path in ps_quad_mask from\nthe given inset value.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316303\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/res/ps_quad_mask.glsl", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/mask/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/mask/shaped-corners-inset.png", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/mask/shaped-corners-inset.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/mask/shaped-corners-outset.png", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/mask/shaped-corners-outset.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/mask/shaped-corners.yaml"], "git_node": "0111cc05bd46751bcd72fac3a0902492cd312a16", "git_parents": ["58ac633a13d8a756a35238497df24884dd464185"], "node": "1c1193e7ebe79bb75cc9718ecb2898d8a8814f98", "parents": ["4b87421bed7fcde8ee49eeb69cf460a7d6582414"], "tags": []}, {"author": "R\u00e9mi Papilli\u00e9 \u003crpapillie@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2048908 - Add inset to box shadows. r=gfx-reviewers,nical\n\nAdd support for corner-shape in box-shadows with a non-zero spread-radius.\n\nThis uses the spread radius as an inset value forwarded to ps_quad_mask.\n\nSome inset cases are not handled correctly yet, this is left as future work.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316304\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/src/box_shadow.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender_api/src/display_list.rs", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/boxshadow/box-shadow-spread-shape.png", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/boxshadow/box-shadow-spread-shape.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/refte