74672d6c57aa9ef2391a79057754589f7", "6aae92eb653e7420b4541609f80e7311f7b7da31"], "user": "amarc@mozilla.com"}, "45040": {"changesets": [{"author": "Kelly Cochrane \u003ckcochrane@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061026 - Fix for overflowing summary headers for cards in the History sidebar panel r=sclements\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316803\n", "files": ["browser/components/sidebar/sidebar.css"], "git_node": "a9e2daf46efcf854eb1a6ce254cb9b6282463067", "git_parents": ["6aae92eb653e7420b4541609f80e7311f7b7da31"], "node": "3e3cbd292125d718885a92bfc96cafe9aa068107", "parents": ["e2b225c4fce662da15c9e02b34d64a30ed4854e2"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Moritz Beier \u003cmbeier@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2060569 - Move top sites listener to UrlbarParentController. r=dao,urlbar-reviewers\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316281\n", "files": ["browser/actors/UrlbarChild.sys.mjs", "browser/actors/UrlbarParent.sys.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/UrlbarParentController.sys.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/content/UrlbarView.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser/browser_queryContextCache.js"], "git_node": "9622365edfc8907fc9e5486ff3981d6ddae0b42b", "git_parents": ["a9e2daf46efcf854eb1a6ce254cb9b6282463067"], "node": "0f948dc7f9937803309d544039b098d4972808d1", "parents": ["3e3cbd292125d718885a92bfc96cafe9aa068107"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Micah Killoran \u003cmtigley@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057888 - Wait for autocomplete popup items to be laid out before clicking them in browser_autocomplete_import.js. r=credential-management-reviewers,NeilDeakin\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316203\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/passwordmgr/test/browser/browser.toml", "toolkit/components/passwordmgr/test/browser/browser_autocomplete_import.js"], "git_node": "af20d22215b9ff5a4aac0d116a654a89d0fa3e81", "git_parents": ["9622365edfc8907fc9e5486ff3981d6ddae0b42b"], "node": "a836c5e93133e23fd8d617a70d084b49c01533bd", "parents": ["0f948dc7f9937803309d544039b098d4972808d1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "isabelrios \u003cisabelrios@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2060521 - [efficiency] Convert DownloadFileTypesTest.allFilesAppearInDownloadsMenuTest to ui/efficiency r=jajohnson,aaronmt\n\nFaithful port of the legacy DownloadFileTypesTest smoke test, keeping the parameterized\nrun over all nine file types (zip, docx, mp3, txt, png, webm, csv, xml, svg) as one\n@SmokeTest method rather than reducing coverage.\n\nHarness capability added by this port:\n\n- SelectorStrategy.UIAUTOMATOR2_BY_DESCRIPTION_CONTAINS (By.descContains). Each download\n  link on the test page renders as a pair: a clickable node carrying the\n  content-description, and a sibling text node with the same string that is not clickable.\n  A textContains match resolved the inert twin, so the click reported success and did\n  nothing. UiObject's clickAndSync compounds this by reporting failure when no window\n  update arrives within ~5.5s, which a download routinely exceeds; UiObject2 leaves the\n  waiting to the caller.\n\n- The download dialog's confirm button needs a device-level tap. It is a FilledButton with\n  no testTag (RenameAndChangeLocationDialogContent.DialogActionButtons), and every Compose\n  strategy tried -- unmerged, merged, and merged+hasClickAction -- resolved a node and\n  reported a successful click while the dialog stayed open.\n\n- BrowserPage -\u003e DownloadsPage navigation edge through the browser three-dot menu. Routing\n  browser -\u003e home -\u003e downloads would lose the loaded page.\n\n- Optional effdump.url argument on EffScreenDumpRunner, so a screen dump can be taken on a\n  specific test page instead of the default example.com. This is what identified both\n  selector problems above from ground truth rather than guesswork.\n\nDeviation from legacy: the test loads the local mockWebServer downloads.html asset instead\nof https://storage.googleapis.com/mobile_test_assets/test_app/downloads.html, so it no\nlonger depends on external network -- over the real network the dialog and completion\nsnackbar exceeded 25s often enough to fail a different subset of the nine on every run.\nThe asset was extended from three file types to the same nine the legacy test covers;\nvideoSample.webm is a copy of the existing dom/media/test/av1-yuv422p10.webm fixture.\nNote this local copy will not track the QA-owned remote page if that page gains file types.\n\nVerified: 9/9 parameterized cases pass, 0 skipped. Shared-selector changes re-verified\nagainst the two existing efficiency tests that use DownloadsSelectors --\nSettingsDeleteBrowsingDataOnQuitTest is fully green and MainMenuTest's download flow\npasses. MainMenuTest's 5 other failures (Print, Save as PDF, Add to home screen, Open in\napp, Translate) were confirmed pre-existing by re-running one of them against an\nunmodified tree.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316272\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/assets/pages/audioMediaPage.html", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/assets/pages/downloads.html", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/assets/resources/audioSample.mp3", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/assets/resources/csv_file.csv", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/assets/resources/docx_document.docx", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/assets/resources/mp3_audio.mp3", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/assets/resources/png_image.png", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/assets/resources/smallZip.zip", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/assets/resources/svg_image.svg", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/assets/resources/textfile.txt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/assets/resources/txt_file.txt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/assets/resources/web_icon.png", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/assets/resources/webm_video.webm", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/assets/resources/xml_file.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/assets/resources/zip_small.zip", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/DownloadFileTypesTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/DownloadTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/devtools/EffScreenDumpRunner.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/helpers/BasePage.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/helpers/Selector.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/pageObjects/BrowserPage.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/pageObjects/DownloadsPage.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/selectors/DownloadsSelectors.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/tests/DownloadFileTypesTest.kt"], "git_node": "72e01d1948f58e60e8e367b1c29f24ce4932a30d", "git_parents": ["af20d22215b9ff5a4aac0d116a654a89d0fa3e81"], "node": "627a9c844b393d686986ee72b91f29abebe52046", "parents": ["a836c5e93133e23fd8d617a70d084b49c01533bd"], "tags": []}, {"author": "AndiAJ \u003candiaj@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2060480 - Migrate expanded toolbar related UI tests to the efficiency framework r=jajohnson\n\nAll 6 UI tests successfully passed 25x on Firebase \u2705\nAll efficiency UI tests successfully passed 1x on Firebase \u2705\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316249\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/NavigationToolbarExpandedTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozil