u \u003cpstanciu@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2046861 - Reject InferenceSession.create() on a native session-create failure instead of crashing r=ai-platform-reviewers,valentinp\" for causing mochitest failures @ browser_ml_inference_session_error.js\n\nThis reverts commit 843fdf148845fd85a9a6dcc53aa2718c6a562aff.\n", "files": ["dom/onnx/InferenceSession.cpp", "toolkit/components/ml/tests/browser/browser.toml", "toolkit/components/ml/tests/browser/browser_ml_inference_session_error.js", "toolkit/components/ml/tests/browser/ml_inference_session_error_stub.worker.mjs"], "git_node": "d49ac56d9e7c6864a7e48c191d5bd29afd88771f", "git_parents": ["8615841ef55db52509e1e0a30afbc038de262546"], "node": "cdd2871797f28988b507d74706f6df90ec7dcddd", "parents": ["72bacda090c667dd9fa48a084a582b91a04afa6c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Steve Fink \u003csfink@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057794 - Diagnostic asserts for Vector internal consistency in relation to structured clone cleanup r=mccr8\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316671\n", "files": ["js/src/vm/StructuredClone.cpp", "mfbt/BufferList.h", "mfbt/Vector.h"], "git_node": "7d583f4ccb6353d14d5967b31c6def95868e5117", "git_parents": ["d49ac56d9e7c6864a7e48c191d5bd29afd88771f"], "node": "a0dd9b720750aeb8af190465969121e38e01822f", "parents": ["cdd2871797f28988b507d74706f6df90ec7dcddd"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003crvandermeulen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061904 - Clear the remaining Android lint findings in the samples apps. r=android-reviewers,adhingra\n\nThe firefox-relay launcher bitmaps were committed empty, which is why lint sees ten identical icons, and the\nadaptive icon in mipmap-anydpi takes precedence over them anyway, so remove them. The acorn-components\nlauncher artwork and the two component widgets in the browser sample layout have no fix short of redrawing\nor rewriting them, so suppress those where they are reported.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317218\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/samples/acorn-components/lint-baseline.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/samples/acorn-components/src/main/res/drawable/ic_launcher_foreground.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/samples/browser/lint-baseline.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/samples/browser/src/main/res/layout/fragment_browser.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/samples/firefox-relay/lint-baseline.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/samples/firefox-relay/src/main/res/mipmap-hdpi/ic_launcher.webp", "mobile/android/android-components/samples/firefox-relay/src/main/res/mipmap-hdpi/ic_launcher_round.webp", "mobile/android/android-components/samples/firefox-relay/src/main/res/mipmap-mdpi/ic_launcher.webp", "mobile/android/android-components/samples/firefox-relay/src/main/res/mipmap-mdpi/ic_launcher_round.webp", "mobile/android/android-components/samples/firefox-relay/src/main/res/mipmap-xhdpi/ic_launcher.webp", "mobile/android/android-components/samples/firefox-relay/src/main/res/mipmap-xhdpi/ic_launcher_round.webp", "mobile/android/android-components/samples/firefox-relay/src/main/res/mipmap-xxhdpi/ic_launcher.webp", "mobile/android/android-components/samples/firefox-relay/src/main/res/mipmap-xxhdpi/ic_launcher_round.webp", "mobile/android/android-components/samples/firefox-relay/src/main/res/mipmap-xxxhdpi/ic_launcher.webp", "mobile/android/android-components/samples/firefox-relay/src/main/res/mipmap-xxxhdpi/ic_launcher_round.webp"], "git_node": "811ff50435f20a8f6cfc4cc3e156741f118d1142", "git_parents": ["7d583f4ccb6353d14d5967b31c6def95868e5117"], "node": "ba371b8c8cf23944ba985258096814e899778af6", "parents": ["a0dd9b720750aeb8af190465969121e38e01822f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Omar Gonzalez \u003cs9tpepper@apache.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058227 - Integrate Smart Form Fill LLM prompts r=ai