 Baungally \u003cvbaungally@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061853 - Add Auto Tab Grouping model for Smart Window name generation. r=jlewis,ai-platform-reviewers,valentinp\n\nThis patch adds a separate model for the Smart Window Tab Group name generation.\nThis is so classic window users aren't affected when we do model updates for this\nfeature.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317162\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/modules/AutoTabGroupingSuggestions.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/xpcshell/test_AutoTabGrouping.js", "toolkit/components/ml/content/EngineProcess.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "b556f787a56a37e8b39fbe8c7dd28b180458e42e", "git_parents": ["7afee96624c9031ba7367693320c38e30e3c752d"], "node": "59e99837acf1607e646fb33e3fa02350eae56860", "parents": ["d107533e60142ea6a9786c9695ae74fe84f35218"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Joe Bowser \u003cjbowser@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2046861 - Reject InferenceSession.create() on a native session-create failure instead of crashing r=ai-platform-reviewers,valentinp\n\nWhen onnxruntime's CreateSessionFromArray fails (an out-of-memory\ncondition, or a malformed/unsupported model), InferenceSession::Init\ncalled MOZ_CRASH, taking down the whole inference content process. That\nturns a recoverable runtime error into a crash and, because the process\ndies first, prevents JS callers from using the fallback they already\nhave (best-onnx retrying on the wasm backend in MLEngineChild).\n\nReject the promise with the onnxruntime error message instead, matching\nhow the missing-library case a few lines up is already handled.\n\nmach try (all green): https://treeherder.mozilla.org/jobs?repo=try&revision=96f338c920471bae16a3d3c2bff533aac0224cfa\n\nCo-authored-by: Erik Nordin \u003cenordin@mozilla.com\u003e\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313108\n", "files": ["dom/onnx/InferenceSession.cpp", "toolkit/components/ml/tests/browser/browser.toml", "toolkit/components/ml/tests/browser/browser_ml_inference_session_error.js", "toolkit/components/ml/tests/browser/ml_inference_session_error_stub.worker.mjs"], "git_node": "5dc578c61a49d4f377f3240d0e5127c352786b37", "git_parents": ["b556f787a56a37e8b39fbe8c7dd28b180458e42e"], "node": "463a47b24a7bc65ce8cfe088a55b0cc1d9bc4d77", "parents": ["59e99837acf1607e646fb33e3fa02350eae56860"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Alexandru Marc \u003camarc@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061932 - further update metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/mediacapture-streams/BrowserCaptureMediaStreamTrack-restrictTo.https.html.ini"], "git_node": "cb6222f0865b6702e1cf166f57e4a0119c9c89d7", "git_parents": ["5dc578c61a49d4f377f3240d0e5127c352786b37"], "node": "b059f3919dbbc623e378ecec37edbb05f3d4f70a", "parents": ["463a47b24a7bc65ce8cfe088a55b0cc1d9bc4d77"], "tags": []}], "date": 1786268808, "git_changesets": ["2450e2a7fc9084ffb16f812e2f04d89742e69c6c", "7afee96624c9031ba7367693320c38e30e3c752d", "b556f787a56a37e8b39fbe8c7dd28b180458e42e", "5dc578c61a49d4f377f3240d0e5127c352786b37", "cb6222f0865b6702e1cf166f57e4a0119c9c89d7"], "user": "pstanciu@mozilla.com"}, "45052": {"changesets": [{"author": "az \u003cazebrowski@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058911 - Consolidate remote media codec setup checks r=jolin\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316403\n", "files": ["dom/media/ipc/RemoteDecoderParent.cpp", "dom/media/ipc/RemoteDecoderParent.h", "dom/media/ipc/RemoteMediaDataEncoderParent.cpp", "dom/media/ipc/RemoteMediaDataEncoderParent.h", "dom/media/platforms/apple/AppleVTDecoder.cpp", "dom/media/platforms/apple/AppleVTEncoder.cpp"], "git_node": "e2f157dd07f10f3ec1705ebd784d00d62fd1283e", "git_parents": ["cb6222f0865b6702e1cf166f57e4a0119c9c89d7"], "node": "ada8107d178aefb7ee826e14021f9de1a84c569c", "parents": ["b059f3919dbbc623e378ecec37edbb05f3d4f70a"], "tags": []}