bug - Tagging 54be19de0e08edff0b797e55fd935dd3978b0a6d with FIREFOX_153_0_4_RELEASE a=tagging CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": "72199603ff88eea6dc1ee38d1c7c1b9232cc7ba8", "git_parents": ["904b0d9902f98d1b359e5e36d364c95d6851645f"], "node": "03e0c921eb0443cc68437b392e85f02df8728716", "parents": ["f8db2df65eb9a12b6d1f3609ff190786a4a4c02d"], "tags": []}], "date": 1786451374, "git_changesets": ["72199603ff88eea6dc1ee38d1c7c1b9232cc7ba8"], "user": "ffxbld@lando.moz.tools"}, "45067": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "tags-unified", "desc": "No bug - Tagging 5d7f4d5bc4ccf389b904e3d6b7d839075ffc0a00 with FIREFOX_115_39_0esr_BUILD1 a=tagging CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": "f3f9ea76c92fb90bbbb5157144908eb099a1931c", "git_parents": ["72199603ff88eea6dc1ee38d1c7c1b9232cc7ba8"], "node": "7a7d4e52e6b8f59850c6d7ff18970a1f67153ed3", "parents": ["03e0c921eb0443cc68437b392e85f02df8728716"], "tags": []}], "date": 1786479177, "git_changesets": ["f3f9ea76c92fb90bbbb5157144908eb099a1931c"], "user": "ffxbld@lando.moz.tools"}, "45068": {"changesets": [{"author": "Release Engineering Landoscript \u003crelease+landoscript@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Automatic version bump NO BUG a=release CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD\n", "files": ["browser/extensions/newtab/manifest.json"], "git_node": "3c092448c2da3b60a39ad2a7239d3a0de1b7e56d", "git_parents": ["537539ad81a9b06e8e90b07d13a66003300d7f06"], "node": "4a186e67ea2f5255055aef05ab5efd72465b4826", "parents": ["11b07d869739452a0b2fce564da18fc1cadcbafb"], "tags": []}], "date": 1786480813, "git_changesets": ["3c092448c2da3b60a39ad2a7239d3a0de1b7e56d"], "user": "ffxbld@lando.moz.tools"}, "45069": {"changesets": [{"author": "Paul Bone \u003cpbone@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2062106 - Remove old references to TypedBaseAlloc r=jstutte\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317396\n", "files": ["memory/build/Arena.h", "memory/build/Chunk.cpp", "memory/build/mozjemalloc.cpp"], "git_node": "27d48758a9f48113cdaefb21eda2b369f99093e3", "git_parents": ["85101411339c8ff768fc3cb059f5438b238a7b1c"], "node": "abccbb0b78ae879f7cb04f715e470efd3a157565", "parents": ["264040057907382ddd09f6b644dcdd3409a988b5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Chris Peterson \u003ccpeterson@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2051730 - Avoid gcc -Wnonnull error in MozPromise MaybeChain.  r=xpcom-reviewers,nika\n\ngcc sees that MozPromise InvokeCallbackMethod will return a null result\nwhen SupportChaining is false and that MaybeChain doesn't null check\naFrom. But gcc doesn't know that aFrom should never be null when aTo is\nnon-null, so check and enforce it.\n\ninclude/mozilla/MozPromise.h:692:21: error: 'this' pointer is null [-Werror=nonnull]\n692 |       aFrom-\u003eChainTo(aTo.forget(), \"\u003cchained completion promise\u003e\");\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317380\n", "files": ["xpcom/threads/MozPromise.h"], "git_node": "6236fead51ceb922efafb04da016989e602a3b7d", "git_parents": ["27d48758a9f48113cdaefb21eda2b369f99093e3"], "node": "3efc7489949800209887723fab7afb4deb0459fb", "parents": ["abccbb0b78ae879f7cb04f715e470efd3a157565"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Chris Peterson \u003ccpeterson@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2051730 - Enable MOZ_DIAGNOSTIC_ASSERT in Dev Edition builds. r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,sylvestre\n\nBug 2052050 removed the distinction between \"early Beta\" and Nightly (in\npreparation to remove \"early Beta\" entirely in bug 2052054). Instead of\nfalling back to Nightly-only, enable MOZ_DIAGNOSTIC_ASSERT in Dev\nEdition builds for more test coverage.\n\nTo do this, hoist the MOZ_DEV_EDITION confvar from\ntoolkit/moz.configure to the toplevel moz.configure so moz.configure and\nmemory.configure can check moz_dev_edition when defining\nMOZ_DIAGNOSTIC_ASSERT_ENABLED and replace_malloc_default().\n\nWe can't move MOZ_DIAGNOSTIC_ASSERT_ENABLED's definition from\nmoz.configure (bug 1748969) back to a simpler #define in\nmfbt/Assertions.h because MOZ_DIAGNOSTIC_ASSERT_ENABLED is used to\ndefine diagnostic_assert() in Rust code (though no Rust code actually\nuses diagnostic_assert).\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317381\n", "files": ["moz.configure", "toolkit/moz.configure"], "git_node": "18ed116d7398f213d5e5f6c6621f2b06784e0621", "git_parents": ["6236fead51ceb922efafb04da016989e602a3b7d"], "node": "bfe6e74019e48e2678ee926601f6501c4fc50359", "parents": ["3efc7489949800209887723fab7afb4deb0459fb"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lando \u003clando@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2051730: apply code formatting via Lando\n\n# ignore-this-changeset\n", "files": ["xpcom/threads/MozPromise.h"], "git_node": "aca52e2393874d70adf8a205e3094c011be3dc4a", "git_parents": ["18ed116d7398f213d5e5f6c6621f2b06784e0621"], "node": "c4998be9df91a8671ddb469cca909dbc36889212", "parents": ["bfe6e74019e48e2678ee926601f6501c4fc50359"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Release Engineering Landoscript \u003crelease+landoscript@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug - Bumping Firefox l10n changesets r=release a=l10n-bump DONTBUILD CLOSED TREE\n\nach -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\naf -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\nan -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\nar -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\nast -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\naz -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\nbe -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\nbg -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\nbn -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\nbo -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\nbqi -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\nbr -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\nbrx -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c32