u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\nru -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\nsk -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\nsl -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\nson -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\nsq -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\nsr -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\nsv-SE -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\nta -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\nte -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\nth -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\ntl -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\ntr -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\ntrs -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\nuk -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\nur -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\nuz -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\nvi -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\nwo -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\nxh -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\nzam -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\nzh-CN -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\nzh-TW -\u003e 1bece0867db529a11cd623d8b5c325fabd1e9c9e\n", "files": ["mobile/locales/l10n-changesets.json"], "git_node": "8d16851aa17a9d312aa55d39621e9d1a0abbed77", "git_parents": ["adb9aefc8bde93ed4c47240bb855d7af2dda98de"], "node": "0d7729e88cdc61081725e0bd14541ec4288d7318", "parents": ["c57f5e62a16c520bbc69e114cbf614b12e836f28"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Josh Matthews \u003cjosh@joshmatthews.net\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2062397 - Make SourceSize and SourceSizeList cloneable. r=emilio,firefox-style-system-reviewers\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317614\n", "files": ["servo/components/style/values/specified/source_size_list.rs"], "git_node": "223a58758f254da0afc57e03c82985013628f56e", "git_parents": ["8d16851aa17a9d312aa55d39621e9d1a0abbed77"], "node": "22d10acbc7b7131e6a44186bdcd92995d90e5ec3", "parents": ["0d7729e88cdc61081725e0bd14541ec4288d7318"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Delia Pop \u003cdpop@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061722 - Migrate 3 SettingsAdvancedTest UI tests to the efficiency framework r=jajohnson\n\nConvert the three @SmokeTest open-links-in-apps cases from SettingsAdvancedTest\ninto SettingsOpenLinksInAppsTest on the ui/efficiency framework:\n- askBeforeOpeningOpenLinkInAppTest (TestRail 2121046)\n- askBeforeOpeningLinkInAppCancelTest (TestRail 2121045)\n- askBeforeOpeningLinkInAppOpenTest (TestRail 2288347)\n\nSupporting harness changes (enablement):\n- Add UIAUTOMATOR2_BY_TEXT_CONTAINS (By.textContains via UiObject2) so a tap that\n  only dismisses an in-app sheet isn't misreported as failed by UiObject.click()'s\n  window-change sync.\n- Add applinks open-in-app prompt selectors + BrowserPage helpers; register the\n  prompt in OverlayRegistry (dismiss = \"Stay in\").\n- BrowserPage.verifyUrl gains a timeout parameter.\n\nParity note: legacy askBeforeOpeningOpenLinkInAppTest asserted\nverifyUrl(\"play.google.com\"), but legacy BrowserRobot.verifyUrl swallows its\ntimeout (no-op) and the browser never navigates there - the Playstore link is\nintercepted as an app link and raises the open-in-app prompt; the port asserts\nthe prompt instead.\n\nAll 3 UI tests successfully passed 50x on Firebase. [[ https://treeherder.mozilla.org/jobs?repo=try&landoInstance=lando-prod-2025&landoCommitID=77066 | Try ]]\nAll efficiency UI test successfully passed 1x on Firebase. [[ https://treeherder.mozilla.org/jobs?repo=try&landoInstance=lando-prod-2025&landoCommitID=77065  | Try ]]\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317099\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/SettingsAdvancedTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/helpers/BasePage.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/helpers/OverlayRegistry.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/helpers/Selector.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/pageObjects/BrowserPage.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/selectors/BrowserPageSelectors.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/tests/SettingsOpenLinksInAppsTest.kt"], "git_node": "21b867f5f900d4d7281aa2d2a5cebbe76f838209", "git_parents": ["223a58758f254da0afc57e03c82985013628f56e"], "node": "9535081f1ce5a0f8de9c0ad5f2b321a01ae17524", "parents": ["22d10acbc7b7131e6a44186bdcd92995d90e5ec3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csylvestre@debian.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2062216 - Silence GCC 16 -Wuse-after-free and -Warray-bounds in nsTestCrasher.cpp r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,ahochheiden\n\nnsTestCrasher.cpp deliberately performs a null-pointer dereference, a\nuse-after-free and a double free to exercise the crash reporter. GCC 16 is\nnow able to see through them and turns -Wuse-after-free into a build error.\n\nBuild the file out of UNIFIED_SOURCES when using gcc so the warnings can be\ndisabled per source file, keeping the checks enabled for the rest of the\ndirectory. Other compilers keep it in UNIFIED_SOURCES.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317438\n", "files": ["toolkit/crashreporter/test/moz.build"], "git_node": "6b33a3655e0b6e03f4f033ed5a6c31d8eed61a8b", "git_parents": ["21b867f5f900d4d7281aa2d2a5cebbe76f838209"], "node": "8dde6912353adc442fa596cd633febb64cf0e99a", "parents": ["9535081f1ce5a0f8de9c0ad5f2b321a01ae17524"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lee Salzman \u003clsalzman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2062065 - Support masks with image sources for non-pixel-backed canvases. r=emilio\n\nCurrently it is unsupported to use a mask operation with an image source for Mask,\nMaskSurface, or PushLayer if the canvas is not pixel-backed. This implements fallbacks\nfor those cases to better support mask operations in SkPDF.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317393\n", "files": ["gfx/2d/DrawTargetSkia.cpp", "gfx/2d/DrawTargetSkia.h", "gfx/2d/HelpersSkia.h", "gfx/skia/skia/src/pdf/SkPDFDevice.cpp"], "git_node": "fcf528862c721b6ea1e070beaed16123e446f2b0", "git_parents": ["6b33a3655e0b6e03f4f033ed5a6c31d8eed61a8b"], "node": "150edf6592afad85dbb9474110f7d9747cca23b3", "parents": ["8dde6912353adc442fa596cd633febb64cf0e99a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Blink WPT Bot \u003cblink-w3c-test-autoroller@chromium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061570 [wpt PR 61797] - [iframe] Use the `content` attribute, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\n[iframe] Use the `content` attribute (#61797)\n\nFor specifying the allowed origins, instead of adding a new\nattribute, as per the feedback[1].\n\n[1]: https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/12444#issuecomment-5168602652\n\nBug: 418397278\nChange-Id: I78705424dd480737e1204f54e880a86071525c6d\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8211759\nAuto-Submit: Koji Ishii \u003ckojii@chromium.org\u003e\nReviewed-by: Kent Tamura \u003ctkent@chromium.org\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Kent Tamura \u003ctkent@chromium.org\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1674776}\n\nCo-authored-by: Koji Ishii \u003ckojii@chromium.org\u003e\n--\n\nwpt-commits: b47d3bcbff5bbe2ed05253056c244d3dab686c36\nwpt-pr: 61797\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-sizing/responsive-iframe/resources/iframe-contents-400x200root.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-sizing/responsive-iframe/resources/iframe-contents-alloworigins.sub.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-sizing/responsive-iframe/resources/iframe-contents-dom-content-loaded.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-sizing/responsive-iframe/resources/iframe-contents-icb.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-sizing/responsive-iframe/resources/iframe-contents-meta-after-head.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-sizing/responsive-iframe/resources/iframe-contents-meta-dynamic-append-after-body.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-sizing/responsive-iframe/resources/iframe-contents-meta-dynamic-append-to-doc.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-sizing/responsive-iframe/resources/iframe-contents-meta-dynamic-append.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-sizing/responsive-iframe/resources/iframe-contents-meta-dynamic-name-change-after-body.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-sizing/responsive-iframe/resources/iframe-contents-meta-dynamic-name-change.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-sizing/responsive-iframe/resources/iframe-contents-meta-dynamic-remove.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-sizing/responsive-iframe/resources/iframe-contents-meta-dynamic-write.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-sizing/responsive-iframe/resources/iframe-contents-meta-in-body.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-sizing/responsive-iframe/resources/iframe-contents-navigation.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-sizing/responsive-iframe/resources/iframe-contents-request-resize.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-sizing/responsive-iframe/resources/iframe-contents-slow.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-sizing/responsive-iframe/resources/iframe-contents.html"], "git_node": "9554323c4b72f5322e777f692c8809676575dfb4", "git_parents": ["fcf528862c721b6ea1e070beaed16123e446f2b0"], "node": "df2189843f22eacc15140bf95d5ded187ae86a2c", "parents": ["150edf6592afad85dbb9474110f7d9747cca23b3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Fernando Fiori \u003cffiori@microsoft.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2060715 [wpt PR 61736] - Fix misspelled HTML tags in WPT files, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nFix misspelled HTML tags in WPT files\n\nCorrect misspelled start and end tags so the tests produce their\nintended DOM structures.\n\nBug: 542686202\nChange-Id: Icac6725c64539d763541ef8a58050aa68ea075fc\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8191755\nCommit-Queue: Fernando Fiori \u003cffiori@microsoft.com\u003e\nReviewed-by: Jonathan Lee \u003cjonathanjlee@google.com\u003e\nReviewed-by: Fernando Fiori \u003cffiori@microsoft.com\u003e\nAuto-Submit: Fernando Fiori \u003cffiori@microsoft.com\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1673772}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 3318ed04a3fb549000e1219a17d372e5e4889aa4\nwpt-pr: 61736\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-backgrounds/background-clip-color-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-pseudo/highlight-styling-004-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/rendering/non-replaced-elements/the-fieldset-and-legend-elements/fieldset-dynamic-pseudo-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/rendering/non-replaced-elements/the-fieldset-and-legend-elements/fieldset-dynamic-pseudo.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/semantics/forms/the-option-element/dynamic-content-change-rendering-ref.html"], "git_node": "2c1cd3815fa907877a730d99e4108e8c046a55be", "git_parents": ["9554323c4b72f5322e777f692c8809676575dfb4"], "node": "0c4dfe715b395da2ee9c6d400d7ad5e05f7bfd62", "parents": ["df2189843f22eacc15140bf95d5ded187ae86a2c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Fernando Fiori \u003cffiori@microsoft.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061562 [wpt PR 61793] - Fix malformed markup in miscellaneous WPTs, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nFix malformed markup in miscellaneous WPTs\n\nCorrect mismatched closing tags and a malformed input attribute across\nseveral WPT areas so the source matches the intended DOM.\n\nBug: 542686202\nChange-Id: Icd6319f7a3667078e59226f3fb075ef65f0c6d53\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8199267\nAuto-Submit: Fernando Fiori \u003cffiori@microsoft.com\u003e\nReviewed-by: Stephanie Zhang \u003cstephanie.zhang@microsoft.com\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Fernando Fiori \u003cffiori@microsoft.com\u003e\nReviewed-by: Fernando Fiori \u003cffiori@microsoft.com\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1675103}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 5cf01e01ad9efc44bd4f53a84f7cb855c8c94f89\nwpt-pr: 61793\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/container-timing/tentative/pseudo-with-text-content-in-container-timing.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/encrypted-media/missing-sinf.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/infrastructure/testdriver/send_keys.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/service-workers/service-worker/resources/object-image-is-not-intercepted-iframe.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/uievents/order-of-events/focus-events/focus-contained.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/wai-aria/role/fallback-roles.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/wai-aria/role/tab-roles.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/xhr/formdata/constructor-submitter.html"], "git_node": "a40c2f8976cfe5911c9e3498ec37ea6e27e42fa7", "git_parents": ["2c1cd3815fa907877a730d99e4108e8c046a55be"], "node": "296a6faaf7bebdcb252eb0b9fe7fb630fb401797", "parents": ["0c4dfe715b395da2ee9c6d400d7ad5e05f7bfd62"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lu Huang \u003cluhua@microsoft.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061926 [wpt PR 61816] - [PWA] Add manual WPT tests for scope_extensions manifest member, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\n[PWA] Add manual WPT tests for scope_extensions manifest member\n\nAdd an end-to-end manual WPT for the web app manifest scope_extensions\nmember. The test installs a standalone app and verifies navigation from\nthe app to three cross-origin targets:\n\n* An origin that authorizes the app through\n  /.well-known/web-app-origin-association, within the granted path,\n  remains in the app context.\n* The same authorized origin outside the association's granted path\n  receives the user agent's normal out-of-scope treatment.\n* A declared extension origin that does not authorize the app is treated\n  as out of scope.\n\nAdd the manifest, installability service worker, target pages, visible\noperator instructions, and dynamic association response needed by the\nmanual flow. The two standard WPT HTTPS ports on 127.0.0.1 model\ndistinct origins while keeping the test hermetic. Loopback is used\nbecause Chromium rejects WPT's reserved .test hosts as scope-extension\norigins due to public-suffix validation.\n\nBug: 422382413\nChange-Id: Ie4d76bfd1789ae62d9cb898b604b6674211e7499\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/7787873\nReviewed-by: Daniel Murphy \u003cdmurph@chromium.org\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Lu Huang \u003cluhua@microsoft.com\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1676024}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 5b6a1e61dbf639ebea0b7f19d9df0e313ae5d959\nwpt-pr: 61816\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/.well-known/web-app-origin-association", "testing/web-platform/tests/appmanifest/scope_extensions-member/resources/icon.png", "testing/web-platform/tests/appmanifest/scope_extensions-member/resources/scope_extensions-member-no-association-target.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/appmanifest/scope_extensions-member/resources/scope_extensions-member-target.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/appmanifest/scope_extensions-member/resources/scope_extensions-member.sub.webmanifest", "testing/web-platform/tests/appmanifest/scope_extensions-member/resources/scope_extensions-member.sub.webmanifest.headers", "testing/web-platform/tests/appmanifest/scope_extensions-member/scope_extensions-member-manual.sub.tentative.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/appmanifest/scope_extensions-member/scope_extensions-member-outside-association-scope-target.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/appmanifest/scope_extensions-member/scope_extensions-member-service-worker.js"], "git_node": "dde3c3f2f9c0445b9626ecc9f9df0346593e4a30", "git_parents": ["a40c2f8976cfe5911c9e3498ec37ea6e27e42fa7"], "node": "8ed1a366e17c7d68402bcde7a79734812bd7e6d4", "parents": ["296a6faaf7bebdcb252eb0b9fe7fb630fb401797"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Wilson \u003cmjwilson@chromium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061928 [wpt PR 61818] - [WebAudio] Replace non-standard unicode characters in web tests, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\n[WebAudio] Replace non-standard unicode characters in web tests\n\nDuring test porting, unicode characters such as non-breaking hyphen,\ndirectional quote, n-dash, etc. were added. However, these do not always\ndisplay properly in all tools. Replace them with more standard\ncharacters.\n\nBug: 396477778\nChange-Id: Iec649c37e4d72eb454d7b62d3a61dc4dfa5c8d98\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8218727\nCommit-Queue: Michael Wilson \u003cmjwilson@chromium.org\u003e\nReviewed-by: Hongchan Choi \u003chongchan@chromium.org\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1676046}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: ab1715b997756a25d09d77cec13c19609f01c890\nwpt-pr: 61818\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/webaudio/the-audio-api/the-analysernode-interface/realtimeanalyser-fft-scaling.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/webaudio/the-audio-api/the-audiobuffersourcenode-interface/audiobuffersource-start.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/webaudio/the-audio-api/the-audiobuffersourcenode-interface/sub-sample-buffer-stitching.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/webaudio/the-audio-api/the-audiocontext-interface/audiocontext-suspend-resume.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/webaudio/the-audio-api/the-audioparam-interface/audioparam-setValueCurveAtTime.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/webaudio/the-audio-api/the-audioparam-interface/cancel-scheduled-values.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/webaudio/the-audio-api/the-audioparam-interface/k-rate-audiobuffersource-connections.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/webaudio/the-audio-api/the-audioparam-interface/k-rate-delay-connections.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/webaudio/the-audio-api/the-audioparam-interface/k-rate-panner.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/webaudio/the-audio-api/the-channelsplitternode-interface/audiochannelsplitter.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/webaudio/the-audio-api/the-channelsplitternode-interface/ctor-channelsplitter.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/webaudio/the-audio-api/the-convolvernode-interface/realtime-conv.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/webaudio/the-audio-api/the-gainnode-interface/gain.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/webaudio/the-audio-api/the-gainnode-interface/no-dezippering.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/webaudio/the-audio-api/the-iirfilternode-interface/iirfilter-getFrequencyResponse.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/webaudio/the-audio-api/the-oscillatornode-interface/detune-limiting.html"], "git_node": "d0b7bee491fc8a5855f211cfbb0fbbf8fb03f9d7", "git_parents": ["dde3c3f2f9c0445b9626ecc9f9df0346593e4a30"], "node": "547b38f99844e79ca909d04002d67c72000047fb", "parents": ["8ed1a366e17c7d68402bcde7a79734812bd7e6d4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061928 [wpt PR 61818] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 61818\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/webaudio/the-audio-api/the-analysernode-interface/test-analyser-resume-after-suspended.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/webaudio/the-audio-api/the-audioparam-interface/k-rate-panner.html.ini"], "git_node": "33778f7bc7c1de8321cb268ac7610bd43385f692", "git_parents": ["d0b7bee491fc8a5855f211cfbb0fbbf8fb03f9d7"], "node": "5d0c04fc731465ff1964174e177934a830d2774f", "parents": ["547b38f99844e79ca909d04002d67c72000047fb"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Kurt Catti-Schmidt \u003ckschmi@microsoft.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061931 [wpt PR 61821] - Revert \"[CSS Modules] Update fetching strategy\", a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nRevert \"[CSS Modules] Update fetching strategy\"\n\nThis reverts commit f3d832bb043a00e06a160104f60b4f3f0d17f1c0.\n\nReason for revert: the reverted CL introduced two regressions for CSS\nmodule scripts fetched through a redirect. It moved CSSStyleSheet\ncreation from fetch completion to module map insertion time, where only\nthe request URL is known:\n\n1. The module map entry is keyed on the request URL, but the lookup in\n   ModuleScriptLoader::NotifyFetchFinishedSuccess used the response URL,\n   so after a redirect the pre-created entry was not found and\n   CHECK(pre_created) was hit.\n2. The sheet's parser context was built from the request URL, so\n   relative url() references resolved against the pre-redirect directory\n   rather than the response URL as the spec requires.\n\nBoth affect plain `import ... with { type: \"css\" }`, dynamic import(),\nand modulepreload (not just shadowrootadoptedstylesheets) and the crash\nmasks the base URL bug in a shipping build. Since\nshadowrootadoptedstylesheets is on hold, reverting is preferred over\ncarrying targeted fixes.\n\nIn addition to a revert, this change also adds two new test cases that\ncover the scenarios listed above, as this is a gap in test coverage that\nwould have been discovered sooner had tests like these existed.\n\nBug: 448174611\nChange-Id: I904703de1a51701a34a246932b02940eaf5ce3c8\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8217649\nReviewed-by: Dan Clark \u003cdaniec@microsoft.com\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Kurt Catti-Schmidt \u003ckschmi@microsoft.com\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1676076}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 5a6dab17be629f7a412ff67fc176daf4a9364a67\nwpt-pr: 61821\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/html/semantics/scripting-1/the-script-element/css-module/redirect-relative-urls.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/semantics/scripting-1/the-script-element/css-module/redirect.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/semantics/scripting-1/the-script-element/css-module/resources/redirect-target.css", "testing/web-platform/tests/shadow-dom/declarative/tentative/shadowrootadoptedstylesheets/shadowrootadoptedstylesheets-async-fetch-disconnect-iframe.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/shadow-dom/declarative/tentative/shadowrootadoptedstylesheets/shadowrootadoptedstylesheets-async-fetch-failure-shared.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/shadow-dom/declarative/tentative/shadowrootadoptedstylesheets/shadowrootadoptedstylesheets-async-fetch-failure.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/shadow-dom/declarative/tentative/shadowrootadoptedstylesheets/shadowrootadoptedstylesheets-async-fetch-mutation-removed-still-updates.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/shadow-dom/declarative/tentative/shadowrootadoptedstylesheets/shadowrootadoptedstylesheets-modulepreload-failure.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/shadow-dom/declarative/tentative/shadowrootadoptedstylesheets/shadowrootadoptedstylesheets-placeholder-identity.html"], "git_node": "6362eacb2d51fba59202ee511f4650efa771b01d", "git_parents": ["33778f7bc7c1de8321cb268ac7610bd43385f692"], "node": "d7829e2e75f39c703706a8b166e927ecf8f6dc39", "parents": ["5d0c04fc731465ff1964174e177934a830d2774f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061931 [wpt PR 61821] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 61821\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/shadow-dom/declarative/tentative/shadowrootadoptedstylesheets/shadowrootadoptedstylesheets-async-fetch-failure-shared.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/shadow-dom/declarative/tentative/shadowrootadoptedstylesheets/shadowrootadoptedstylesheets-async-fetch-failure.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/shadow-dom/declarative/tentative/shadowrootadoptedstylesheets/shadowrootadoptedstylesheets-async-fetch-mutation-removed-still-updates.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/shadow-dom/declarative/tentative/shadowrootadoptedstylesheets/shadowrootadoptedstylesheets-modulepreload-failure.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/shadow-dom/declarative/tentative/shadowrootadoptedstylesheets/shadowrootadoptedstylesheets-placeholder-identity.html.ini"], "git_node": "c5e11dd9219ed75b84287a9edec50e8e7f442e13", "git_parents": ["6362eacb2d51fba59202ee511f4650efa771b01d"], "node": "96d5048a1e92e1068169af409d50b1978889737c", "parents": ["d7829e2e75f39c703706a8b166e927ecf8f6dc39"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Martin Robinson \u003cmrobinson@igalia.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061879 [wpt PR 61814] - script: Properly clear selection flags on siblings, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nscript: Properly clear selection flags on siblings\n\nThere were two issues interfering with proper rendering of incremental\nselection updates:\n\n- During the selection flag clearing traversal, when leaving a node the\n  traversal was not advanced. This meant that flags were cleared on\n  descendants but not siblings of nodes.\n- When selection was updated via DOM APIs, there was nothing triggering\n  a new rendering update.\n\nUnfortunately these changes have to happen together, as there is no way\nto test the second issue in isolation -- things that trigger a\nscreenshot also trigger rendering updates. The second issue will be\nbetter covered once tests for interactive document selection updates are\nimplemented though. In addition, the reference for the test must also\nuse selection APIs as Servo does not yet support `::selection` fully.\n\nSigned-off-by: Martin Robinson \u003cmrobinson@igalia.com\u003e\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 841f08ffcef5430c77cf4b4c6ad1d5f6625880da\nwpt-pr: 61814\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/selection/selection-incremental-change-repaint-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/selection/selection-incremental-change-repaint.html"], "git_node": "4d8f9804debec711aa4fe56c8a6164886f4a50cd", "git_parents": ["c5e11dd9219ed75b84287a9edec50e8e7f442e13"], "node": "a7038451bf126b601ec03e700a7391f27dbbc3e3", "parents": ["96d5048a1e92e1068169af409d50b1978889737c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Martin Robinson \u003cmrobinson@igalia.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061936 [wpt PR 61824] - layout: Apply followup fixes for #47022, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nlayout: Apply followup fixes for #47022\n\nDuring reivew of #47022, I made some fixes according to review comments.\nUnfortunately I left those fixes uncommitted in my working directory.\nThis change actually applies them.\n\nSigned-off-by: Martin Robinson \u003cmrobinson@igalia.com\u003e\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 54f8f933629e7c010ae98a246729af01f8abcda5\nwpt-pr: 61824\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-text/text-transform/reference/text-transform-upperlower-108-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-text/text-transform/text-transform-upperlower-108.html"], "git_node": "30b6b5994bf6bdb083ffab424ba8dfa972be5d13", "git_parents": ["4d8f9804debec711aa4fe56c8a6164886f4a50cd"], "node": "03f8961fba84a534e38b84946d86df2e39fc13af", "parents": ["a7038451bf126b601ec03e700a7391f27dbbc3e3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061936 [wpt PR 61824] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 61824\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-text/text-transform/text-transform-upperlower-108.html.ini"], "git_node": "ac8db25bf56310aff84e4bf349cdf476690e7143", "git_parents": ["30b6b5994bf6bdb083ffab424ba8dfa972be5d13"], "node": "b9e82a3d72a8127e850048a0cb6523e242252e61", "parents": ["03f8961fba84a534e38b84946d86df2e39fc13af"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061974 - [wpt-sync] Update web-platform-tests to 54f8f933629e7c010ae98a246729af01f8abcda5, a=testonly\n\nMANUAL PUSH: wpt sync bot\n\nwpt-head: 54f8f933629e7c010ae98a246729af01f8abcda5\nwpt-type: landing\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/content-security-policy/inside-worker/serviceworker-c