r=layout-reviewers,emilio\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D311057\n", "files": ["layout/generic/ScrollGeneration.cpp", "layout/generic/ScrollGeneration.h", "layout/generic/StickyScrollContainer.cpp", "layout/generic/StickyScrollContainer.h", "layout/generic/nsGridContainerFrame.cpp", "layout/tables/SpanningCellSorter.cpp", "layout/tables/SpanningCellSorter.h"], "git_node": "7fccdd045382b636e88b2b9ea307459cd4ccc874", "git_parents": ["975142982415260de5b8b2215874efcef315817a"], "node": "5b893a471ec06ccf547b93edcc5028fb54365703", "parents": ["dfdd32c31f3a9e9d779fbaf2ebcfff855610a9cf"], "tags": []}, {"author": "serge-sans-paille \u003csguelton@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2053404 - Cleanup default state for static-analysis on Windows / ipc part r=ipc-reviewers,nika\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D311058\n", "files": ["ipc/chromium/src/base/message_pump_win.h", "ipc/chromium/src/base/time.h", "ipc/glue/FileDescriptor.cpp", "ipc/glue/FileDescriptor.h", "ipc/glue/MessagePump.h", "ipc/glue/WindowsMessageLoop.cpp", "ipc/mscom/ProfilerMarkers.cpp"], "git_node": "df4e34ff7607c5b8035ae1e012803ae33fb75ecf", "git_parents": ["7fccdd045382b636e88b2b9ea307459cd4ccc874"], "node": "d6739ef5bd67e7788767b4e5f320e31ca034b140", "parents": ["5b893a471ec06ccf547b93edcc5028fb54365703"], "tags": []}, {"author": "tannal \u003cmtan@igalia.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2059312 - Part 2: Add MathMLAnchorElement class and WebIDL bindings r=emilio,webidl,firefox-svg-reviewers\n\nAdd the MathMLAnchorElement C++ class, WebIDL binding, and feature pref (mathml.a.element.enabled).\n\nAdd basic href navigation, target attribute handling and HyperlinkElementUtils mixin implementation.\n\nExtract a helper function in the Link base class to handle focusability decisions for HTML, SVG, and MathML anchor elements.\n\nI2P: https://groups.google.com/u/1/a/mozilla.org/g/dev-platform/c/UHg0HwA_A6I\n\nD