ore displaying it. This keeps the preview in sync with the payload sent to Glean, so future changes to the ChatMessage model can't cause the preview and submitted telemetry to diverge\n- Moved normalizeChatLog and its helpers from AboutWelcomeTelemetry.sys.mjs to ChatUtils.sys.mjs, since the normalization is Smart Window chat logic that's now shared by both the preview and telemetry submission\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315730\n", "files": ["browser/components/aboutwelcome/modules/AboutWelcomeTelemetry.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/modules/ChatUtils.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/modules/FeedbackModal.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/xpcshell/test_chat-utils.js", "browser/components/asrouter/metrics.yaml"], "git_node": "5b17d6fc790a33ae38877cc0dabf3462244700b6", "git_parents": ["de1e28ceaf8fb933e40549beb84c8d7f910237f8"], "node": "c2c7da20657e26823ba1c1f004c7735e4cca6301", "parents": ["00e95210f9200303721ace7ab82b2dcd9587b080"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Irene Ni \u003cini@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2062434 - New Tab topsite context menu button should obey prefers-reduced-motion. r=mconley\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317653\n", "files": ["browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/TopSites/_TopSites.scss"], "git_node": "098dda7e1b06edbc39ad4d74a5b15a9053a2a26b", "git_parents": ["5b17d6fc790a33ae38877cc0dabf3462244700b6"], "node": "91fcb6623bf99fb5adbff89ef74c99cd637a0118", "parents": ["c2c7da20657e26823ba1c1f004c7735e4cca6301"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Updatebot \u003cupdatebot@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2062470 - Update NSS to 87cd6e8ff1ccfc34c3805478c7ff5a5f9b3caafe. UPGRADE_NSS_RELEASE r=nss-reviewers,jschanck\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317688\n", "files": ["security/nss/cmd/pk12util/pk12util.c", "security/nss/cmd/tests/nonspr10.c", "security/nss/g