t", "desc": "Bug 2056645 - Flip browser.smartwindow.worldcup.enabled to false. r=mzhang\n\nThe World Cup is over and Merino is removing the WCS endpoints, so turn\noff the world cup tool calls. The tool calling code itself is removed in\na follow-up patch; this pref flip is kept minimal so it can be uplifted\nto beta and release.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317833\n", "files": ["browser/app/profile/firefox.js"], "git_node": "b7edd7c062fea606a550187f3f933d891d6fa53f", "git_parents": ["cfa767c1d25b2eb0268c9e88c4cb31600a1eb304"], "node": "55164e5f4af513bfd2dc0fc8bf9334307afe9232", "parents": ["91fbf640b3540c31ffc2f6a6391081037e571d5a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Chris H-C \u003cchutten@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1974314 - Support ping test callbacks across JS and C++, including artifact builds r=TravisLong,chumphreys\n\nInstead of storing ping test callbacks by id, store them by name.\nIt means that on every call to Submit on a C++ Ping object, we do a\nlinear scan of all ping names. But at time of writing there are only 48\nof them, so this is fast enough.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314766\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/glean/bindings/GleanPings.cpp", "toolkit/components/glean/bindings/private/Ping.cpp", "toolkit/components/glean/bindings/private/Ping.h", "toolkit/components/glean/build_scripts/glean_parser_ext/templates/js_pings.jinja2", "toolkit/components/glean/build_scripts/glean_parser_ext/templates/js_pings_h.jinja2", "toolkit/components/glean/docs/user/instrumentation_tests.md", "toolkit/components/glean/tests/pytest/pings_test_output_js_cpp", "toolkit/components/glean/tests/pytest/pings_test_output_js_h", "toolkit/components/glean/tests/xpcshell/test_JOG.js"], "git_node": "1b4055ec44f6208f87b51546bfd462f40697e27c", "git_parents": ["b7edd7c062fea606a550187f3f933d891d6fa53f"], "node": "5256cb6d5af6b0ed49775986caf56f12e9a5dc33", "parents": ["55164e5f4af513bfd2dc0fc8bf9334307afe9232"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Chris H-C \u003cchutten@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1974314 - Unskip browser_page_load_event_telemetry.js in artifact builds now that JS tests of C++ ping submission work r=robwu\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315074\n", "files": ["dom/base/test/browser_page_load_event_telemetry.js"], "git_node": "a9cf07af07840cc26cb936d3c4f0fe6d2010c5ee", "git_parents": ["1b4055ec44f6208f87b51546bfd462f40697e27c"], "node": "82eed05b154d46620ebeaa04bc2078fe4ed53a00", "parents": ["5256cb6d5af6b0ed49775986caf56f12e9a5dc33"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Chris H-C \u003cchutten@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1974314 - unskip test_fog_complex_object_works, test_labeled_metrics_test_get_value_works in artifact r=chumphreys\n\nThey both now work!\n(The former since bug 1883857, the latter since Glean SDK v67.2.0)\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315075\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/glean/tests/xpcshell/test_Glean.js"], "git_node": "32daa16331b7deb2be0fcdd3db9c21576ba31a9a", "git_parents": ["a9cf07af07840cc26cb936d3c4f0fe6d2010c5ee"], "node": "c4e4d8991357eb9173f497a20b4645b3fc43decc", "parents": ["82eed05b154d46620ebeaa04bc2078fe4ed53a00"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Chris H-C \u003cchutten@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1974314 - Unskip test_ThirdPartyModulesPing.js, test_UsageReporting.js on artifact as they now work r=gstoll\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315076\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/telemetry/tests/unit/test_ThirdPartyModulesPing.js", "toolkit/components/telemetry/tests/unit/xpcshell.toml"], "git_node": "d01e3cf6b68407eea869972aa36a06af7c5c3db7", "git_parents": ["32daa16331b7deb2be0fcdd3db9c21576ba31a9a"], "node": "db94a2036af74a0363355d197b75ad098d27d92f", "parents": ["c4e4d8991357eb9173f497a20b4645b3fc43decc"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Chris H-C \u003cchutten@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1974314 - Unskip test_new_profile.js, test_new_profile_ping_sent.js on artifact as they now work r=dmcintosh,jhirsch\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315077\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/telemetry/tests/unit/test_new_profile.js", "toolkit/profile/test/xpcshell/xpcshell.toml"], "git_node": "9f5e1bca4bec7c55408e5719d5b1be182d6acc4f", "git_parents": ["d01e3cf6b68407eea869972aa36a06af7c5c3db7"], "node": "d6315a79af93921e4ab648c6fa94b94825d4f7ee", "parents": ["db94a2036af74a0363355d197b75ad098d27d92f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Chris H-C \u003cchutten@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1974314 - Unskip test_content_decoding_error_telemetry.js on artifact because it is now supported r=necko-reviewers,kershaw\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315086\n", "files": ["netwerk/test/unit/xpcshell.toml"], "git_node": "f64baafbed628e9ebf76950343d1efd1a1f3ac9b", "git_parents": ["9f5e1bca4bec7c55408e5719d5b1be182d6acc4f"], "node": "e11a0f16108128c72db6aa22d6af93d2aee90bd7", "parents": ["d6315a79af93921e4ab648c6fa94b94825d4f7ee"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Chris H-C \u003cchutten@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1974314 - Unskip child_cause_hang.js on artifact because it is now supported r=florian\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315087\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/backgroundhangmonitor/tests/xpcshell.toml"], "git_node": "43b2d215cbf7171f255cc81b3f0560873ed25995", "git_parents": ["f64baafbed628e9ebf76950343d1efd1a1f3ac9b"], "node": "16f0a5ebfc21508273bec025c5717dac19554294", "parents": ["e11a0f16108128c72db6aa22d6af93d2aee90bd7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Chris H-C \u003cchutten@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1974314 - Unskip test_ext_urlclassifier on artifact because it is now supported r=extension-reviewers,robwu\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315088\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/extensions/test/xpcshell/xpcshell.toml"], "git_node": "389bd406d156d5473e638e018d5ba91d3c41815c", "git_parents": ["43b2d215cbf7171f255cc81b3f0560873ed25995"], "node": "5f3fe2aff3165908e3c7b9721932b48d35dd82d0", "parents": ["16f0a5ebfc21508273bec025c5717dac19554294"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Alex Hochheiden \u003cahochheiden@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058760 - Invoke `mach` with the current Python interpreter in the generated `rust-analyzer` config r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,sergesanspaille\n\nDue to changes in D301634, without this, when `./mach cargo check` was\ninvoked during the build, it would run with a different Python\ninterpreter, determine the virtualenv was out of date, and delete and\nrebuild it. The build then failed with errors that pointed nowhere near\nthe cause.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316393\n", "files": ["python/mozbuild/mozbuild/backend/mach_commands.py"], "git_node": "9a83f6ed9b637cfcf7f3a22c917ecb4303f4629a", "git_parents": ["389bd406d156d5473e638e018d5ba91d3c41815c"], "node": "39c38e4f291cda7938d675121c93723f2445c102", "parents": ["5f3fe2aff3165908e3c7b9721932b48d35dd82d0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nikki Sharpley \u003cnsharpley@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2062401 - Fix visual nits for account and app menu Nova designs r=desktop-theme-reviewers,sfoster,fluent-reviewers,bolsson\n\n- unbold \"sync is on/off\" and \"sync and save data\"\n- sentence/title case where needed\n- move sign out button in account menu underneath secure sync section\n- uniform gaps for icons and text\n- new device icon for laptop in Nova\n- pill shape background for signed in user toolbar item\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317668\n", "files": ["browser/base/content/appmenu-viewcache.inc.xhtml", "browser/base/content/browser-sync.js", "browser/base/content/test/sync/browser_sync.js", "browser/locales/en-US/browser/appmenu.ftl", "browser/themes/shared/customizableui/panelUI-shared.css", "browser/themes/shared/icons/device-desktop.svg"], "git_node": "e737657aea24dad6c3690eabff586fb6dae56fcc", "git_parents": ["9a83f6ed9b637cfcf7f3a22c917ecb4303f4629a"], "node": "f711908ad4fbbce8d6c0dbda3efd33b7dab23141", "parents": ["39c38e4f291cda7938d675121c93723f2445c102"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nikki Sharpley \u003cnsharpley@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058418 - Ensure \u201cGet Firefox for Android or iOS\u201d button is visible in Account Menu when sync is off r=desktop-theme-reviewers,kcochrane\n\n- moved the button to the secure sync section and ensure its visiblity is toggled when sync is turned on/off\n- updated the link\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317825\n", "files": ["browser/base/content/appmenu-viewcache.inc.xhtml", "browser/base/content/browser-sync.js", "browser/base/content/test/sync/browser_sync.js", "browser/themes/shared/customizableui/panelUI-shared.css"], "git_node": "1390d31d1b1ab41080abd5479c49f4f814280c8e", "git_parents": ["e737657aea24dad6c3690eabff586fb6dae56fcc"], "node": "454232ba2f252db66dc2de6387ed495a74313a4f", "parents": ["f711908ad4fbbce8d6c0dbda3efd33b7dab23141"], "tags": []}, {"author": "serge-sans-paille \u003csguelton@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2062569 - Properly reference jsoncpp dependency in our license file r=sylvestre\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317762\n", "files": ["toolkit/content/license.html"], "git_node": "05f46e59f1afee061271049d189fd70d442df0ca", "git_parents": ["1390d31d1b1ab41080abd5479c49f4f814280c8e"], "node": "261b21b230bca174b22198162b1c4a4ef61f0fee", "parents": ["454232ba2f252db66dc2de6387ed495a74313a4f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2059809 - Don't set the nth-* slow selector flag for edge child selectors. r=dshin,firefox-style-system-reviewers\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317758\n", "files": ["servo/components/selectors/matching.rs"], "git_node": "098c63e258140993a775c02f7a1faf3775cce4c3", "git_parents": ["05f46e59f1afee061271049d189fd70d442df0ca"], "node": "8d5d8f1171f41a643f68f8f0cf1940782f13b2f3", "parents": ["261b21b230bca174b22198162b1c4a4ef61f0fee"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2059809 - Fix a typo in apply_selector_flags. r=firefox-style-system-reviewers,dshin\n\nI don't think we apply these in any case where this would change\nbehavior but seems worth fixing.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317759\n", "files": ["servo/components/style/gecko/wrapper.rs"], "git_node": "97f1e5e8404fbfa22cf9274a8856640ab7f3ed5d", "git_parents": ["098c63e258140993a775c02f7a1faf3775cce4c3"], "node": "e7e8739f8ee672a80fb543ce717e870e7a1f5d15", "parents": ["8d5d8f1171f41a643f68f8f0cf1940782f13b2f3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Alex Hochheiden \u003cahochheiden@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2062116 - Stop `./mach vendor` from aborting on removed files `moz.build` never tracked r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,sergesanspaille\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317385\n", "files": ["python/mozbuild/mozbuild/test/vendor/test_vendor_manifest.py", "python/mozbuild/mozbuild/vendor/vendor_manifest.py"], "git_node": "5b1dfe0729e063a5c689ec7eca86fcdc3f62941d", "git_parents": ["97f1e5e8404fbfa22cf9274a8856640ab7f3ed5d"], "node": "b1e11f075a52c9b2e580cd0734b0b5e6f55edbdc", "parents": ["e7e8739f8ee672a80fb543ce717e870e7a1f5d15"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Leo Tenenbaum \u003cltenenbaum@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1498271 - Don't wrap long lines in nsXHTMLContentSerializer if OutputDisallowLineBreaking is passed. r=edgar\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316565\n", "files": ["dom/serializers/nsXHTMLContentSerializer.cpp", "dom/serializers/tests/mochitest/copypaste.js", "dom/serializers/tests/mochitest/test_copypaste.html", "dom/serializers/tests/mochitest/test_copypaste.xhtml"], "git_node": "63f45278a87ae02f27e83505c418b6ab3a67384b", "git_parents": ["5b1dfe0729e063a5c689ec7eca86fcdc3f62941d"], "node": "cdd03d87cdfc9e6ab30c9aa175d7a0ea1850ef3d", "parents": ["b1e11f075a52c9b2e580cd0734b0b5e6f55edbdc"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lando \u003clando@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Merge mozilla-central to autoland\n", "files": [], "git_node": "dae0e0eeedd2e60dbdc9086b53710608289a05db", "git_parents": ["63f45278a87ae02f27e83505c418b6ab3a67384b", "85130ba192d9f4bdf63e57502cb23fb31f95f7ca"], "node": "17b4fc22fd60dba369402a5fe6ba4a1f2215f2ba", "parents": ["cdd03d87cdfc9e6ab30c9aa175d7a0ea1850ef3d", "be1ad74e08cab1c71617c3f54a0b95bc01641eab"], "tags": []}, {"author": "pstanciu \u003cpstanciu@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2060788 - Surface stale and revalidation state in Happy Eyeballs profiler markers r=necko-reviewers,jesup\" for causing wpt failures @ drm-mp4-playback-temporary-playduration.https.html\n\nThis reverts commit 4c7abb49797f298dcfec56bbe7e6afd16da1ac5c.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2060788 - Revalidate stale DNS answers in Happy Eyeballs r=necko-reviewers,kershaw\"\n\nThis reverts commit 59fb478277e272821518d3250584a0a97f8d5b13.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2060788 - Test that Happy Eyeballs revalidates a stale DNS answer r=necko-reviewers,kershaw\"\n\nThis reverts commit e89e5e69b9fbea67dff91b4a57dbafd4214f46ef.\n", "files": ["netwerk/dns/DNSByTypeRecord.h", "netwerk/dns/DNSRequestChild.cpp", "netwerk/dns/DNSRequestParent.cpp", "netwerk/dns/PDNSRequestParams.ipdlh", "netwerk/dns/nsDNSService2.cpp", "netwerk/dns/nsHostRecord.cpp", "netwerk/dns/nsHostRecord.h", "netwerk/dns/nsIDNSByTypeRecord.idl", "netwerk/dns/nsIDNSRecord.idl", "netwerk/protocol/http/ConnectionEstablisher.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/ConnectionEstablisher.h", "netwerk/protocol/http/HappyEyeballsConnectionAttempt.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/HappyEyeballsConnectionAttempt.h", "netwerk/protocol/http/happy_eyeballs_glue/src/lib.rs", "netwerk/protocol/http/happy_eyeballs_glue/src/profiler.rs", "netwerk/test/unit/test_happy_eyeballs_optimistic_dns.js", "netwerk/test/unit/xpcshell.toml"], "git_node": "760897ee7477289b7caf63d395859eeb895e0bd9", "git_parents": ["dae0e0eeedd2e60dbdc9086b53710608289a05db"], "node": "3e5f7d3d0c945571e4cff46447adc685544114fe", "parents": ["17b4fc22fd60dba369402a5fe6ba4a1f2215f2ba"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Vincent Hilla \u003cvhilla@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2062150 - Allow sub-millisecond gecko_profile_interval values. r=taskgraph-reviewers,releng-reviewers,florian,ahal\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317417\n", "files": ["taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/actions/gecko_profile.py"], "git_node": "5d5177add2ed4d2376b5fb62de35f68162f84891", "git_parents": ["760897ee7477289b7caf63d395859eeb895e0bd9"], "node": "cc99f1236ef556ce2257822fa842c50d4d6f7aa0", "parents": ["3e5f7d3d0c945571e4cff46447adc685544114fe"], "tags": []}, {"author": "chloezhouny \u003cchloezhouny@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058590 - Show the search_the_web action log while Exa runs, not after r=Mardak,mzhang\n\nThe tool-result message that builds the action-log card was only added once search_the_web's handler fully resolved (Exa retrieval, page reads, answer generation), so the \"Searching the web with Exa\" card appeared only at the very end. Emit the tool message up front with a placeholder body so the pending row renders during the work, then reconcile it in place on completion via the new ChatConversation.updateToolCallMessage.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316689\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/models/Chat.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/tests/xpcshell/test_Chat.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-action-result/ai-action-result.css", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/modules/ChatConversation.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/modules/ToolActionLog.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_aiwindow_ai_action_result.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/xpcshell/test_ChatConversation.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/xpcshell/test_ToolActionLog.js"], "git_node": "70252656e28495a98dbe8b72501a051779ae2398", "git_parents": ["5d5177add2ed4d2376b5fb62de35f68162f84891"], "node": "142702de60b537d5600e6a8f033d77f3b5e814de", "parents": ["cc99f1236ef556ce2257822fa842c50d4d6f7aa0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-central repo-update remote-settings mobile-experiments mobile-merino-manifest ct-logs - r=release-managers,RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317943\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/service/merino-manifest/src/main/assets/manifest/manifest.json", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/raw/initial_experiments.json", "security/ct/CTKnownLogs.h", "security/manager/tools/log_list.json", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters.json", "services/settings/dumps/main/search-config-icons.json"], "git_node": "f93209f001d2f75b61c5b6b655f75a64f9e9c634", "git_parents": ["70252656e28495a98dbe8b72501a051779ae2398"], "node": "b82bf2e9100904829ae77c16e76694316d3aca4a", "parents": ["142702de60b537d5600e6a8f033d77f3b5e814de"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jonathan Almeida \u003cjonalmeida942@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2060696 - Add tests to evaluate disabled and allowed region r=mavduevskiy,android-reviewers\n\nThe original patch was trying to ensure enabled and allowed regions\nworked together, but this was already the case. This test is for\nasserting that the disabled version is also covered so that we don't\nconfuse this again.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317693\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/ipprotection/FenixIPProtectionEligibilityStorageTest.kt"], "git_node": "b2c63ae8a40554076462bb90cc1c0d6ce6ad9d87", "git_parents": ["f93209f001d2f75b61c5b6b655f75a64f9e9c634"], "node": "938a72f45c4e2439a629c67fe673c613070dc416", "parents": ["b82bf2e9100904829ae77c16e76694316d3aca4a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mark Kennedy \u003cmkennedy@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2052548 - Update icons for theme picker r=extension-reviewers,desktop-theme-reviewers,hjones,rpl\n\nThe theme picker was showing placeholder weather icons for the light,\ndark, and device options. The picker now uses the intended sun, moon,\nand local-host icons from the Nova design system.\n\nBecause the icons are now packaged at the toolkit level, the components\nthat host the picker no longer need to disable the no-browser-refs-in-toolkit\nlint rule.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317645\n", "files": ["browser/themes/shared/jar.inc.mn", "browser/themes/shared/notification-icons/local-host.svg", "toolkit/content/widgets/theme-picker/theme-picker.mjs", "toolkit/mozapps/extensions/content/components/aboutaddons-themes-mode.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/desktop-jar.inc.mn", "toolkit/themes/shared/icons/local-host.svg", "toolkit/themes/shared/icons/moon.svg", "toolkit/themes/shared/icons/sun.svg"], "git_node": "ad16525d05dcc2c77015190f831ac9777b10109b", "git_parents": ["b2c63ae8a40554076462bb90cc1c0d6ce6ad9d87"], "node": "15288924078fb49e11accb73fe13da419211b87e", "parents": ["938a72f45c4e2439a629c67fe673c613070dc416"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emily McDonough \u003cemcdonough@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2059260 Part 1 - Add a lightweight helper to memory map an entire file at once. r=xpcom-reviewers,nika,afranchuk\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315120\n", "files": ["xpcom/io/MemoryMappedFile.h", "xpcom/io/MemoryMappedFileUnix.cpp", "xpcom/io/MemoryMappedFileWin32.cpp", "xpcom/io/moz.build"], "git_node": "dc67cce3db8954e8537754ce51730f6c0bae7cd5", "git_parents": ["ad16525d05dcc2c77015190f831ac9777b10109b"], "node": "b5f2fb5c2d378dff2ed02da2b185570b5db1e79a", "parents": ["15288924078fb49e11accb73fe13da419211b87e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emily McDonough \u003cemcdonough@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2059260 Part 2 - Update xpconnect/AutoMemMap to use MemoryMappedFile r=afranchuk\n\nThere are a number of features this class provided that MemoryMappedFile can't\nsupport, but which nothing actually uses (writeable files, requesting a region\nsize, etc) which can just be removed.\n\nThis class also introduced a source of const-incorrectness, as it was possible\nto map a file as read-only but then get a RangedPtr to mutable data (a const\npointer to mutable data is not a pointer to const data...). However, the only\nplaces this was used was for memory prefetch, which should never write to the\nunderlying memory. Since the files were always read-only mapped, we can safely\nsay we would already be getting protection faults if it did.\n\nSo we can make the prefetch take a const pointer, and then AutoMemMap can\nalways hold on to read-only data.\n\nThis preserves the existing limit of AutoMemMap only supporting files up to\n4 GB in size, even on 64-bit systems.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316644\n", "files": ["js/xpconnect/loader/AutoMemMap.cpp", "js/xpconnect/loader/AutoMemMap.h", "js/xpconnect/loader/ScriptPreloader.cpp", "startupcache/StartupCache.cpp", "startupcache/StartupCache.h", "xpcom/glue/MemUtils.cpp", "xpcom/glue/MemUtils.h"], "git_node": "2e526174b9adbd00e8e4f6dfc1b5dfe329994eba", "git_parents": ["dc67cce3db8954e8537754ce51730f6c0bae7cd5"], "node": "0d2194264ef1a1c7473325a423d14a2bb5577882", "parents": ["b5f2fb5c2d378dff2ed02da2b185570b5db1e79a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lando \u003clando@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2059260: apply code formatting via Lando\n\n# ignore-this-changeset\n", "files": ["js/xpconnect/loader/AutoMemMap.h"], "git_node": "c4351e770061042a55328e2e7f276570661c3839", "git_parents": ["2e526174b9adbd00e8e4f6dfc1b5dfe329994eba"], "node": "bca94bf04022ef1b04488a0af5e7a5a5f2b46439", "parents": ["0d2194264ef1a1c7473325a423d14a2bb5577882"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2003715 - Raise the timeout factor for test_quicksuggest_merino.js. r=urlbar-reviewers,Standard8\n\nThe test isn't hanging when it fails in verify mode, it's running out of\nbudget: the profiles from the timed-out jobs show the main thread making\ncontinuous progress until it is killed, two tasks short of the end. The file\nneeds roughly 75-80s under chaos mode against the 60s per-test cap, so\ndoubling the cap leaves a comfortable margin.\n\nTwo other tests in this manifest already carry the same factor for the same\nreason.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317565\n", "files": ["browser/components/urlbar/tests/quicksuggest/unit/xpcshell.toml"], "git_node": "302db1d6823baaa82dfb664c854ac1c41a11baa5", "git_parents": ["c4351e770061042a55328e2e7f276570661c3839"], "node": "e3e74298bdfbb6cdebdea3b3a0936a70423c3204", "parents": ["bca94bf04022ef1b04488a0af5e7a5a5f2b46439"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Alex Hochheiden \u003cahochheiden@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2038789 - Remove dead and redundant code from installer/packaging Makefiles r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,releng-reviewers,bhearsum,sergesanspaille\n\nMost of these packaging variables have no readers left. Removing them shrinks\nthe surface that has to be understood before the packaging logic moves into\nconfigure and Python actions.\n\n`ENABLE_WEBDRIVER`, `MOZ_ENABLE_SKIA_PDF`, and `NECKO_WIFI` each have a\n`set_define` in `toolkit/moz.configure`, so `ACDEFINES` already carries them\nwith the same values. The packager takes `$(DEFINES) $(ACDEFINES)` in that\norder, so the `ACDEFINES` copy already wins. `ENABLE_WEBDRIVER` is the only one\nof the three a manifest still reads, and it keeps reaching the preprocessor\nunchanged.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317226\n", "files": ["browser/installer/Makefile.in", "build/moz-automation.mk", "mobile/android/installer/Makefile.in", "taskcluster/kinds/release-source/kind.yml", "toolkit/mozapps/installer/package-name.mk", "toolkit/mozapps/installer/packager.mk", "toolkit/mozapps/installer/upload-files.mk"], "git_node": "b257b76e2f91333a9684af90440037ff416d7988", "git_parents": ["302db1d6823baaa82dfb664c854ac1c41a11baa5"], "node": "78f4cb48528f5358dfe90b154ed58f5be7e7c79a", "parents": ["e3e74298bdfbb6cdebdea3b3a0936a70423c3204"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Alex Hochheiden \u003cahochheiden@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2038789 - Expose configure values needed by application packaging r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,sergesanspaille\n\nPackaging manifest defines are moving into each application's `moz.configure`.\nSeveral inputs were either unnamed or defined after\n`include_project_configure`, so project configuration could not depend on them.\n\nName those inputs and move the NSIS check before the project configure include\nwithout changing their configured values.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317227\n", "files": ["build/moz.configure/nss.configure", "build/moz.configure/toolchain.configure", "build/moz.configure/update-programs.configure", "build/moz.configure/windows.configure", "moz.configure", "toolkit/moz.configure"], "git_node": "11f26990fc5b55314fb37f5cf09275dad48ccc08", "git_parents": ["b257b76e2f91333a9684af90440037ff416d7988"], "node": "6e385c8621f1c9a7e9d5e032adf71309834a3168", "parents": ["78f4cb48528f5358dfe90b154ed58f5be7e7c79a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan Hunt \u003crhunt@eqrion.net\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055007 - Use unsigned comparison in BaseStackFrame::zeroLocals loop r=jseward\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D312392\n", "files": ["js/src/wasm/WasmBCFrame.cpp"], "git_node": "155e9a4925229d96be581022f02091504d394d9c", "git_parents": ["11f26990fc5b55314fb37f5cf09275dad48ccc08"], "node": "1b9b17018a0762e0afcf644a363344739556113e", "parents": ["6e385c8621f1c9a7e9d5e032adf71309834a3168"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dana Keeler \u003cdkeeler@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055974 - pkcs11testmodule: support setting/changing a password r=nkulatova\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D312841\n", "files": ["netwerk/test/unit/test_he_client_auth_pause.js", "security/manager/ssl/ipcclientcerts/src/lib.rs", "security/manager/ssl/osclientcerts/src/lib.rs", "security/manager/ssl/rsclientcerts-util/src/error.rs", "security/manager/ssl/rsclientcerts/src/cryptoki.rs", "security/manager/ssl/rsclientcerts/src/lib.rs", "security/manager/ssl/rsclientcerts/src/manager.rs", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/pkcs11testmodule/src/backend.rs", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/pkcs11testmodule/src/lib.rs", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_pkcs11_module.js", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_pkcs11_module_client_auth.js", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_pkcs11_token.js"], "git_node": "bf87ef030b0893ef8cdfde82a9fb14fd01ff2180", "git_parents": ["155e9a4925229d96be581022f02091504d394d9c"], "node": "2fa8d0e9460e57dbc97f30a5be7fb7f7d491280a", "parents": ["1b9b17018a0762e0afcf644a363344739556113e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dana Keeler \u003cdkeeler@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2040060 - attempting to get a token when it