90d8507ba1a43a1dd39"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Drew Willcoxon \u003cadw@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2056936 - Disable the `context_id` metric in `quick-suggest`-related pings and disable the `quick-suggest-deletion-request` ping. r=daisuke,efixler,urlbar-reviewers\n\nDisable the `context_id` metric, which is sent in the `quick-suggest` and\n`quick-suggest-deletion-request` pings.\n\nDisable the `quick-suggest-deletion-request` ping.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318003\n", "files": ["browser/components/urlbar/metrics.yaml", "browser/components/urlbar/pings.yaml", "browser/components/urlbar/private/AmpSuggestions.sys.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/quicksuggest/browser/browser.toml", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/quicksuggest/browser/head.js"], "git_node": "55ca46bb629618c30825f06cf0e129d7fce2fc90", "git_parents": ["8a73db0eec8bb6c208e3b38b237d42693b4511d5"], "node": "4ab7e82994071b381081a163cfa5f9c75ac9dabd", "parents": ["55ebea1120e8e917d3918c1b63aa69adb01fcd92"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andrew McCreight \u003ccontinuation@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061896 - Use getService instead of createInstance for various singleton components. r=necko-reviewers,geckoview-reviewers,devtools-reviewers,places-reviewers,firefox-desktop-core-reviewers ,dom-worker-reviewers,valentin,bomsy,mossop,edenchuang,ohall\n\nThese are all marked as singleton components, so use the nicer getService.\n\nFor the dom/cache/test/xpcshell/head.js change: supposedly calling\ndo_GetService() without using it makes the linter mad, so instead\ninitialize it via Services.storage.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317210\n", "files": ["browser/components/BrowserGlue.sys.mjs", "devtools/shared/commands/target/tests/browser_target_command_various_descriptors.js", "dom/cache/test/xpcshell/head.js", "dom/geolocation/test/unit/test_geolocation_reset_accuracy.js", "dom/ipc/tests/browser_wpi_base.js", "mobile/shared/components/geckoview/GeckoViewStartup.sys.mjs", "netwerk/test/unit/test_nestedabout_serialize.js", "storage/test/gtest/storage_test_harness.cpp", "toolkit/components/places/tests/unit/test_history_notifications.js", "toolkit/modules/WindowsLaunchOnLogin.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "faa6d75a02761a5e324cc1e558a79f9120e8fa45", "git_parents": ["55ca46bb629618c30825f06cf0e129d7fce2fc90"], "node": "e1c14ed58e05b0c12d615972cb7c4ad0ca388694", "parents": ["4ab7e82994071b381081a163cfa5f9c75ac9dabd"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057444 - Make TryToReplaySurface work on arbitrary DrawTargets. r=lsalzman\n\nThe implementation living in DrawTargetRecording.cpp is slightly\nannoying but makes things easier, wdyt?\n\nAlternative would be to move this to a\nSourceSurfaceRecording::TryToReplayInto(DrawTarget*) or so.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318194\n", "files": ["gfx/2d/2D.h", "gfx/2d/DrawTargetRecording.cpp", "gfx/2d/DrawTargetRecording.h"], "git_node": "3a18748d9a8c94a0f119f1031b8bd28161107cd9", "git_parents": ["faa6d75a02761a5e324cc1e558a79f9120e8fa45"], "node": "63587df02f818487c51a4cdfa08c39635a546a04", "parents": ["e1c14ed58e05b0c12d615972cb7c4ad0ca388694"], "tags": []}, {"author": "nickgrato \u003cngrato@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2062842 - [Monitor Agent][FE] save text change and button styles r=yjamora,fluent-reviewers,bolsson\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318002\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-tasks/ai-tasks.mjs", "browser/locales-preview/aiWindow.ftl"], "git_node": "2b6890afe1de389b8b10cf7a08a4a7f4f2d4907f", "git_parents": ["3a18748d9a8c94a0f119f1031b8bd28161107cd9"], "node": "31578b9868a65303682205737fd90376634d2bb0", "parents": ["63587df02f818487c51a4cdfa08c39635a546a04"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Niklas Baumgardner \u003cnbaumgardner@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2052264 - Add screenshot functionality to share panel. r=jprickett\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316873\n", "files": ["browser/components/screenshots/metrics.yaml", "browser/components/sharing/SharePageAction.sys.mjs", "browser/components/sharing/tests/browser/browser.toml", "browser/components/sharing/tests/browser/browser_testSharePanelScreenshot.js", "browser/components/sharing/tests/browser/head.js"], "git_node": "71a28490cbd6db66d955d4031ca08b9dd8b88e72", "git_parents": ["2b6890afe1de389b8b10cf7a08a4a7f4f2d4907f"], "node": "146879302c09129bd8e5c5ab2d13b1d5ab1c4b9d", "parents": ["31578b9868a65303682205737fd90376634d2bb0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Naz\u0131m Can Alt\u0131nova \u003ccanaltinova@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2062931 - Rename LoadErrorMarker's name to avoid clashing with ErrorMarker r=alwu\n\nThe profiler marker names should be unique because this is how they are\ndifferentiated in the frontend. It looks like two marker structs were\nusing the same name here.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318078\n", "files": ["dom/media/utils/MediaProfilerMarkers.h"], "git_node": "f082ea36d22cacb60aec89f94bdca3105b839e16", "git_parents": ["71a28490cbd6db66d955d4031ca08b9dd8b88e72"], "node": "092533cb8c587b35c6030ade90c842acd82928c3", "parents": ["146879302c09129bd8e5c5ab2d13b1d5ab1c4b9d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Chris DuPuis \u003ccdupuis@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058020 - Use Windows Runtime API to find MSIX app launch method r=aborondo,win-reviewers,browser-installer-reviewers,mossop,nrishel\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316649\n", "files": ["browser/app/winlauncher/LauncherProcessWin.cpp", "browser/app/winlauncher/moz.build", "browser/installer/windows/msix/AppxManifest.xml.in"], "git_node": "eb83dec2a163218815eb39ab5d65579f53773798", "git_parents": ["f082ea36d22cacb60aec89f94bdca3105b839e16"], "node": "1daff9222100d975623c54535ce4b6e6cabe8697", "parents": ["092533cb8c587b35c6030ade90c842acd82928c3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jan Varga \u003cjvarga@igalia.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057579 - Avoid temporary CSSUnitValue allocations in CSSTranslate::ToMatrix; r=emilio,firefox-style-system-reviewers\n\nFactor the internal unit conversion out of CSSNumericValue::To() into\nToStyleUnitValue(), allowing internal callers to access the converted\nStyleUnitValue directly without creating a temporary CSSUnitValue.\n\nUse the new helper in CSSTranslate::ToMatrix() and add operator-\u003e to\nStyleOptional for convenient access to the contained value.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318134\n", "files": ["layout/style/typedom/CSSNumericValue.cpp", "layout/style/typedom/CSSNumericValue.h", "layout/style/typedom/CSSTranslate.cpp", "servo/ports/geckolib/cbindgen.toml"], "git_node": "c230a7d123974a616efefb0b0cd9c4daacca2c1e", "git_parents": ["eb83dec2a163218815eb39ab5d65579f53773798"], "node": "e639fdd8cc3fd1e4df9c35455e4dd1e568c27a33", "parents": ["1daff9222100d975623c54535ce4b6e6cabe8697"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Naz\u0131m Can Alt\u0131nova \u003ccanaltinova@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2054010 - Convert free-text profiler marker fields to unique strings so URLs get sanitized r=mstange,profiler-reviewers,joel\n\nThe text, flow text, and log markers all carry developer-provided\nfree-text fields that might embed URLs. These fields were declared with\nMS::Format::String, which the profiler front-end\ndoesn't sanitize.\n\nSwitch these fields to MS::Format::UniqueString so their contents are\nadded to the profile's shared string table. The front-end runs\nremoveURLs over the whole string table when sanitizing.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D311475\n", "files": ["browser/extensions/newtab/test/xpcshell/test_TelemetryFeed.js", "mozglue/baseprofiler/public/BaseAndGeckoProfilerDetail.h", "mozglue/baseprofiler/public/BaseProfilerMarkers.h", "mozglue/tests/TestBaseProfiler.cpp", "taskcluster/kinds/fetch/toolchains.yml", "toolkit/components/backgroundtasks/tests/browser/browser_xpcom_graph_wait.js", "toolkit/components/telemetry/tests/unit/test_UserInteraction_annotations.js", "tools/profiler/public/FlowMarkers.h", "tools/profiler/tests/gtest/GeckoProfiler.cpp", "tools/profiler/tests/xpcshell/test_addProfilerMarker.js", "xpcom/base/Logging.cpp"], "git_node": "56fd6d71a3c23a05eac59eae8cd4d7f55829ef4c", "git_parents": ["c230a7d123974a616efefb0b0cd9c4daacca2c1e"], "node": "d05bea4c0fd3414e2548c3dc633c9c9c72372338", "parents": ["e639fdd8cc3fd1e4df9c35455e4dd1e568c27a33"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Christopher DiPersio \u003ccdipersio@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2062739 - Limit the number of sessions to use in first-run memories generation r=cmurray\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317932\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/models/memories/MemoriesConstants.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/memories/MemoriesManager.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/tests/browser/browser_MemoriesManager.js"], "git_node": "d5014a91f0285af4394676a2bc5ada6b02661a63", "git_parents": ["56fd6d71a3c23a05eac59eae8cd4d7f55829ef4c"], "node": "d7646de8902d72d7c79c2a56349f19e904eac96d", "parents": ["d05bea4c0fd3414e2548c3dc633c9c9c72372338"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lando \u003clando@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Merge mozilla-central to autoland\n", "files": ["browser/app/profile/firefox.js", "toolkit/modules/moz.build"], "git_node": "4579d760243acb23ee096e25aeeaad2cb5c69156", "git_parents": ["d5014a91f0285af4394676a2bc5ada6b02661a63", "6cee80f87168d5aabd9e343099e2a8e5535e5320"], "node": "d909002bace16849127e9c914e137e0ad88a1eec", "parents": ["d7646de8902d72d7c79c2a56349f19e904